<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:05.080" end="00:00:07.599" style="s2">So strange. Why would I have a dream like that?</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.220" end="00:00:08.879" style="s2">Could it be tired</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.220" end="00:00:19.679" style="s2">Dad!</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.319" end="00:00:23.379" style="s2">Dad, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.879" end="00:00:27.780" style="s2">I&#39;m fine, I&#39;m fine</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.438" end="00:00:29.679" style="s2">It&#39;s the same old story</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.280" end="00:00:32.298" style="s2">The doctor says he needs surgery immediately</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.840" end="00:00:33.599" style="s2">Mom, Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.000" end="00:00:36.060" style="s2">I&#39;ll get the surgery money together as soon as I can!</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.080" end="00:00:37.679" style="s2">Nora</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.840" end="00:00:40.860" style="s2">Your dad and I aren&#39;t your birth parents</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.120" end="00:00:42.599" style="s2">For you to go through all this for us</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.620" end="00:00:43.360" style="s2">my heart just</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.420" end="00:00:43.920" style="s2">Mom!</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.319" end="00:00:46.480" style="s2">What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.798" end="00:00:48.580" style="s2">Three years ago</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.679" end="00:00:51.099" style="s2">I was seriously injured and my face was ruined</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.780" end="00:00:52.840" style="s2">you saved me</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.480" end="00:00:56.539" style="s2">You even spent all your savings on my reconstructive surgery</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.500" end="00:00:59.560" style="s2">It&#39;s only right that I&#39;d do anything for you</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.679" end="00:01:01.158" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.260" end="00:01:02.879" style="s2">you have your own parents and family</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.220" end="00:01:04.120" style="s2">Don&#39;t you want to find them?</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.459" end="00:01:05.780" style="s2">I don&#39;t remember anything from before</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.860" end="00:01:07.179" style="s2">Besides</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.200" end="00:01:08.980" style="s2">my appearance has changed so much now</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.000" end="00:01:09.700" style="s2">Even if they found me</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.720" end="00:01:11.279" style="s2">they probably wouldn&#39;t recognize me</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.719" end="00:01:16.100" style="s2">Oh, shoot!</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.279" end="00:01:17.920" style="s2">I can&#39;t talk, I have this huge</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.640" end="00:01:20.118" style="s2">I&#39;m heading out!</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.219" end="00:01:21.719" style="s2">Hey, Nono</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.738" end="00:01:23.140" style="s2">Eat breakfast before you go</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.200" end="00:01:24.618" style="s2">Yeah, eat before you go</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.420" end="00:01:25.760" style="s2">Mom</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.779" end="00:01:26.980" style="s2">You guys take your time and eat</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.999" end="00:01:28.080" style="s2">Oh, this kid</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.559" end="00:01:30.338" style="s2">Mr. Drake!</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.559" end="00:01:33.178" style="s2">Alright</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.660" end="00:01:34.779" style="s2">Here&#39;s your mission for today</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.420" end="00:01:36.238" style="s2">Ruin this wedding</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.518" end="00:01:38.458" style="s2">Ruin a wedding?</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.860" end="00:01:39.838" style="s2">That&#39;s vile!</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.860" end="00:01:40.860" style="s2">Even a dog wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.880" end="00:01:41.600" style="s2">Fifty grand</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.600" end="00:01:47.618" style="s2">I&#39;ll do it!</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.640" end="00:01:49.338" style="s2">If a dog won&#39;t, I will</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.360" end="00:01:50.600" style="s2">This is my jam!</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.838" end="00:01:52.260" style="s2">Mr. Drake, don&#39;t you worry</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.398" end="00:01:53.880" style="s2">When it comes to ruining weddings</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.260" end="00:01:56.118" style="s2">I am a professional!</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.219" end="00:02:03.738" style="s2">Elaine, are you ready!</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.958" end="00:02:07.640" style="s2">Dad, I&#39;m Nora now</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.898" end="00:02:08.640" style="s2">I know</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.798" end="00:02:09.298" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.480" end="00:02:10.398" style="s2">It&#39;s just us now</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.499" end="00:02:11.719" style="s2">Just father and daughter</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.920" end="00:02:14.678" style="s2">Dad has finally waited for this day</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.279" end="00:02:16.980" style="s2">I thought killing Nora would solve everything</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.999" end="00:02:18.238" style="s2">That it would all be perfect</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.678" end="00:02:20.260" style="s2">But I never expected the shares in that</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.279" end="00:02:22.398" style="s2">Little bitch&#39;s name to be locked by her DNA</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.559" end="00:02:26.059" style="s2">For three years the board has refused to recognize me</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.480" end="00:02:28.159" style="s2">But you&#39;re about to marry Elliot Prescot</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.700" end="00:02:29.719" style="s2">With his family&#39;s backing</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.738" end="00:02:30.999" style="s2">The board can&#39;t ignore you</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.360" end="00:02:32.099" style="s2">They&#39;ll have to acknowledge</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.118" end="00:02:32.738" style="s2">Your identity</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.518" end="00:02:34.178" style="s2">That&#39;s right</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.540" end="00:02:35.719" style="s2">The wedding is about to start</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.838" end="00:02:37.279" style="s2">Let Dad walk you down the aisle</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.559" end="00:02:47.999" style="s2">Yes, this is the place</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.480" end="00:02:54.838" style="s2">How&#39;s that thing I asked you to do?</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.999" end="00:02:55.659" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry about it</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.798" end="00:02:56.958" style="s2">The intermediary said the person taking</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.980" end="00:02:58.659" style="s2">This job is an absolute professional</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.678" end="00:03:00.940" style="s2">Let&#39;s have a round of applause for the bride and groom!</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.440" end="00:03:15.338" style="s2">So beautiful</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.458" end="00:03:16.820" style="s2">Congratulations</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.838" end="00:03:18.039" style="s2">She looks gorgeous.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.019" end="00:03:23.800" style="s2">Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.238" end="00:03:26.000" style="s2">I am entrusting my daughter to you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.880" end="00:03:36.080" style="s2">And now, for our beautiful bride.</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.238" end="00:03:37.580" style="s2">Are you willing to marry the groom?</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.599" end="00:03:39.000" style="s2">Mr. Elliot Prescott?</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.159" end="00:03:39.899" style="s2">I do!</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.118" end="00:03:42.000" style="s2">Congratulations!</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.560" end="00:03:43.339" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.738" end="00:03:46.719" style="s2">Then, Mr. Groom, are you willing to take Nora as your wife?</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.959" end="00:03:49.700" style="s2">You brat!</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.779" end="00:03:50.899" style="s2">If you dare say no,</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.019" end="00:03:52.899" style="s2">I&#39;ll die right here for you!</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.800" end="00:03:56.618" style="s2">He&#39;s not willing!</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.820" end="00:04:06.719" style="s2">He&#39;s not willing!</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.779" end="00:04:13.820" style="s2">That&#39;s her. Who is this?</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.880" end="00:04:14.858" style="s2">How ridiculous!</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.140" end="00:04:16.260" style="s2">She&#39;s finally here.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.519" end="00:04:17.058" style="s2">It&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.140" end="00:04:19.918" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.219" end="00:04:22.459" style="s2">What gives you the right to say my son is unwilling?</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.798" end="00:04:24.738" style="s2">Because your son said he only loves me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.940" end="00:04:26.058" style="s2">He won&#39;t marry anyone but me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.019" end="00:04:28.678" style="s2">Who is that?</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.779" end="00:04:29.320" style="s2">Oh my God.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.418" end="00:04:31.498" style="s2">Is this about some affair of the Prescott heir?</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.839" end="00:04:33.339" style="s2">Didn&#39;t they say he stays away from women?</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.159" end="00:04:35.899" style="s2">Mrs. Prescott threatened to kill herself,</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.918" end="00:04:37.099" style="s2">so he had to agree to marry</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.118" end="00:04:38.200" style="s2">the Crane family&#39;s daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.539" end="00:04:40.339" style="s2">So it&#39;s not that he stays away from women.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.839" end="00:04:42.320" style="s2">Shut up!</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.959" end="00:04:43.738" style="s2">You crazy woman!</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.760" end="00:04:45.080" style="s2">How dare you cling to my Elliot?</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.200" end="00:04:46.399" style="s2">Security, throw her out!</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.618" end="00:04:52.678" style="s2">Elliot, say something!</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.959" end="00:04:54.719" style="s2">Have you forgotten our vows of eternal love?</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.178" end="00:04:56.498" style="s2">Are you just going to break them all?</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.959" end="00:04:58.099" style="s2">What about our vows?</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.558" end="00:05:00.339" style="s2">Not a bad actress, a real pro.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.539" end="00:05:02.959" style="s2">Wait!</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.558" end="00:05:04.678" style="s2">Don&#39;t you dare touch her!</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.700" end="00:05:05.498" style="s2">Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.399" end="00:05:07.498" style="s2">Elliot, what do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.459" end="00:05:09.320" style="s2">You heard me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.539" end="00:05:11.640" style="s2">The wedding&#39;s off.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.659" end="00:05:12.640" style="s2">I love someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.839" end="00:05:13.820" style="s2">You&#39;ll be compensated.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.060" end="00:05:14.560" style="s2">I object. I object.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.580" end="00:05:14.678" style="s2">I object.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.700" end="00:05:15.019" style="s2">I object I object</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.358" end="00:05:17.140" style="s2">but our engagement</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.418" end="00:05:20.320" style="s2">like it or not</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.378" end="00:05:21.878" style="s2">you are marrying me today</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.358" end="00:05:23.459" style="s2">that&#39;s right Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.940" end="00:05:25.918" style="s2">this marriage unites our families</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.320" end="00:05:27.738" style="s2">this has nothing to do with feelings</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.758" end="00:05:29.758" style="s2">this is not something you can just call off</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.039" end="00:05:31.560" style="s2">Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.358" end="00:05:33.378" style="s2">you don&#39;t even like women</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.140" end="00:05:35.640" style="s2">so he suddenly has a lover</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.140" end="00:05:37.519" style="s2">or did you just hire this woman</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.118" end="00:05:40.320" style="s2">she knows this job is impossible</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.438" end="00:05:46.238" style="s2">What is this?!</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.699" end="00:05:47.378" style="s2">What is happening?</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.399" end="00:05:47.738" style="s2">Look!</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.878" end="00:05:49.039" style="s2">Is she forcing herself on him?</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.539" end="00:05:50.359" style="s2">Play along</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.577" end="00:05:54.897" style="s2">Elliot Prescott&#39;s Assistant. What? That was Mr. Prescott&#39;s first kiss!</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.017" end="00:05:55.817" style="s2">Disgraceful!</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.957" end="00:05:57.178" style="s2">Absolutely shameless!</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.617" end="00:06:00.037" style="s2">Well, Mrs. Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.117" end="00:06:02.097" style="s2">This should be enough to prove I&#39;m not just some plant</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.117" end="00:06:02.518" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.857" end="00:06:05.518" style="s2">Now</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.297" end="00:06:07.597" style="s2">do you still want to marry me?</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.878" end="00:06:08.657" style="s2">Yes!</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.958" end="00:06:10.097" style="s2">And no matter what</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.278" end="00:06:11.898" style="s2">I will be your wife!</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.357" end="00:06:13.217" style="s2">Miss Crane</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.237" end="00:06:14.717" style="s2">you can actually tolerate this?</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.938" end="00:06:15.477" style="s2">You!</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.018" end="00:06:16.878" style="s2">Elliot!</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.138" end="00:06:18.477" style="s2">Elliot, after all of this</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.498" end="00:06:20.597" style="s2">are you still not satisfied?</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.018" end="00:06:22.237" style="s2">Mark my words</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.417" end="00:06:23.518" style="s2">If you cancel this wedding</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.537" end="00:06:24.758" style="s2">you&#39;ll be planning my funeral</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.177" end="00:06:27.057" style="s2">What should I do now?</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.477" end="00:06:28.057" style="s2">Ah!</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.318" end="00:06:30.357" style="s2">Mrs. Prescott, I&#39;m pregnant</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.878" end="00:06:32.057" style="s2">It&#39;s Elliot&#39;s child</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.498" end="00:06:34.958" style="s2">You can&#39;t abandon your own grandchild, can you?</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.297" end="00:06:36.198" style="s2">What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.477" end="00:06:37.438" style="s2">Impossible!</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.018" end="00:06:42.318" style="s2">To tell a lie like that. She&#39;s got some nerve</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.766" end="00:06:46.583" style="s2">Elliot, is she really pregnant?</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.001" end="00:06:49.184" style="s2">Uh, she</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.167" end="00:06:51.234" style="s2">Mrs. Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.383" end="00:06:53.684" style="s2">Elliot actually doesn&#39;t know about my pregnancy yet</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.302" end="00:06:56.667" style="s2">The doctor said this baby is already a month old</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.867" end="00:06:59.184" style="s2">Are you planning to have me abort it</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.234" end="00:06:59.867" style="s2">or are you planning</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.883" end="00:07:01.967" style="s2">to let your own grandson be born out of wedlock?</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.717" end="00:07:03.802" style="s2">Well, this puts her in a bind</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.867" end="00:07:05.701" style="s2">If Mrs. Prescott wasn&#39;t so desperate for a grandson</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.717" end="00:07:07.001" style="s2">she never would&#39;ve rushed her son into this marriage</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.018" end="00:07:07.833" style="s2">Now that she&#39;s pregnant</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.850" end="00:07:09.184" style="s2">how could Mrs. Prescott bring herself to make her have an abortion?</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.201" end="00:07:10.251" style="s2">But what about the bride?</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.268" end="00:07:11.100" style="s2">They can&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.283" end="00:07:12.400" style="s2">an illegitimate child?</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.518" end="00:07:14.501" style="s2">His position as heir isn&#39;t set in stone;</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.768" end="00:07:15.934" style="s2">he can&#39;t afford any scandals</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.068" end="00:07:18.217" style="s2">Mrs. Prescott, don&#39;t listen to this bitch&#39;s lies!</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.400" end="00:07:19.900" style="s2">How could she possibly be pregnant?</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.167" end="00:07:22.552" style="s2">This is my pregnancy report</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.934" end="00:07:24.484" style="s2">See for yourselves if you don&#39;t believe me</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.150" end="00:07:25.751" style="s2">Give it to me!</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.768" end="00:07:27.201" style="s2">What does this have to do with you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.434" end="00:07:29.552" style="s2">Give it to me!</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.723" end="00:07:31.506" style="s2">Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.250" end="00:07:35.250" style="s2">My baby!</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.719" end="00:07:36.518" style="s2">You monster!</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.535" end="00:07:38.119" style="s2">You killed my baby!</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.335" end="00:07:42.567" style="s2">My grandson!</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.693" end="00:07:44.510" style="s2">No, it wasn&#39;t me!</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.528" end="00:07:45.961" style="s2">I had nothing to do with it!</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.595" end="00:07:47.244" style="s2">Wake up!</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.327" end="00:07:47.879" style="s2">Are you alright?</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.577" end="00:07:51.994" style="s2">So she was acting all along</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.744" end="00:07:54.293" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.528" end="00:07:55.879" style="s2">I&#39;m getting you to the hospital right now</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.043" end="00:07:58.028" style="s2">The wedding is off!</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.728" end="00:08:00.912" style="s2">Elliot!</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.337" end="00:08:13.719" style="s2">Mr. Prescott, you can put me down now</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.219" end="00:08:14.599" style="s2">Oh</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.817" end="00:08:19.219" style="s2">That&#39;s a lot of blood</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.239" end="00:08:20.139" style="s2">Are you sure you&#39;re okay?</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.417" end="00:08:20.759" style="s2">Relax</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.057" end="00:08:21.619" style="s2">It&#39;s part of the act</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.917" end="00:08:22.557" style="s2">Just some chicken blood</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.957" end="00:08:23.677" style="s2">Chicken blood?</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.599" end="00:08:25.457" style="s2">Resourceful</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.837" end="00:08:26.297" style="s2">Of course</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.437" end="00:08:27.259" style="s2">I&#39;m a professional</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.317" end="00:08:27.658" style="s2">So?</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.817" end="00:08:28.739" style="s2">Was the mission a success</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.837" end="00:08:29.538" style="s2">or not?</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.619" end="00:08:39.577" style="s2">You turned my wedding into a complete mess</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.057" end="00:08:42.259" style="s2">and you have the nerve to say it went well?</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.278" end="00:08:44.577" style="s2">Hey, the job got done, didn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.797" end="00:08:46.898" style="s2">I even had to give up my first kiss for this</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.379" end="00:08:53.917" style="s2">So</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.197" end="00:08:56.297" style="s2">it&#39;s not too much to ask for a little extra, right?</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.317" end="00:08:57.177" style="s2">Hey, hey, hey!</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.317" end="00:08:59.297" style="s2">That was our President&#39;s first kiss too</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.317" end="00:09:00.217" style="s2">So you&#39;re even</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.479" end="00:09:03.577" style="s2">But I made the Crane family my enemy for you</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.999" end="00:09:05.197" style="s2">Elaine is threatening me</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.577" end="00:09:07.119" style="s2">A hundred grand isn&#39;t that much to ask</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.139" end="00:09:07.859" style="s2">is it?</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.437" end="00:09:12.639" style="s2">How about ninety thousand?</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.077" end="00:09:17.297" style="s2">Fine, eighty thousand!</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.437" end="00:09:19.859" style="s2">I really can&#39;t go any lower!</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.739" end="00:09:21.499" style="s2">You&#39;re a Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.518" end="00:09:22.217" style="s2">for crying out loud</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.239" end="00:09:23.457" style="s2">You can&#39;t be this cheap</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.518" end="00:09:25.859" style="s2">If I&#39;d known the bride was a Crane</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.879" end="00:09:26.398" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.417" end="00:09:27.297" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you ten million</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.599" end="00:09:31.359" style="s2">Ten million!</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.797" end="00:09:33.879" style="s2">Oh my God, Mr. Prescott, you&#39;re incredible</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.018" end="00:09:34.879" style="s2">With ten million dollars</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.898" end="00:09:36.479" style="s2">I can pay off Dad&#39;s medical bills</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.499" end="00:09:36.979" style="s2">and there&#39;ll be enough to</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.999" end="00:09:37.297" style="s2">And</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.518" end="00:09:38.417" style="s2">On one condition</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.717" end="00:09:41.437" style="s2">Marry me</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.619" end="00:09:42.317" style="s2">Sir?!</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.557" end="00:09:43.239" style="s2">What?!</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.759" end="00:09:47.259" style="s2">Elliot, are you kidding me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.139" end="00:09:50.038" style="s2">I&#39;m serious</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.619" end="00:09:52.719" style="s2">I sell my skills, not my body!</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.739" end="00:09:53.959" style="s2">You&#39;re overthinking it</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.817" end="00:09:55.599" style="s2">After that</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.817" end="00:09:57.197" style="s2">everyone thinks we&#39;re involved</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.219" end="00:09:57.619" style="s2">If you leave</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.639" end="00:09:58.959" style="s2">they&#39;ll know it was an act</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.297" end="00:10:01.917" style="s2">We need to keep this going to avoid trouble</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.937" end="00:10:02.579" style="s2">So</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.817" end="00:10:04.197" style="s2">You&#39;re not really giving me a choice</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.219" end="00:10:04.677" style="s2">are you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.697" end="00:10:05.459" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.579" end="00:10:06.999" style="s2">This is a one-year contract</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.339" end="00:10:08.479" style="s2">We divorce after that</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.778" end="00:10:10.038" style="s2">And if you play your part well</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.317" end="00:10:11.538" style="s2">there&#39;s a bonus in it for you</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.898" end="00:10:13.639" style="s2">Just one year, and I can get</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.697" end="00:10:15.038" style="s2">two million dollars</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.417" end="00:10:16.959" style="s2">This is a pretty sweet deal</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.697" end="00:10:19.038" style="s2">Okay, deal</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.119" end="00:10:20.359" style="s2">But I&#39;ll need a deposit</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.817" end="00:10:26.859" style="s2">Payment received</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.879" end="00:10:26.979" style="s2">Payment received</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.999" end="00:10:27.917" style="s2">Payment received</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.139" end="00:10:29.739" style="s2">One hundred thousand dollars</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.259" end="00:10:32.119" style="s2">Mr. Prescott, you&#39;re so generous!</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.139" end="00:10:34.018" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna go home and tell my parents right now</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.759" end="00:10:35.538" style="s2">Stop</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.479" end="00:10:37.479" style="s2">You took the money</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.739" end="00:10:39.079" style="s2">Now you&#39;ll do things my way</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.979" end="00:10:40.239" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.297" end="00:10:40.959" style="s2">No buts</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.359" end="00:10:42.937" style="s2">Toby Quinn will take care of your parents</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.697" end="00:10:44.839" style="s2">By the way, what&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.359" end="00:10:45.917" style="s2">Nora</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.417" end="00:10:47.239" style="s2">Do you have your ID?</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.697" end="00:10:49.359" style="s2">Yes</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.677" end="00:10:50.119" style="s2">Good</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.238" end="00:10:51.239" style="s2">Let&#39;s go get the license</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.359" end="00:10:51.957" style="s2">What, now?</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.979" end="00:10:52.658" style="s2">Hey!</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.697" end="00:10:58.479" style="s2">Crashing the wedding was awful</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.739" end="00:11:00.197" style="s2">and now I&#39;m married to you</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.417" end="00:11:02.797" style="s2">Although it&#39;s a fake marriage</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.979" end="00:11:04.099" style="s2">it just feels weird</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.018" end="00:11:05.957" style="s2">I&#39;m becoming</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.259" end="00:11:07.278" style="s2">a bad person</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.898" end="00:11:10.038" style="s2">You&#39;re doing a good thing</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.057" end="00:11:13.239" style="s2">You&#39;re saving someone</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.177" end="00:11:16.778" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.658" end="00:11:20.518" style="s2">A baby?</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.219" end="00:11:24.057" style="s2">The baby&#39;s gone</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.917" end="00:11:26.739" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.417" end="00:11:28.599" style="s2">The baby&#39;s gone?</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.339" end="00:11:31.079" style="s2">Oh, what a terrible shame</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.459" end="00:11:32.177" style="s2">And at the end of the day</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.198" end="00:11:33.479" style="s2">this is all your fault</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.038" end="00:11:36.119" style="s2">Elaine is still waiting for an explanation from you</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.139" end="00:11:37.639" style="s2">Get your ass back here now!</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.139" end="00:11:38.639" style="s2">Got it</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.778" end="00:11:39.599" style="s2">I&#39;ll be right back</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.417" end="00:11:42.518" style="s2">Just as I thought</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.599" end="00:11:44.479" style="s2">My mother and the Cranes aren&#39;t going to back down</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.698" end="00:11:45.599" style="s2">Good thing we&#39;re married</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.719" end="00:11:46.278" style="s2">Ah, no</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.297" end="00:11:48.079" style="s2">We can&#39;t tell Mrs. Prescott we&#39;re married yet</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.359" end="00:11:49.139" style="s2">Just wait</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.297" end="00:11:50.797" style="s2">I&#39;ll get Elaine Crane to back down</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.839" end="00:11:52.677" style="s2">and I&#39;ll make Mrs. Prescott welcome me herself</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.817" end="00:11:53.698" style="s2">you can announce it</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.719" end="00:11:54.677" style="s2">It&#39;s not too late</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.898" end="00:11:56.158" style="s2">Are you sure you can do it?</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.417" end="00:11:57.198" style="s2">Of course</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.177" end="00:12:00.197" style="s2">Hmm, but to convince her</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.219" end="00:12:02.879" style="s2">we&#39;ll need some intimate contact</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.658" end="00:12:07.639" style="s2">Mr. Prescott, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.658" end="00:12:08.959" style="s2">fall in love with me, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.619" end="00:12:10.839" style="s2">I should be the one saying that</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.139" end="00:12:11.959" style="s2">You better not</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.979" end="00:12:12.719" style="s2">I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.739" end="00:12:14.079" style="s2">After all, I&#39;m a professional</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.099" end="00:12:14.839" style="s2">Let&#39;s go!</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.099" end="00:12:15.518" style="s2">Hmph</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.937" end="00:12:25.937" style="s2">Elliot said that woman, she lost the baby</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.197" end="00:12:28.219" style="s2">Aunt Eleanor!</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.579" end="00:12:29.459" style="s2">I didn&#39;t push her!</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.479" end="00:12:30.437" style="s2">It wasn&#39;t me!</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.979" end="00:12:32.719" style="s2">I know it wasn&#39;t you, sweetie</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.739" end="00:12:34.119" style="s2">Of course I don&#39;t blame you</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.937" end="00:12:36.079" style="s2">It&#39;s just a shame</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.459" end="00:12:37.278" style="s2">never mind</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.459" end="00:12:38.278" style="s2">After all</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.538" end="00:12:40.917" style="s2">the existence of that child was disgraceful</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.099" end="00:12:42.359" style="s2">It&#39;s better that it&#39;s gone</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.379" end="00:12:44.959" style="s2">Hahaha, my dear in-law</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.119" end="00:12:46.197" style="s2">if you want a grandchild</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.219" end="00:12:47.437" style="s2">it&#39;s not that hard</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.658" end="00:12:49.557" style="s2">Our Elaine can give you one, too</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.937" end="00:12:51.639" style="s2">Although Elliot has done me wrong</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.018" end="00:12:52.879" style="s2">but I still love him</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.797" end="00:12:55.937" style="s2">As long as you don&#39;t mind</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.119" end="00:12:57.959" style="s2">I am still willing to be your daughter-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.359" end="00:12:59.038" style="s2">Good!</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.119" end="00:13:00.318" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t be happier</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.417" end="00:13:01.979" style="s2">I&#39;ll make sure our Elliot treats you well</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.318" end="00:13:02.719" style="s2">Yes</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.259" end="00:13:05.079" style="s2">Madam, Mr. Elliot is back</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.459" end="00:13:09.197" style="s2">Elliot!</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.259" end="00:13:10.759" style="s2">Why would you bring this woman here?</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.038" end="00:13:11.959" style="s2">Mrs. Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.057" end="00:13:13.479" style="s2">I really can&#39;t live without Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.719" end="00:13:15.297" style="s2">Please, just let us be together</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.639" end="00:13:17.518" style="s2">That&#39;s right, Mom</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.697" end="00:13:19.697" style="s2">If you absolutely must force me to get married</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.898" end="00:13:21.959" style="s2">then the one I marry will be Nora</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.038" end="00:13:25.417" style="s2">You bastard!</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.139" end="00:13:27.139" style="s2">Her child is gone</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.498" end="00:13:28.917" style="s2">What&#39;s the point of marrying her?</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.057" end="00:13:31.177" style="s2">I had her looked into</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.358" end="00:13:33.417" style="s2">She&#39;s just some girl from a rough part of town</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.457" end="00:13:35.317" style="s2">How could she ever compare to Elaine?</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.437" end="00:13:38.118" style="s2">Mrs. Prescott, you can&#39;t say that</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.258" end="00:13:40.557" style="s2">My baby might be gone</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.778" end="00:13:42.258" style="s2">but Elliot only wants me</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.297" end="00:13:43.498" style="s2">As long as you want a grandson</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.538" end="00:13:44.957" style="s2">you&#39;ll have to accept me</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.697" end="00:13:46.358" style="s2">Right, Elliot?</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.738" end="00:13:47.417" style="s2">Uh, yes</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.837" end="00:13:48.217" style="s2">Mom</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.437" end="00:13:50.358" style="s2">the only person I&#39;m going to be with is Nora</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.618" end="00:13:52.618" style="s2">If you insist on forcing me to marry Elaine</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.658" end="00:13:54.238" style="s2">then the Prescott name dies with me</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.538" end="00:13:54.917" style="s2">You!</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.498" end="00:13:55.837" style="s2">Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.856" end="00:13:57.217" style="s2">why are you doing this to me?</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.437" end="00:14:00.118" style="s2">Mrs. Prescott said you&#39;ve liked me since we were kids</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.498" end="00:14:00.878" style="s2">Otherwise</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.898" end="00:14:02.478" style="s2">you wouldn&#39;t have agreed to our engagement</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.139" end="00:14:03.917" style="s2">That&#39;s right</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.358" end="00:14:05.998" style="s2">I took you to the Cranes when you were little</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.778" end="00:14:09.358" style="s2">You were the one who said you&#39;d marry Elaine when you grew up</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.697" end="00:14:11.417" style="s2">You&#39;re the one who wanted this engagement</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.457" end="00:14:13.118" style="s2">How can you go back on your word?</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.898" end="00:14:14.417" style="s2">So</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.778" end="00:14:16.278" style="s2">it wasn&#39;t an arranged marriage</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.518" end="00:14:17.858" style="s2">Elliot had a change of heart</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.797" end="00:14:19.577" style="s2">Engagement?</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.837" end="00:14:21.197" style="s2">Yes</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.738" end="00:14:24.618" style="s2">I did say when I was little that I wanted to marry Elaine Crane</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.317" end="00:14:26.597" style="s2">Elliot, come play with me</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.717" end="00:14:28.238" style="s2">Young Elliot Prescott, stop following me. I don&#39;t want to play with you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.397" end="00:14:30.596" style="s2">A snake!</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.426" end="00:14:35.026" style="s2">Mrs. Wang, don&#39;t be scared</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.186" end="00:14:36.105" style="s2">It&#39;s just a toy</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.705" end="00:14:37.766" style="s2">Okay, okay, okay</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.945" end="00:14:38.845" style="s2">Thank you, Miss Nora</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.825" end="00:14:43.985" style="s2">Look, you&#39;re our guest</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.125" end="00:14:45.605" style="s2">and I promised my mom I&#39;d play with you</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.965" end="00:14:47.066" style="s2">But since you don&#39;t want to</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.205" end="00:14:48.566" style="s2">I&#39;m going to go practice piano</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.686" end="00:14:50.465" style="s2">Hey!</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.526" end="00:14:57.306" style="s2">Elliot?</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.386" end="00:14:58.605" style="s2">What are you daydreaming about?</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.985" end="00:14:59.845" style="s2">Mom, when I grow up</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.865" end="00:15:00.985" style="s2">I&#39;m going to marry Nora</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.546" end="00:15:02.407" style="s2">Nora, wait for me!</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.426" end="00:15:03.646" style="s2">I wanna play with you!</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.085" end="00:15:10.205" style="s2">But all these years, the Cranes were in Nancheng</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.766" end="00:15:12.225" style="s2">I hadn&#39;t seen her in over a decade</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.886" end="00:15:14.667" style="s2">I only saw her again three years ago</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.546" end="00:15:23.325" style="s2">Elaine, she&#39;s finally here in Haicheng</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.766" end="00:15:25.066" style="s2">I wonder what she&#39;s like now</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.365" end="00:15:26.407" style="s2">Miss Crane, your water</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.926" end="00:15:32.325" style="s2">This outfit was custom-made!</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.605" end="00:15:34.386" style="s2">I&#39;m supposed to meet Shiyu in this!</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.407" end="00:15:35.886" style="s2">How dare you spill water on me?!</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.225" end="00:15:37.306" style="s2">I&#39;m so sorry, Miss Crane</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.325" end="00:15:38.105" style="s2">I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.125" end="00:15:39.146" style="s2">wipe it for you right now</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.167" end="00:15:39.845" style="s2">Kneel</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.566" end="00:15:41.426" style="s2">And wipe it</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.886" end="00:15:42.667" style="s2">Okay</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.285" end="00:15:48.945" style="s2">I never thought she&#39;d become like this</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.086" end="00:15:51.107" style="s2">So classless, so cruel</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.127" end="00:15:51.945" style="s2">Classless?</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.045" end="00:15:52.945" style="s2">Well, too bad</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.045" end="00:15:54.387" style="s2">The Elaine you&#39;re still hung up on</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.485" end="00:15:56.045" style="s2">The Song Tingxue from back then was</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.065" end="00:15:57.765" style="s2">burned to ashes in a fire long ago</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.045" end="00:15:59.907" style="s2">Elliot, whatever&#39;s become of her</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.985" end="00:16:02.107" style="s2">Elaine is still completely devoted to you</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.465" end="00:16:03.867" style="s2">How can you let her down like this?</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.887" end="00:16:04.627" style="s2">He&#39;s right</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.847" end="00:16:06.667" style="s2">Back when Elaine was in Southridge</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.686" end="00:16:08.565" style="s2">she was known for her incredible talent</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.245" end="00:16:09.667" style="s2">Back then</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.686" end="00:16:11.285" style="s2">her performance of The Crimson Fall</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.305" end="00:16:12.826" style="s2">captivated the entire city</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.407" end="00:16:17.065" style="s2">&#39;The Crimson Fall&#39; — why does that sound so familiar?</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.147" end="00:16:17.926" style="s2">Is that so?</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.285" end="00:16:19.426" style="s2">In the three years she&#39;s been back</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.445" end="00:16:21.186" style="s2">I haven&#39;t seen her display any of that talent</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.407" end="00:16:22.985" style="s2">Hah, that&#39;s simple enough</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.326" end="00:16:25.186" style="s2">I&#39;ll have Elaine play a piece for you right now</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.525" end="00:16:27.147" style="s2">I guarantee, once you hear her</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.167" end="00:16:28.945" style="s2">you&#39;ll regret calling off the wedding today</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.305" end="00:16:32.907" style="s2">Elaine, play for this brat</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.926" end="00:16:33.826" style="s2">Show him what he&#39;s missing</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.065" end="00:16:37.107" style="s2">&#39;The Crimson Fall&#39;?</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.186" end="00:16:38.485" style="s2">That&#39;s... that&#39;s Elaine Crane&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.945" end="00:16:40.387" style="s2">How am I supposed to play that?</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.647" end="00:16:41.545" style="s2">Haha, well</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.686" end="00:16:42.607" style="s2">Eleanor, here&#39;s the thing</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.147" end="00:16:43.745" style="s2">The thing is</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.765" end="00:16:46.647" style="s2">Elaine seriously injured her right hand three years ago</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.667" end="00:16:48.426" style="s2">She hasn&#39;t been able to play the piano since</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.087" end="00:16:49.965" style="s2">Yes, Mrs. Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.985" end="00:16:52.667" style="s2">I... I really wanted to play for you and Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.745" end="00:16:55.725" style="s2">but with this hand I just can&#39;t anymore</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.087" end="00:16:58.087" style="s2">But Whale Fall is mainly a left-hand piece</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.505" end="00:17:00.725" style="s2">As long as your right hand isn&#39;t completely immobile</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.745" end="00:17:01.826" style="s2">it won&#39;t affect your playing</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.366" end="00:17:08.045" style="s2">As long as you can move your right hand</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.465" end="00:17:09.686" style="s2">you should still be able to play</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.887" end="00:17:10.667" style="s2">Shut up!</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.887" end="00:17:12.705" style="s2">What does a country bumpkin like you know?</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.887" end="00:17:13.705" style="s2">Miss Crane</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.147" end="00:17:15.305" style="s2">your hand looks fine to me</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.765" end="00:17:16.505" style="s2">Even if it&#39;s injured</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.525" end="00:17:18.065" style="s2">it&#39;s most likely a minor one</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.565" end="00:17:19.985" style="s2">It might affect your playing a little</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.225" end="00:17:21.225" style="s2">but surely you can still play</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.245" end="00:17:21.745" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.465" end="00:17:25.586" style="s2">There, there, Elaine</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.725" end="00:17:26.586" style="s2">It&#39;s alright</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.167" end="00:17:28.106" style="s2">Even if you don&#39;t play well</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.127" end="00:17:29.265" style="s2">we won&#39;t blame you</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.887" end="00:17:31.866" style="s2">I...</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.426" end="00:17:34.586" style="s2">asked you to play, you refuse</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.667" end="00:17:36.245" style="s2">So is your talent just a sham?</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.745" end="00:17:39.045" style="s2">Mom, this girl you picked</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.065" end="00:17:40.245" style="s2">is just a fraud</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.045" end="00:17:44.785" style="s2">Whoa, whoa, Elaine is no fraud</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.167" end="00:17:46.826" style="s2">She&#39;s just been swamped with work!</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.627" end="00:17:50.465" style="s2">Three years isn&#39;t enough to forget &#39;Whale Fall&#39; entirely</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.866" end="00:17:51.866" style="s2">It&#39;s muscle memory</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.346" end="00:17:52.945" style="s2">You don&#39;t forget</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.705" end="00:17:56.225" style="s2">You make it sound so easy</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.305" end="00:17:57.485" style="s2">What, can you play it</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.606" end="00:17:58.745" style="s2">Maybe I actually can</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.907" end="00:17:59.545" style="s2">I don&#39;t know why</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.565" end="00:18:01.505" style="s2">but whenever I hear the word &#39;Whale Fall&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.647" end="00:18:03.985" style="s2">a melody automatically pops into my head</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.705" end="00:18:05.485" style="s2">Oh, really?</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.765" end="00:18:06.426" style="s2">In that case</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.445" end="00:18:07.667" style="s2">how about we make a bet?</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.045" end="00:18:09.907" style="s2">If you can play &quot;Whale Fall&quot; completely</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.205" end="00:18:12.305" style="s2">I&#39;ll walk away and he&#39;s all yours</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.985" end="00:18:14.985" style="s2">But if you fail</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.045" end="00:18:17.346" style="s2">you leave this city and stay away from Elliot for good</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.445" end="00:18:18.106" style="s2">Do you dare?</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.127" end="00:18:18.765" style="s2">No</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.965" end="00:18:19.926" style="s2">Absolutely not</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.505" end="00:18:22.147" style="s2">Auntie</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.167" end="00:18:24.705" style="s2">please. It&#39;s not that I&#39;m afraid to lose</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.725" end="00:18:27.866" style="s2">I just can&#39;t stand losing to someone so beneath me</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.045" end="00:18:30.945" style="s2">This stalemate is getting us nowhere</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.965" end="00:18:31.705" style="s2">Fine</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.965" end="00:18:33.667" style="s2">We&#39;ll follow Elaine&#39;s suggestion</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.805" end="00:18:34.907" style="s2">A competition</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.366" end="00:18:36.667" style="s2">Mom, are you serious?</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.705" end="00:18:37.485" style="s2">That&#39;s right</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.765" end="00:18:40.065" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you my word:</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.245" end="00:18:41.785" style="s2">if she can play &#39;Whale Fall&#39;,</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.926" end="00:18:43.686" style="s2">I will no longer stand in your way</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.407" end="00:18:47.505" style="s2">Then I won&#39;t object to you two being together</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.067" end="00:18:48.847" style="s2">Really?</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.445" end="00:18:50.087" style="s2">Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.367" end="00:18:50.945" style="s2">I accept</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.407" end="00:18:52.147" style="s2">Trust me</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.347" end="00:18:52.985" style="s2">Good</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.087" end="00:18:54.305" style="s2">Let&#39;s move to the Pavilion</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.945" end="00:18:58.587" style="s2">Elaine</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.686" end="00:18:59.867" style="s2">what if she can really play?</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.147" end="00:19:00.965" style="s2">What should we do?</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.965" end="00:19:03.627" style="s2">Dad, have you forgotten?</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.847" end="00:19:05.147" style="s2">It&#39;s me we&#39;re talking about</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.485" end="00:19:07.225" style="s2">I only performed &#39;Whale Fall&#39; once</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.407" end="00:19:08.465" style="s2">at a private gala</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.607" end="00:19:10.567" style="s2">And there are no recordings of it whatsoever</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.607" end="00:19:11.907" style="s2">Not audio, not video</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.387" end="00:19:13.647" style="s2">She&#39;s probably never even heard it</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.686" end="00:19:15.025" style="s2">How could she possibly play it?</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.505" end="00:19:15.785" style="s2">Right</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.265" end="00:19:16.785" style="s2">You&#39;re right</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.765" end="00:19:20.387" style="s2">Please</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.087" end="00:19:35.966" style="s2">I found the sheet music for &#39;Whale Fall&#39; on a harpist forum online and learned it</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.966" end="00:19:38.686" style="s2">Since your reactions are so intense</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.706" end="00:19:40.506" style="s2">it must mean this sheet music is real</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.847" end="00:19:41.945" style="s2">In that case</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.206" end="00:19:43.867" style="s2">this bet, I won</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.167" end="00:19:45.426" style="s2">So I was overthinking</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.587" end="00:19:48.387" style="s2">This bitch was just lucky and stumbled upon the &#39;Whale Fall&#39; sheet music</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.627" end="00:19:49.067" style="s2">After all</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.087" end="00:19:50.026" style="s2">with that fire back then</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.047" end="00:19:52.506" style="s2">it&#39;s impossible for Nora Sinclair to have escaped</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.966" end="00:19:54.627" style="s2">Yes, Nora is right</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.926" end="00:19:56.786" style="s2">I expect the Cranes to keep their promise</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.047" end="00:19:58.506" style="s2">The engagement is canceled</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.327" end="00:20:00.567" style="s2">Mom</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.587" end="00:20:01.945" style="s2">you will stay out of my and Nora&#39;s business</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.067" end="00:20:05.307" style="s2">Who says she won the bet?</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.367" end="00:20:07.667" style="s2">I said she had to play the entire &#39;Jingluo&#39; piece</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.807" end="00:20:10.587" style="s2">She only played a short segment!</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.567" end="00:20:13.226" style="s2">It&#39;s alright</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.246" end="00:20:14.327" style="s2">I can continue playing</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.206" end="00:20:29.186" style="s2">Wrong, wrong!</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.367" end="00:20:30.067" style="s2">What you&#39;re playing</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.167" end="00:20:31.945" style="s2">The second half you played is all wrong</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.907" end="00:20:34.486" style="s2">This bet, I&#39;ve won</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.107" end="00:20:36.347" style="s2">Mom, you&#39;ve heard &quot;Whale Fall&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.426" end="00:20:37.205" style="s2">What do you say?</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.246" end="00:20:39.147" style="s2">Well on this</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.167" end="00:20:40.367" style="s2">Elaine is the authority</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.966" end="00:20:44.026" style="s2">Not so fast</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.226" end="00:20:45.446" style="s2">I&#39;m not finished yet</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.505" end="00:21:21.127" style="s2">&#39;Whale Fall&#39;: the awakening of all things</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.745" end="00:21:23.826" style="s2">&#39;Whale Fall&#39; is about rebirth from the ashes</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.087" end="00:21:26.045" style="s2">When it ends, a new dawn begins</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.907" end="00:21:28.945" style="s2">This is the complete score of &#39;Whale Fall&#39;.</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.107" end="00:21:29.745" style="s2">Impressive</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.847" end="00:21:31.407" style="s2">She&#39;s more skilled than expected</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.705" end="00:21:34.587" style="s2">&#39;Fortune&#39;s Rise&#39; Yes, that&#39;s it</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.107" end="00:21:36.147" style="s2">That&#39;s exactly why</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.167" end="00:21:37.627" style="s2">that year, at the gala</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.745" end="00:21:39.265" style="s2">when Elaine played the piano</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.667" end="00:21:40.565" style="s2">it was so</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.285" end="00:21:42.225" style="s2">unforgettable</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.005" end="00:21:45.765" style="s2">She can recreate the &#39;Fortune&#39;s Rise&#39; effect on the piano</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.186" end="00:21:46.765" style="s2">Who is she?</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.225" end="00:21:49.147" style="s2">What&#39;s her connection to the Crane family?</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.265" end="00:21:50.127" style="s2">Miss Crane</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.367" end="00:21:52.005" style="s2">I hear &#39;The Final Cadence&#39; is your work</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.205" end="00:21:53.887" style="s2">so you know the &#39;Fortune&#39;s Rise&#39; effect</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.985" end="00:21:55.926" style="s2">Did I play it right?</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.505" end="00:21:57.765" style="s2">一</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.785" end="00:21:58.005" style="s2">1</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.945" end="00:22:02.387" style="s2">you&#39;re not going to deny it, are you?</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.965" end="00:22:05.147" style="s2">Fine, I admit it</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.167" end="00:22:06.667" style="s2">she did play &#39;The Final Cadence&#39;.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.065" end="00:22:07.847" style="s2">I won</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.045" end="00:22:09.107" style="s2">Keep your end of the deal</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.326" end="00:22:09.887" style="s2">From now on, stay away from Chloe</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.907" end="00:22:10.765" style="s2">Stay away from Chloe</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.985" end="00:22:13.565" style="s2">Please leave, both of you</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.407" end="00:22:18.186" style="s2">Elaine!</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.107" end="00:22:21.265" style="s2">Mr. Prescott, how did I do?</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.347" end="00:22:22.867" style="s2">Was that ten million well spent?</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.005" end="00:22:23.867" style="s2">Impressive</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.407" end="00:22:25.607" style="s2">But if you can play the piano that well</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.627" end="00:22:27.305" style="s2">why this line of work?</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.087" end="00:22:28.765" style="s2">Well</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.205" end="00:22:31.186" style="s2">Who knew I had such a talent for the piano?</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.387" end="00:22:34.445" style="s2">What&#39;s this all about?</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.705" end="00:22:36.587" style="s2">Is she coming on to me?</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.705" end="00:22:37.627" style="s2">Oh, Elliot.</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.705" end="00:22:39.465" style="s2">Now, we can be together forever.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.607" end="00:22:40.045" style="s2">No one will</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.065" end="00:22:41.627" style="s2">ever tear us apart, right?</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.387" end="00:22:43.826" style="s2">Ah, so it&#39;s an act.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.167" end="00:22:44.945" style="s2">That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.347" end="00:22:46.545" style="s2">I&#39;ll never let you go again.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.205" end="00:22:47.965" style="s2">Alright, fine.</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.005" end="00:22:50.065" style="s2">I am someone who goes back on their word.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.545" end="00:22:52.025" style="s2">I promised to let you be together.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.525" end="00:22:53.926" style="s2">And I will keep that promise.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.907" end="00:22:56.545" style="s2">Actually.</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.565" end="00:22:57.725" style="s2">Nora and I are already married.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.225" end="00:23:01.106" style="s2">She lost our child.</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.305" end="00:23:01.985" style="s2">It&#39;s on me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.765" end="00:23:04.025" style="s2">Mom, you understand, right?</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.005" end="00:23:06.785" style="s2">Nora Sawyer, is that right?</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.926" end="00:23:08.225" style="s2">Oh, Mrs. Prescott, please just call me Nora.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.245" end="00:23:08.586" style="s2">Well, in that case,</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.606" end="00:23:09.705" style="s2">you can move in starting today.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.565" end="00:23:10.926" style="s2">Butler,</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.945" end="00:23:12.387" style="s2">have the maids prepare her things</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.525" end="00:23:13.945" style="s2">and move them into Elliot&#39;s room.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.565" end="00:23:16.387" style="s2">Yes, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.686" end="00:23:17.505" style="s2">No, Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.745" end="00:23:18.805" style="s2">Nora just lost our child.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.826" end="00:23:19.907" style="s2">She needs a separate room.</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.926" end="00:23:20.305" style="s2">Okay?</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.387" end="00:23:21.025" style="s2">Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.167" end="00:23:22.626" style="s2">Because she lost the child,</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.745" end="00:23:24.705" style="s2">that&#39;s all the more reason you need to be together</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.725" end="00:23:26.106" style="s2">so you can take care of her.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.565" end="00:23:28.245" style="s2">Wait, Mrs. Prescott is right.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.305" end="00:23:29.667" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to be away from Elliot,</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.785" end="00:23:30.945" style="s2">not even for a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.126" end="00:23:32.147" style="s2">That&#39;s for the best.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.686" end="00:23:38.505" style="s2">Dad, what do we do now?</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.945" end="00:23:39.826" style="s2">That bitch.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.005" end="00:23:41.626" style="s2">She can actually play &quot;Whale Fall&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.887" end="00:23:43.126" style="s2">and recreate the phenomenon.</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.586" end="00:23:46.167" style="s2">Could she really be Elaine Crane?!</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.545" end="00:23:46.826" style="s2">No!</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.205" end="00:23:48.785" style="s2">No, that&#39;s absolutely impossible!</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.846" end="00:23:51.265" style="s2">No one could have possibly survived that fire.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.626" end="00:23:53.186" style="s2">Besides, I just checked online.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.545" end="00:23:56.667" style="s2">The sheet music for &quot;Startling Fall&quot; is on the internet.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.846" end="00:23:57.285" style="s2">This should be</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.305" end="00:23:58.667" style="s2">what you uploaded back then</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.686" end="00:24:01.106" style="s2">so it&#39;s not surprising this girl can play it</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.606" end="00:24:03.186" style="s2">But what if?</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.805" end="00:24:05.745" style="s2">There are no &#39;what ifs&#39;.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.005" end="00:24:08.627" style="s2">Everyone knows you&#39;re the real Elaine Crane</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.965" end="00:24:10.545" style="s2">Even if that damn girl is still alive</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.565" end="00:24:11.667" style="s2">she can&#39;t touch us</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.445" end="00:24:13.745" style="s2">Since I got rid of her once</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.846" end="00:24:15.386" style="s2">I can get rid of her a second time</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.647" end="00:24:16.505" style="s2">Dad, you&#39;re right</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.127" end="00:24:18.426" style="s2">The frustrating thing is</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.445" end="00:24:20.426" style="s2">Elliot still refuses to marry me</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.606" end="00:24:22.346" style="s2">Without the Prescott family&#39;s backing</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.366" end="00:24:25.106" style="s2">I won&#39;t be able to get the shares under Nora Sinclair&#39;s name</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.285" end="00:24:26.826" style="s2">Haha, don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.846" end="00:24:27.167" style="s2">Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.186" end="00:24:28.647" style="s2">Prescott will never accept that kind of</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.667" end="00:24:30.505" style="s2">a woman like that as her daughter-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.525" end="00:24:31.065" style="s2">Otherwise</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.086" end="00:24:32.985" style="s2">she wouldn&#39;t have come running after us just now</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.285" end="00:24:34.186" style="s2">Just you wait</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.565" end="00:24:35.305" style="s2">Before you know it</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.326" end="00:24:36.667" style="s2">she&#39;ll be coming to you for help</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.087" end="00:24:46.186" style="s2">Madam, the room has been prepared</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.327" end="00:24:47.686" style="s2">The young master and young mistress have</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.705" end="00:24:49.485" style="s2">already returned to their room to rest</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.286" end="00:24:51.067" style="s2">That&#39;s good</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.025" end="00:24:52.807" style="s2">Madam</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.025" end="00:24:54.647" style="s2">about the young mistress&#39;s identity</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.705" end="00:24:55.926" style="s2">do you really not mind?</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.347" end="00:24:57.286" style="s2">How could I not?</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.225" end="00:25:00.567" style="s2">But, this young mistress of yours</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.627" end="00:25:01.567" style="s2">she&#39;s a fake</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.047" end="00:25:02.827" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.025" end="00:25:03.847" style="s2">A fake?</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.786" end="00:25:05.725" style="s2">At the wedding today</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.745" end="00:25:07.926" style="s2">I was just momentarily fooled by them</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.985" end="00:25:10.485" style="s2">After coming back just now</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.667" end="00:25:13.525" style="s2">There&#39;s something about this Nora. It just doesn&#39;t feel right</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.887" end="00:25:14.607" style="s2">I&#39;m telling you</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.627" end="00:25:15.765" style="s2">Adrian hired her</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.786" end="00:25:16.525" style="s2">The miscarriage</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.547" end="00:25:18.607" style="s2">this marriage, it&#39;s all a charade</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.945" end="00:25:20.807" style="s2">Well, ma&#39;am, if that&#39;s the case</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.827" end="00:25:22.965" style="s2">then why on earth did you let them move in together?</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.907" end="00:25:25.367" style="s2">You don&#39;t understand Adrian</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.387" end="00:25:27.205" style="s2">He&#39;s been proud since he was a boy</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.307" end="00:25:29.725" style="s2">but forcing him to live with a woman he can&#39;t stand</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.025" end="00:25:31.087" style="s2">sooner or later</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.265" end="00:25:32.567" style="s2">he&#39;s bound to slip up</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.627" end="00:25:33.485" style="s2">At that time</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.627" end="00:25:35.525" style="s2">At that point</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.627" end="00:25:37.567" style="s2">Master Adrian will know he&#39;s in the wrong</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.587" end="00:25:40.067" style="s2">He&#39;ll have no choice but to accept your arrangements</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.587" end="00:25:41.347" style="s2">That&#39;s right</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.485" end="00:25:42.265" style="s2">Actually</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.667" end="00:25:44.047" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to force his hand</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.465" end="00:25:46.167" style="s2">But his cousin, Juliana Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.186" end="00:25:48.367" style="s2">has always been gunning for the heir&#39;s position</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.667" end="00:25:50.607" style="s2">If Adrian marries Elaine Crane</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.667" end="00:25:52.607" style="s2">his position as heir will be secure</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.985" end="00:25:53.807" style="s2">Hey, Mom</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.026" end="00:25:55.445" style="s2">I can&#39;t come home for a bit</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.465" end="00:25:56.445" style="s2">Something came up</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.945" end="00:25:57.887" style="s2">Oh, I know</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.147" end="00:25:59.686" style="s2">That colleague of yours</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.827" end="00:26:01.087" style="s2">she already told me</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.745" end="00:26:04.445" style="s2">Said you landed a big deal and you&#39;re swamped</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.627" end="00:26:05.526" style="s2">And what&#39;s more</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.547" end="00:26:07.445" style="s2">she found a specialist for your dad!</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.667" end="00:26:09.607" style="s2">His surgery is in a few days</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.647" end="00:26:12.426" style="s2">Really?</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.765" end="00:26:13.547" style="s2">That&#39;s great!</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.667" end="00:26:14.807" style="s2">I&#39;ll come see you then</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.445" end="00:26:16.047" style="s2">No, honey</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.067" end="00:26:16.807" style="s2">you don&#39;t need to do that</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.827" end="00:26:17.765" style="s2">It&#39;s such a long trip</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.785" end="00:26:19.067" style="s2">Your mom&#39;s here taking good care of me</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.087" end="00:26:20.245" style="s2">so you don&#39;t worry about a thing</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.887" end="00:26:21.407" style="s2">That&#39;s right, Nora</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.426" end="00:26:22.587" style="s2">Just take care of yourself</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.047" end="00:26:23.647" style="s2">I know</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.785" end="00:26:24.686" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Mom and Dad</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.945" end="00:26:31.686" style="s2">Elliot, come here</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.225" end="00:26:34.591" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.627" end="00:26:36.958" style="s2">Wait. She doesn&#39;t actually think this is for real, does she?</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.025" end="00:26:38.958" style="s2">No wonder she was so happy to share a room with me</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.725" end="00:26:40.692" style="s2">If I reject her</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.025" end="00:26:42.259" style="s2">will she be heartbroken?</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.518" end="00:26:45.018" style="s2">Oh!</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.183" end="00:26:46.683" style="s2">I brought Nora some milk</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.951" end="00:26:48.817" style="s2">For her recovery after the miscarriage</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.884" end="00:26:50.284" style="s2">Auntie, Auntie, you&#39;re here!</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.384" end="00:26:51.884" style="s2">Aha</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.550" end="00:26:53.483" style="s2">Thank you, Auntie</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.817" end="00:26:54.616" style="s2">Oh, you&#39;re welcome</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.162" end="00:26:58.095" style="s2">You little brat</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.497" end="00:26:59.828" style="s2">We&#39;ll see how long you can hold out</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.275" end="00:27:03.575" style="s2">Damn it, what is she up to?</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.956" end="00:27:06.095" style="s2">Mom, don&#39;t leave me</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.835" end="00:27:10.937" style="s2">Don&#39;t leave me. Dad doesn&#39;t like me if you leave</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.956" end="00:27:11.896" style="s2">what will I do?</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.356" end="00:27:15.216" style="s2">But her parents are fine. Why this nightmare?</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.595" end="00:27:19.896" style="s2">Damn, I&#39;m actually feeling something for her</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.035" end="00:27:21.176" style="s2">How can I sleep now?</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.437" end="00:27:22.295" style="s2">Open the door</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.716" end="00:27:25.735" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, this isn&#39;t right</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.795" end="00:27:26.856" style="s2">It&#39;s just seven AM</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.876" end="00:27:27.735" style="s2">They must be asleep</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.396" end="00:27:31.055" style="s2">They can play their games all day long</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.335" end="00:27:33.697" style="s2">But I refuse to believe that even in their dreams</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.815" end="00:27:34.735" style="s2">they&#39;re still acting</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.916" end="00:27:35.295" style="s2">Ma&#39;am</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.396" end="00:27:37.075" style="s2">please, you&#39;re putting me in a terrible position</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.136" end="00:27:38.055" style="s2">I&#39;ll do it myself</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.075" end="00:27:38.716" style="s2">Hey!</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.437" end="00:27:48.775" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, close the door</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.917" end="00:27:49.697" style="s2">yes, ma&#39;am</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.055" end="00:27:54.535" style="s2">Ma&#39;am</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.937" end="00:27:56.437" style="s2">Mr. Prescott and his wife</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.095" end="00:27:58.475" style="s2">it doesn&#39;t seem like they&#39;re acting</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.975" end="00:27:59.897" style="s2">I don&#39;t believe it</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.216" end="00:28:01.216" style="s2">They know I suspect them</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.235" end="00:28:02.897" style="s2">so they wouldn&#39;t dare let their guard down</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.917" end="00:28:03.975" style="s2">even in their sleep</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.275" end="00:28:05.177" style="s2">Keep watching them</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.157" end="00:28:06.775" style="s2">Yes, ma&#39;am</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.835" end="00:28:12.657" style="s2">You&#39;re finally awake</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.275" end="00:28:14.055" style="s2">Ehehe~</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.617" end="00:28:19.117" style="s2">Last night you were like an octopus</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.137" end="00:28:20.417" style="s2">clinging to me and not letting go</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.237" end="00:28:23.777" style="s2">I swear</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.797" end="00:28:25.099" style="s2">I don&#39;t think of you that way</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.517" end="00:28:26.297" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.319" end="00:28:27.099" style="s2">When you don&#39;t need me</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.119" end="00:28:28.297" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep my distance</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.359" end="00:28:29.217" style="s2">I promise</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.717" end="00:28:32.619" style="s2">Is that so?</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.757" end="00:28:33.579" style="s2">Of course not!</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.599" end="00:28:35.256" style="s2">I would never think of a client that way</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.277" end="00:28:36.537" style="s2">I&#39;m a professional</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.497" end="00:28:38.277" style="s2">Good</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.339" end="00:28:40.559" style="s2">The feeling is mutual</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.777" end="00:28:41.937" style="s2">So don&#39;t get any ideas</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.839" end="00:28:46.977" style="s2">Fine, you don&#39;t, you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.099" end="00:28:47.977" style="s2">Why be so harsh?</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.758" end="00:28:52.859" style="s2">Elliot, wait up!</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.738" end="00:28:55.758" style="s2">No one else is here</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.998" end="00:28:57.758" style="s2">I thought you said you had no ulterior motives</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.099" end="00:28:59.238" style="s2">Why the huge smile?</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.218" end="00:29:01.119" style="s2">Didn&#39;t we agree?</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.659" end="00:29:02.879" style="s2">Even when no one&#39;s around</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.359" end="00:29:05.018" style="s2">we still have to act like a couple</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.238" end="00:29:06.178" style="s2">That&#39;s not necessary</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.099" end="00:29:09.639" style="s2">What?!</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.879" end="00:29:11.159" style="s2">Of course it&#39;s necessary!</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.359" end="00:29:11.978" style="s2">Well, go on then</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.218" end="00:29:12.738" style="s2">Kiss me</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.319" end="00:29:13.918" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.099" end="00:29:15.119" style="s2">Not gonna kiss me?</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.258" end="00:29:15.718" style="s2">Fine</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.018" end="00:29:18.718" style="s2">Honey, I knew you were the best</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.399" end="00:29:21.179" style="s2">Ahem</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.419" end="00:29:24.319" style="s2">Mrs. Cross, I&#39;m sorry, we were just</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.718" end="00:29:25.919" style="s2">it was a moment of passion</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.159" end="00:29:27.599" style="s2">You&#39;ve been there, you understand, right?</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.399" end="00:29:29.559" style="s2">Alright, come have breakfast</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.438" end="00:29:33.038" style="s2">Uh, Mom, I have a meeting this morning</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.119" end="00:29:34.319" style="s2">Nora, you go have breakfast with Mom</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.339" end="00:29:34.998" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.339" end="00:29:37.599" style="s2">Honey, please hurry back</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.718" end="00:29:39.738" style="s2">I can&#39;t stand being away from you for a second!</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.839" end="00:29:43.619" style="s2">Got it</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.619" end="00:29:46.839" style="s2">Why is he blushing?</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.139" end="00:29:49.319" style="s2">He can&#39;t have actually fallen for this girl, can he?</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.099" end="00:29:52.998" style="s2">Mrs. Cross, I&#39;m so sorry!</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.218" end="00:29:54.238" style="s2">Alright, come have breakfast</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.717" end="00:30:01.379" style="s2">Honey, I knew you were the best</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.059" end="00:30:05.319" style="s2">Honey, please hurry back</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.339" end="00:30:07.198" style="s2">I can&#39;t stand being away from you for a second</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.619" end="00:30:10.639" style="s2">Is she being genuine or just acting?</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.017" end="00:30:12.438" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t seem like acting</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.579" end="00:30:13.757" style="s2">It must be genuine</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.859" end="00:30:14.639" style="s2">Ahem</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.659" end="00:30:15.079" style="s2">Mr</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.099" end="00:30:15.879" style="s2">Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.698" end="00:30:18.477" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.737" end="00:30:21.038" style="s2">Sir, you haven&#39;t turned the page in half an hour</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.139" end="00:30:21.717" style="s2">I know</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.737" end="00:30:22.599" style="s2">I&#39;m thinking</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.778" end="00:30:24.079" style="s2">Do I need you to remind me?</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.217" end="00:30:26.038" style="s2">Thinking of Miss Sawyer, forgive me</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.059" end="00:30:26.319" style="s2">Mrs</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.339" end="00:30:26.997" style="s2">Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.017" end="00:30:27.879" style="s2">And what if I am?</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.899" end="00:30:28.919" style="s2">Am I not allowed?</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.659" end="00:30:33.839" style="s2">So if she really fell for me, wants this to be real, should I say yes?</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.419" end="00:30:35.179" style="s2">She won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.298" end="00:30:36.359" style="s2">I asked the middleman</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.379" end="00:30:38.879" style="s2">She&#39;s a professional and will never fall in love with a client</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.938" end="00:30:39.957" style="s2">You can rest assured</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.619" end="00:30:42.798" style="s2">Rest assured, rest assured</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.819" end="00:30:43.517" style="s2">You talk too much!</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.538" end="00:30:44.237" style="s2">Get out!</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.879" end="00:30:47.538" style="s2">Why did Mr</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.559" end="00:30:48.879" style="s2">Prescott suddenly get angry?</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.899" end="00:30:49.319" style="s2">If Mrs</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.339" end="00:30:50.519" style="s2">Prescott won&#39;t fall for him</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.539" end="00:30:51.758" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t he be relieved?</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.959" end="00:30:53.358" style="s2">Oh, right, Mr</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.378" end="00:30:53.718" style="s2">Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.738" end="00:30:54.838" style="s2">I forgot to tell you something</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.858" end="00:30:55.499" style="s2">An hour ago</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.519" end="00:30:56.338" style="s2">Aunt Vivian Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.358" end="00:31:00.358" style="s2">and Owen Prescott came back from the south? Aren&#39;t they supposed to be with Grandpa down</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.378" end="00:31:02.758" style="s2">It&#39;s only been a few months and they&#39;re already making a move?</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.059" end="00:31:05.718" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid it&#39;s because your wedding to Miss Crane was called off</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.159" end="00:31:07.758" style="s2">Now</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.778" end="00:31:09.398" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid things are going to get tough for Mrs</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.418" end="00:31:10.238" style="s2">Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.599" end="00:31:11.378" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.418" end="00:31:12.119" style="s2">With Nora around</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.139" end="00:31:13.278" style="s2">my mom will be just fine</p>
