<p begin="00:31:14.738" end="00:31:16.238" style="s2">smiling so gently?</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.258" end="00:31:16.679" style="s2">Could Mr</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.697" end="00:31:18.358" style="s2">Prescott have fallen for the new Mrs</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.378" end="00:31:19.197" style="s2">Prescott?</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.218" end="00:31:23.079" style="s2">Elliot is still waiting to hear from me</p>
