<p begin="00:31:24.378" end="00:31:27.218" style="s2">and that Nora Sawyer girl, it&#39;s starting to feel more and more real</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.238" end="00:31:28.539" style="s2">Oh, what am I going to do?</p>
