<p begin="00:32:07.519" end="00:32:08.697" style="s2">He even brought her home</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.718" end="00:32:10.338" style="s2">Aunt</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.358" end="00:32:11.979" style="s2">Is my new cousin-in-law home?</p>
