<p begin="00:32:15.559" end="00:32:16.338" style="s2">Ah!</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.358" end="00:32:18.378" style="s2">Are you looking for me?</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.398" end="00:32:20.019" style="s2">Haha, there you are</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.197" end="00:32:21.278" style="s2">Honestly, Sister-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.298" end="00:32:23.218" style="s2">why didn&#39;t you introduce us to your niece-in-law?</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.238" end="00:32:23.778" style="s2">Yes</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.798" end="00:32:24.979" style="s2">What niece-in-law?</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.858" end="00:32:26.479" style="s2">Hahahaha</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.499" end="00:32:27.659" style="s2">Hahaha</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.798" end="00:32:28.459" style="s2">Sister-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.479" end="00:32:29.918" style="s2">don&#39;t tell me you&#39;re looking down on her</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.939" end="00:32:31.099" style="s2">because of her humble background</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.119" end="00:32:32.197" style="s2">But if Elliot likes her</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.218" end="00:32:33.539" style="s2">you should just accept her</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.878" end="00:32:37.338" style="s2">Oh, thank goodness</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.358" end="00:32:39.418" style="s2">my Owen isn&#39;t so willful</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.238" end="00:32:42.338" style="s2">He only moves in the best circles</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.479" end="00:32:44.179" style="s2">All proper heiresses</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.599" end="00:32:45.378" style="s2">Of course</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.278" end="00:32:48.539" style="s2">With his lack of education</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.559" end="00:32:50.258" style="s2">Owen certainly needs to marry up</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.439" end="00:32:51.539" style="s2">It&#39;s a real shame</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.838" end="00:32:54.059" style="s2">I heard he went after every heiress in town</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.079" end="00:32:56.099" style="s2">and not one of them would give him the time of day</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.679" end="00:32:58.818" style="s2">You bitch!</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.579" end="00:33:00.559" style="s2">Say that again!</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.838" end="00:33:01.619" style="s2">Owen!</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.019" end="00:33:02.838" style="s2">That&#39;s enough! That&#39;s enough!</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.338" end="00:33:06.758" style="s2">Nobody wants my son?</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.778" end="00:33:07.559" style="s2">Please</p>
