<p begin="00:33:08.599" end="00:33:09.778" style="s2">is dying to marry him</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.798" end="00:33:13.639" style="s2">and gave me this, a seven-million-dollar jadeite bracelet</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.939" end="00:33:15.318" style="s2">Let me tell you about this piece</p>
