<p begin="00:33:35.579" end="00:33:36.278" style="s2">Vivian</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.298" end="00:33:38.159" style="s2">Haven&#39;t you ever seen fine jewelry?</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.179" end="00:33:40.519" style="s2">To be so proud of this garbage</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.858" end="00:33:42.278" style="s2">you can&#39;t even tell the difference</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.298" end="00:33:43.398" style="s2">You&#39;re just jealous!</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.418" end="00:33:44.718" style="s2">The Langford heiress gave me this</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.738" end="00:33:46.278" style="s2">There&#39;s no way it&#39;s garbage!</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.298" end="00:33:47.119" style="s2">The Langfords?</p>
