<p begin="00:33:50.898" end="00:33:52.519" style="s2">The Langford family is going bankrupt</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.539" end="00:33:54.479" style="s2">Bankrupt and she&#39;s still fawning over Owen?</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.659" end="00:33:55.479" style="s2">Yikes</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.619" end="00:33:56.878" style="s2">Probably wants a fool to pay up</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.898" end="00:33:58.039" style="s2">You, you&#39;re lying!</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.059" end="00:33:58.738" style="s2">Fine</p>
