<p begin="00:34:04.939" end="00:34:05.758" style="s2">Impossible!</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.778" end="00:34:06.418" style="s2">This</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.579" end="00:34:07.639" style="s2">Oh, Vivian</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.939" end="00:34:09.519" style="s2">Planning to run a charity now?</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.778" end="00:34:11.999" style="s2">Look on the bright side</p>
