<p begin="00:34:14.539" end="00:34:17.318" style="s2">I&#39;ll be sure to give you both a very generous wedding gift!</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.218" end="00:34:20.758" style="s2">No matter how you spin it</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.838" end="00:34:23.378" style="s2">it&#39;s your son who married some girl from the sticks</p>
