<p begin="00:34:26.878" end="00:34:29.418" style="s2">The embarrassment is all yours!</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.439" end="00:34:30.159" style="s2">You!</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.459" end="00:34:31.099" style="s2">Aunt Vivian</p>
