<p begin="00:34:37.238" end="00:34:38.258" style="s2">I&#39;ve had a vision</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.358" end="00:34:39.798" style="s2">And I can see that you&#39;re about to</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.818" end="00:34:42.059" style="s2">have a bloody accident within the next three minutes</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.079" end="00:34:43.139" style="s2">Playing God?</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.479" end="00:34:45.378" style="s2">You think I&#39;m falling for that little act?</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.679" end="00:34:47.858" style="s2">Sister-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.159" end="00:34:50.818" style="s2">I don&#39;t know how you put up with a daughter-in-law like that</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.939" end="00:34:51.398" style="s2">Well</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.418" end="00:34:53.019" style="s2">you&#39;d better pray for yourself</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.838" end="00:34:55.019" style="s2">Owen, we&#39;re leaving</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.258" end="00:34:57.579" style="s2">Hmph</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.599" end="00:34:58.238" style="s2">Ah!</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.258" end="00:35:03.059" style="s2">Mom!</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.079" end="00:35:03.499" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.519" end="00:35:04.059" style="s2">Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.079" end="00:35:04.698" style="s2">What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.141" end="00:35:07.422" style="s2">Why wouldn&#39;t you believe me?</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.842" end="00:35:08.561" style="s2">You bitch!</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.431" end="00:35:10.451" style="s2">You&#39;re blaming me?</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.672" end="00:35:11.851" style="s2">I&#39;ve been right here the whole time</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.871" end="00:35:12.891" style="s2">I didn&#39;t do a thing!</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.311" end="00:35:14.052" style="s2">You fell on your own</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.072" end="00:35:14.652" style="s2">Sister-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.672" end="00:35:15.451" style="s2">Don&#39;t blame her</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.471" end="00:35:16.811" style="s2">Owen, to the hospital, now!</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.831" end="00:35:19.331" style="s2">Take your mom to the hospital. Mom, let&#39;s go to the</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.351" end="00:35:19.652" style="s2">Ugh</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.672" end="00:35:21.531" style="s2">Ah, ow, ah, ah, ah</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.552" end="00:35:23.491" style="s2">Still want to see me make a fool of myself</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.632" end="00:35:24.531" style="s2">Serves you right</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.991" end="00:35:26.292" style="s2">Eleanor, have some water</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.311" end="00:35:27.052" style="s2">Cool down</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.431" end="00:35:33.732" style="s2">You little rascal</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.792" end="00:35:34.572" style="s2">Tell me</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.792" end="00:35:36.212" style="s2">can you really do fortune-telling?</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.810" end="00:35:38.752" style="s2">Of course not</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.951" end="00:35:40.331" style="s2">When I passed by the door just now</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.351" end="00:35:41.891" style="s2">I noticed a reflection on the floor</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.911" end="00:35:44.612" style="s2">I figured one of the maids must have left a wet spot while cleaning</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.632" end="00:35:46.531" style="s2">so anyone passing by was likely to slip</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.552" end="00:35:47.810" style="s2">I just took a lucky guess</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.951" end="00:35:48.971" style="s2">You&#39;re very sharp</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.991" end="00:35:49.810" style="s2">I like that</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.991" end="00:35:51.652" style="s2">If Elliot&#39;s position is secure</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.672" end="00:35:53.931" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t object to you becoming my daughter-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.092" end="00:35:54.612" style="s2">Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.632" end="00:35:56.092" style="s2">Prescott, as I understand it</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.112" end="00:35:58.252" style="s2">Elliot has been running the Pei Group ever since Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.272" end="00:35:58.772" style="s2">Pei Sr.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.792" end="00:36:00.212" style="s2">retired two years ago</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.272" end="00:36:01.931" style="s2">Isn&#39;t his position secure enough?</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.152" end="00:36:02.931" style="s2">You don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.971" end="00:36:03.491" style="s2">Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.511" end="00:36:04.011" style="s2">Pei Sr.</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.031" end="00:36:05.810" style="s2">holds a huge number of shares</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.831" end="00:36:08.031" style="s2">That Ethan Pei knows exactly how to please Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.052" end="00:36:08.891" style="s2">Pei Sr.</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.112" end="00:36:11.092" style="s2">I&#39;m worried he&#39;ll leave all his shares to him</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.272" end="00:36:12.891" style="s2">And then, even if Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.951" end="00:36:14.692" style="s2">he&#39;d be a CEO in name only</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.632" end="00:36:17.810" style="s2">But he&#39;s very fond of Stella</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.112" end="00:36:20.971" style="s2">He and Stella became friends when he was recovering down south</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.152" end="00:36:22.931" style="s2">Stella often goes to keep him company</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.951" end="00:36:23.652" style="s2">Playing chess</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.672" end="00:36:25.052" style="s2">drinking tea. You know</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.072" end="00:36:25.371" style="s2">in Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.391" end="00:36:26.011" style="s2">Prescott Sr.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.031" end="00:36:26.531" style="s2">&#39;s heart</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.552" end="00:36:29.052" style="s2">Elaine is closer to him than his own two grandsons</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.212" end="00:36:30.991" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.011" end="00:36:31.692" style="s2">It&#39;s nothing</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.712" end="00:36:32.451" style="s2">I&#39;m fine</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.592" end="00:36:33.891" style="s2">Last time, it was the qin</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.911" end="00:36:35.132" style="s2">I got the same headache</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.192" end="00:36:36.371" style="s2">This time, it&#39;s chess</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.511" end="00:36:37.891" style="s2">Could I have actually been a master</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.911" end="00:36:39.612" style="s2">of all those traditional arts like the qin</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.632" end="00:36:41.331" style="s2">chess, calligraphy, and painting?</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.351" end="00:36:42.871" style="s2">Anyway, with how fond Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.891" end="00:36:43.491" style="s2">Prescott Sr.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.511" end="00:36:45.772" style="s2">is of Elaine, if Elliot were to marry her</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.792" end="00:36:47.371" style="s2">his position as heir would be secure</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.391" end="00:36:48.112" style="s2">It&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.371" end="00:36:51.232" style="s2">Mrs. Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.252" end="00:36:52.810" style="s2">I&#39;m not the one who ruined this marriage</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.831" end="00:36:54.132" style="s2">It was Elliot himself</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.232" end="00:36:55.052" style="s2">If he&#39;d wanted it</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.072" end="00:36:56.331" style="s2">no one could have stopped him</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.072" end="00:36:59.851" style="s2">You&#39;re right. Then why is he so unwilling?</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.871" end="00:37:00.252" style="s2">Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.272" end="00:37:00.891" style="s2">Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.911" end="00:37:01.172" style="s2">Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.192" end="00:37:02.491" style="s2">Prescott, have you considered?</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.511" end="00:37:03.451" style="s2">The more you push</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.471" end="00:37:04.851" style="s2">the more he resists</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.871" end="00:37:06.772" style="s2">Because this shows you don&#39;t trust him</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.552" end="00:37:08.132" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.152" end="00:37:09.931" style="s2">He&#39;s doubled the Pei Group&#39;s value</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.991" end="00:37:12.132" style="s2">He knows exactly how to secure his position</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.431" end="00:37:14.810" style="s2">I must have been obsessed</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.572" end="00:37:16.132" style="s2">Cole</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.152" end="00:37:17.531" style="s2">bring me my &quot;Scent of the King&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.572" end="00:37:18.351" style="s2">Yes, ma&#39;am</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.232" end="00:37:20.112" style="s2">Heart of the King?</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.451" end="00:37:23.272" style="s2">Madam</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.092" end="00:37:29.351" style="s2">This Crown of Hearts was meant for my future daughter-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.371" end="00:37:30.792" style="s2">It&#39;s worth fifteen million dollars</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.810" end="00:37:31.911" style="s2">Now, I&#39;m giving it to you</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.971" end="00:37:33.471" style="s2">Fifteen million dollars?!</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.011" end="00:37:34.752" style="s2">Never mind</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.772" end="00:37:36.471" style="s2">I&#39;ll just return it to Julian later</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.772" end="00:37:37.752" style="s2">Go on, take it</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.572" end="00:37:39.552" style="s2">Thank you, Eleanor</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.572" end="00:37:40.752" style="s2">I&#39;ll take good care of it</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.052" end="00:37:41.831" style="s2">Since it&#39;s yours now</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.851" end="00:37:42.632" style="s2">you should wear it</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.652" end="00:37:43.011" style="s2">After all</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.031" end="00:37:44.351" style="s2">you&#39;re part of the Prescott family now</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.371" end="00:37:45.871" style="s2">You need to look the part when you&#39;re out</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.612" end="00:37:49.272" style="s2">Mmm, I understand</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.971" end="00:37:50.831" style="s2">Hello, Miss Crane</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.851" end="00:37:52.991" style="s2">Our madam gave the Crown of Hearts to the young madam</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.310" end="00:37:54.792" style="s2">Damn it!</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.851" end="00:37:56.632" style="s2">Oh, Elaine, what&#39;s wrong with you?</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.851" end="00:37:57.672" style="s2">Dad, Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.692" end="00:38:00.192" style="s2">Pei gave the Crown of Hearts to that bitch Nora Sawyer!</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.692" end="00:38:01.471" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.732" end="00:38:02.871" style="s2">That&#39;s impossible. That&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.891" end="00:38:03.351" style="s2">Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.371" end="00:38:06.031" style="s2">Pei clearly said she would save the Crown of Hearts for you</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.612" end="00:38:07.951" style="s2">It means she has given in</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.411" end="00:38:09.752" style="s2">Dad, what should we do now?</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.772" end="00:38:10.351" style="s2">In that case</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.371" end="00:38:12.331" style="s2">let&#39;s ally with the second branch of the Pei family</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.351" end="00:38:13.991" style="s2">and help Connor Pei rise to power</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.232" end="00:38:15.011" style="s2">Dad?</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.052" end="00:38:16.511" style="s2">I still want to marry Adrian Pei</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.531" end="00:38:17.431" style="s2">Oh, my silly girl</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.451" end="00:38:18.310" style="s2">Think about it</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.531" end="00:38:21.592" style="s2">How can feelings possibly be more important than our interests?</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.612" end="00:38:21.911" style="s2">You&#39;re right</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.931" end="00:38:23.272" style="s2">But that Connor Pei is an idiot</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.292" end="00:38:24.752" style="s2">How could he possibly beat Adrian Pei?</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.772" end="00:38:25.991" style="s2">Hahaha, about that</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.011" end="00:38:27.152" style="s2">Here&#39;s something you don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.411" end="00:38:28.391" style="s2">Back in the day, old Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.411" end="00:38:30.632" style="s2">Pei had a real soft spot for Song Tingxue</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.931" end="00:38:33.272" style="s2">So I&#39;m willing to bet that no matter who you marry</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.292" end="00:38:33.712" style="s2">old Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.732" end="00:38:34.951" style="s2">Pei will give the shares to</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.971" end="00:38:36.132" style="s2">and that&#39;s the real reason Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.152" end="00:38:37.511" style="s2">Pei wanted Julian to marry you</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.531" end="00:38:38.391" style="s2">The real reason</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.572" end="00:38:41.031" style="s2">Are you saying you want me to get close to old Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.052" end="00:38:41.712" style="s2">Pei?</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.011" end="00:38:42.792" style="s2">Mmm</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.971" end="00:38:44.911" style="s2">But what if he finds out I&#39;m not the real Song Tingxue?</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.931" end="00:38:45.652" style="s2">Then what?!</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.732" end="00:38:48.031" style="s2">Heh heh. Don&#39;t you worry about that</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.052" end="00:38:49.232" style="s2">I know all about old Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.252" end="00:38:50.911" style="s2">Pei&#39;s history with Song Tingxue</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.931" end="00:38:51.192" style="s2">Plus</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.212" end="00:38:52.552" style="s2">the old man&#39;s eyesight is failing</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.572" end="00:38:53.831" style="s2">He&#39;ll never know you&#39;re not her</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.011" end="00:38:54.951" style="s2">That&#39;s a relief</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.172" end="00:38:56.471" style="s2">Wait, I remember now</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.491" end="00:38:56.931" style="s2">Old Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.951" end="00:38:58.592" style="s2">Pei&#39;s birthday banquet is in ten days</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.612" end="00:38:59.672" style="s2">Yes, exactly!</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.692" end="00:39:01.310" style="s2">That&#39;s when you&#39;ll reveal your &#39;identity&#39; to him</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.331" end="00:39:03.152" style="s2">and then have him approve your marriage to Adrian Pei</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.172" end="00:39:03.951" style="s2">Heh heh</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.172" end="00:39:05.232" style="s2">Maybe if the old man is happy</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.252" end="00:39:06.871" style="s2">he&#39;ll transfer the shares to Connor Pei</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.891" end="00:39:07.471" style="s2">Let&#39;s do it</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.491" end="00:39:08.192" style="s2">I&#39;ll make old Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.212" end="00:39:10.031" style="s2">Pei transfer the shares to me and Connor Pei</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.052" end="00:39:12.112" style="s2">And make Adrian Pei regret it forever</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.851" end="00:39:20.212" style="s2">Ta-da! Look what this is!</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.552" end="00:39:21.810" style="s2">Where did this necklace come from?</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.831" end="00:39:22.052" style="s2">Today</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.072" end="00:39:24.292" style="s2">I stood up for your mom against your Aunt Vivian and cousin Owen</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.310" end="00:39:25.152" style="s2">She was so happy that she</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.172" end="00:39:26.052" style="s2">gave this to me!</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.152" end="00:39:28.572" style="s2">This woman, she really didn&#39;t disappoint me</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.592" end="00:39:28.851" style="s2">So</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.871" end="00:39:30.130" style="s2">my mom has really accepted you</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.152" end="00:39:30.831" style="s2">Mmm!</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.031" end="00:39:33.810" style="s2">Your mom said this necklace is called the Star of a Fallen Nation</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.831" end="00:39:35.971" style="s2">and it&#39;s worth fifteen million dollars!</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.031" end="00:39:38.371" style="s2">This is the Star of a Fallen Nation</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.652" end="00:39:39.431" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.471" end="00:39:40.772" style="s2">You just put it on like that?!</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.792" end="00:39:41.531" style="s2">Yeah</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.552" end="00:39:42.172" style="s2">Hey, relax</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.192" end="00:39:43.052" style="s2">I was just trying it on</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.072" end="00:39:44.572" style="s2">I was about to give it right back to you</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.592" end="00:39:45.152" style="s2">My God</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.172" end="00:39:47.052" style="s2">Woman, you really are heartless</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.072" end="00:39:47.831" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.911" end="00:39:49.092" style="s2">This Star of a Fallen Nation</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.112" end="00:39:50.732" style="s2">it binds to its first owner</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.752" end="00:39:51.471" style="s2">Once you&#39;ve worn it</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.491" end="00:39:53.732" style="s2">anyone else who tries will be cursed with bad luck</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.310" end="00:39:56.451" style="s2">And you still have the nerve to say you&#39;re not after me?</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.192" end="00:39:58.891" style="s2">Is this your way of telling me</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.911" end="00:40:00.692" style="s2">that you&#39;ve decided you&#39;re mine forever?</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.911" end="00:40:01.612" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.632" end="00:40:02.810" style="s2">I-I had no idea</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.831" end="00:40:04.692" style="s2">I was just going to try it on and then give it back</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.351" end="00:40:07.172" style="s2">It&#39;s alright</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.431" end="00:40:09.172" style="s2">Since my mom has already accepted you</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.351" end="00:40:10.831" style="s2">I suppose I&#39;ll reluctantly accept you</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.851" end="00:40:11.471" style="s2">too</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.011" end="00:40:12.652" style="s2">But honestly</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.672" end="00:40:14.252" style="s2">this necklace does look really good on you</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.272" end="00:40:15.092" style="s2">No, no, no</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.632" end="00:40:16.810" style="s2">you&#39;ve really misunderstood</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.831" end="00:40:19.331" style="s2">I had no idea the Star of a Fallen Nation worked that way</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.351" end="00:40:20.851" style="s2">your mom didn&#39;t tell me either</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.871" end="00:40:21.531" style="s2">If I had known</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.552" end="00:40:22.371" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t have worn it</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.391" end="00:40:24.371" style="s2">I&#39;m not trying to cling to the Prescott family</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.871" end="00:40:25.951" style="s2">You really didn&#39;t know?</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.552" end="00:40:28.132" style="s2">Really!</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.471" end="00:40:29.252" style="s2">I swear</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.871" end="00:40:31.971" style="s2">I swear, if I&#39;m lying, let me rot!</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.991" end="00:40:32.612" style="s2">Enough!</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.592" end="00:40:35.212" style="s2">Mom gave it to you, so it&#39;s yours</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.232" end="00:40:36.252" style="s2">No need to return it</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.272" end="00:40:36.732" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.752" end="00:40:39.052" style="s2">But this is worth fifteen million dollars</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.072" end="00:40:40.132" style="s2">Fifteen million?!</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.192" end="00:40:41.052" style="s2">That&#39;s nothing</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.431" end="00:40:42.851" style="s2">You&#39;re the first person to wear it</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.911" end="00:40:43.891" style="s2">It was meant for you</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.112" end="00:40:46.052" style="s2">She&#39;s blushing</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.391" end="00:40:47.891" style="s2">So this is what she&#39;s really like</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.272" end="00:40:49.331" style="s2">I misjudged her</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.351" end="00:40:50.451" style="s2">But it doesn&#39;t matter</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.491" end="00:40:51.212" style="s2">Sooner or later</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.232" end="00:40:53.212" style="s2">I&#39;ll make her stay by my side willingly</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.172" end="00:40:54.891" style="s2">Sir</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.911" end="00:40:55.371" style="s2">Ma&#39;am</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.391" end="00:40:55.672" style="s2">Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.692" end="00:40:57.011" style="s2">Prescott wants you to come down</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.112" end="00:40:58.652" style="s2">Mom</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.672" end="00:41:00.252" style="s2">is there something you wanted to see us about?</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.331" end="00:41:01.092" style="s2">You tell him</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.112" end="00:41:01.811" style="s2">Yes, Ma&#39;am</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.831" end="00:41:03.772" style="s2">Sir, I&#39;ve just received word</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.792" end="00:41:04.772" style="s2">This afternoon</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.792" end="00:41:06.692" style="s2">Miss Crane met with Owen Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.712" end="00:41:10.331" style="s2">They plan to announce their engagement at your grandfather&#39;s birthday banquet</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.391" end="00:41:11.931" style="s2">Well, isn&#39;t that great</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.951" end="00:41:13.212" style="s2">They&#39;re a pretty good match</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.712" end="00:41:16.172" style="s2">Do you have any idea how serious this is?!</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.752" end="00:41:18.371" style="s2">Grandfather favors Elaine!</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.552" end="00:41:20.491" style="s2">If he gives his shares to Owen for her</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.511" end="00:41:21.732" style="s2">then we&#39;re finished!</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.491" end="00:41:26.092" style="s2">Mom, you&#39;re being dramatic</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.192" end="00:41:26.971" style="s2">Me?</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.431" end="00:41:29.052" style="s2">I heard what your grandfather said</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.152" end="00:41:31.152" style="s2">that if Elaine was his *actual* granddaughter</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.172" end="00:41:31.411" style="s2">he would</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.431" end="00:41:32.732" style="s2">leave everything to her</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.592" end="00:41:36.292" style="s2">Grandpa, why is he so taken with Sinclair?</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.792" end="00:41:37.851" style="s2">This doesn&#39;t make sense</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.871" end="00:41:39.112" style="s2">I was ready to accept Nora</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.132" end="00:41:40.971" style="s2">I really was, but then Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.991" end="00:41:42.811" style="s2">turns around and gets with Caleb Vance!</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.752" end="00:41:46.331" style="s2">Go and beg Elaine for another chance while you still can</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.511" end="00:41:47.451" style="s2">Impossible!</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.752" end="00:41:49.572" style="s2">I don&#39;t believe Grandpa would be this confused</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.592" end="00:41:51.411" style="s2">Why won&#39;t you believe what I&#39;m saying?</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.911" end="00:41:53.292" style="s2">Nora, I&#39;m begging you</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.552" end="00:41:54.772" style="s2">If you really care for Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.792" end="00:41:55.652" style="s2">please let him go</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.672" end="00:41:56.331" style="s2">Mom!</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.712" end="00:41:59.491" style="s2">Eleanor</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.831" end="00:42:01.252" style="s2">you&#39;re worried that Grandpa Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.272" end="00:42:03.531" style="s2">will give all the shares to Owen because he likes Elaine</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.351" end="00:42:05.971" style="s2">What if I can also win his favor?</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.431" end="00:42:08.732" style="s2">At Grandpa Prescott&#39;s birthday party in ten days</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.752" end="00:42:10.411" style="s2">I&#39;ll find a way to make him change his mind</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.431" end="00:42:11.331" style="s2">change his mind</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.471" end="00:42:14.652" style="s2">You don&#39;t know what Elaine means to him</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.672" end="00:42:16.052" style="s2">You&#39;ll never change his mind</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.431" end="00:42:17.212" style="s2">Let&#39;s try</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.471" end="00:42:18.732" style="s2">And what if you fail?</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.072" end="00:42:19.772" style="s2">Mom</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.792" end="00:42:21.331" style="s2">I&#39;m not going back to Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.431" end="00:42:22.891" style="s2">Your only option is Nora</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.272" end="00:42:25.011" style="s2">Eleanor, I won&#39;t let you down</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.531" end="00:42:26.612" style="s2">The party is in ten days</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.632" end="00:42:27.411" style="s2">Do you have a plan?</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.031" end="00:42:29.552" style="s2">You know</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.572" end="00:42:32.311" style="s2">I was just thinking. Do you know what your grandfather likes?</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.331" end="00:42:33.991" style="s2">I want to get him something he&#39;ll really love</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.891" end="00:42:36.431" style="s2">Actually, there is one thing</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.451" end="00:42:37.792" style="s2">Have you ever heard of the artist Chu Lan?</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.811" end="00:42:39.232" style="s2">Grandpa&#39;s a huge fan of her work</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.252" end="00:42:39.732" style="s2">Problem is</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.752" end="00:42:40.911" style="s2">her paintings are super rare</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.931" end="00:42:43.391" style="s2">Especially &#39;The Endless Riverlands&#39;—it&#39;s completely vanished</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.411" end="00:42:44.112" style="s2">Chu Lan?</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.132" end="00:42:44.672" style="s2">Mmm-hmm</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.692" end="00:42:46.391" style="s2">&#39;The Endless Riverlands&#39;?</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.692" end="00:42:48.831" style="s2">That name, it sounds so familiar</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.971" end="00:42:49.752" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.212" end="00:42:52.712" style="s2">It&#39;s okay. I&#39;m... I&#39;m just gonna go wash up</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.891" end="00:42:53.511" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.531" end="00:42:54.471" style="s2">I&#39;ll figure it out</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.572" end="00:42:58.152" style="s2">This man, how can he be</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.212" end="00:42:59.192" style="s2">so sincere?</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.212" end="00:42:59.752" style="s2">No</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.772" end="00:43:01.431" style="s2">I have to make sure he becomes the heir</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.451" end="00:43:03.552" style="s2">Then Eleanor won&#39;t have any say in who he marries</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.572" end="00:43:04.732" style="s2">And my job will be done</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.871" end="00:43:10.072" style="s2">Ugh, what&#39;s keeping her? Mom, relax</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.092" end="00:43:10.871" style="s2">We have time</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.732" end="00:43:24.431" style="s2">Nora, are you...</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.572" end="00:43:26.632" style="s2">So, the plan for Grandpa Prescott?</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.652" end="00:43:27.811" style="s2">We&#39;re leaving for the banquet now</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.831" end="00:43:28.951" style="s2">You can tell us, right?</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.411" end="00:43:32.592" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, if you please</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.772" end="00:43:34.192" style="s2">This is my secret weapon</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.292" end="00:43:35.112" style="s2">Just this?</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.052" end="00:43:38.551" style="s2">Mom, just stop worrying</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.772" end="00:43:39.792" style="s2">I trust Nora</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.811" end="00:43:45.371" style="s2">Let&#39;s go</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.252" end="00:43:51.192" style="s2">Sinclair, you&#39;re here!</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.612" end="00:43:52.471" style="s2">Father-in-law!</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.552" end="00:43:53.072" style="s2">Owen</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.192" end="00:43:55.272" style="s2">isn&#39;t it a bit early to be calling me father-in-law?</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.811" end="00:43:56.552" style="s2">Ah, hahaha</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.712" end="00:43:57.831" style="s2">By the way, where is your mother?</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.552" end="00:44:00.172" style="s2">My mother and I went to visit my aunt</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.592" end="00:44:02.052" style="s2">I don&#39;t know what that bitch Nora did.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.072" end="00:44:03.351" style="s2">but she made my mom chip a tooth</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.371" end="00:44:04.592" style="s2">so she couldn&#39;t make it tonight</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.232" end="00:44:05.991" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.272" end="00:44:07.112" style="s2">After today</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.212" end="00:44:08.511" style="s2">I will definitely make Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.531" end="00:44:10.192" style="s2">Prescott regret marrying that woman</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.092" end="00:44:12.351" style="s2">Has Grandpa Prescott arrived?</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.712" end="00:44:13.572" style="s2">Ah, he&#39;s here!</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.652" end="00:44:14.072" style="s2">Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.092" end="00:44:15.592" style="s2">let&#39;s hurry and wish Grandpa a happy birthday</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.072" end="00:44:16.451" style="s2">Go on</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.592" end="00:44:19.491" style="s2">Many happy returns</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.511" end="00:44:20.371" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott!</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.511" end="00:44:21.851" style="s2">To a long and prosperous life!</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.971" end="00:44:22.552" style="s2">Grandpa!</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.092" end="00:44:23.851" style="s2">Ah, Owen!</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.931" end="00:44:24.692" style="s2">There you are</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.851" end="00:44:25.391" style="s2">And this is?</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.411" end="00:44:26.232" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.252" end="00:44:27.152" style="s2">you don&#39;t remember me?</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.592" end="00:44:28.371" style="s2">I&#39;m Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.712" end="00:44:31.612" style="s2">Sinclair?</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.112" end="00:44:33.552" style="s2">It really is you, Sinclair!</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.811" end="00:44:34.272" style="s2">But...</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.752" end="00:44:35.931" style="s2">what happened to your voice?</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.011" end="00:44:39.632" style="s2">I injured my vocal cords a while back</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.311" end="00:44:41.092" style="s2">Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.272" end="00:44:42.871" style="s2">do you remember how we used to play chess</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.011" end="00:44:44.112" style="s2">and you could never beat me</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.192" end="00:44:45.112" style="s2">so you&#39;d always cheat?</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.192" end="00:44:46.072" style="s2">That&#39;s right, that&#39;s right!</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.092" end="00:44:47.232" style="s2">You are Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.772" end="00:44:49.672" style="s2">Since you went to Boston three years ago</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.692" end="00:44:51.092" style="s2">you never came to see me again</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.891" end="00:44:53.951" style="s2">I thought you had forgotten about this old man</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.732" end="00:44:56.351" style="s2">Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.471" end="00:44:57.951" style="s2">while I haven&#39;t been able to visit</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.011" end="00:44:59.232" style="s2">you&#39;ve always been in my heart</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.572" end="00:45:00.112" style="s2">Oh, and...</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.132" end="00:45:01.511" style="s2">I have some good news for you</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.112" end="00:45:04.572" style="s2">I&#39;m with your grandson, Owen</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.971" end="00:45:05.871" style="s2">With Owen?</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.511" end="00:45:07.811" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you engaged to Elliot?</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.592" end="00:45:10.252" style="s2">Grandpa, you don&#39;t understand</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.792" end="00:45:12.491" style="s2">Sinclair and Elliot were supposed to get married</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.511" end="00:45:14.811" style="s2">but he left her at the altar for some floozy</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.092" end="00:45:15.652" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.871" end="00:45:16.811" style="s2">I know about this</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.931" end="00:45:17.692" style="s2">At the time...</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.811" end="00:45:18.491" style="s2">I was there</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.692" end="00:45:19.272" style="s2">I was there too</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.292" end="00:45:20.692" style="s2">it was a total disaster</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.792" end="00:45:22.552" style="s2">So it&#39;s true</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.232" end="00:45:24.371" style="s2">That bastard!</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.471" end="00:45:25.232" style="s2">Grandpa, please</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.252" end="00:45:26.212" style="s2">don&#39;t get so upset</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.311" end="00:45:27.391" style="s2">We were just worried about your health</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.411" end="00:45:27.792" style="s2">so we never..</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.911" end="00:45:29.951" style="s2">Yes, Grandpa Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.011" end="00:45:31.612" style="s2">but I&#39;m doing great with Owen now</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.672" end="00:45:32.871" style="s2">We are getting engaged soon</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.132" end="00:45:33.831" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.851" end="00:45:34.491" style="s2">you will bless us</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.511" end="00:45:35.132" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.772" end="00:45:36.391" style="s2">Of course</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.652" end="00:45:36.931" style="s2">Owen...</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.951" end="00:45:37.931" style="s2">although your ability</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.951" end="00:45:39.052" style="s2">is a bit lacking</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.152" end="00:45:41.011" style="s2">My original intended heir was Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.112" end="00:45:42.831" style="s2">but I didn&#39;t expect him to be so foolish</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.851" end="00:45:43.831" style="s2">to even betray you</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.112" end="00:45:44.971" style="s2">So I&#39;ve decided</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.172" end="00:45:46.692" style="s2">to give all the shares under my name</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.871" end="00:45:47.612" style="s2">Grandpa!</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.052" end="00:45:53.991" style="s2">Dad, you&#39;re here</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.132" end="00:45:56.552" style="s2">Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.572" end="00:45:58.810" style="s2">did you really stand up Sinclair for this</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.911" end="00:45:59.971" style="s2">wild girl?</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.391" end="00:46:00.772" style="s2">Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.792" end="00:46:02.351" style="s2">you didn&#39;t get to finish what you were saying</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.712" end="00:46:03.092" style="s2">Well</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.471" end="00:46:05.772" style="s2">since Grandpa has already decided to give me the shares</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.052" end="00:46:07.252" style="s2">it&#39;s not like this changes anything</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.810" end="00:46:09.491" style="s2">I&#39;m actually curious to see what they&#39;re planning</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.810" end="00:46:10.511" style="s2">Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.851" end="00:46:12.031" style="s2">Her name is Nora Sawyer</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.232" end="00:46:13.011" style="s2">She is my wife</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.031" end="00:46:14.132" style="s2">not some wild girl</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.391" end="00:46:15.192" style="s2">As for Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.212" end="00:46:16.371" style="s2">her intentions aren&#39;t pure</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.391" end="00:46:17.971" style="s2">I never intended to marry her</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.991" end="00:46:20.052" style="s2">This is outrageous!</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.172" end="00:46:21.692" style="s2">Making a scene on a night like this!</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.831" end="00:46:23.752" style="s2">And I should leave you the Prescott Group?!</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.931" end="00:46:24.451" style="s2">Dad</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.531" end="00:46:25.752" style="s2">let&#39;s not talk about that for now</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.772" end="00:46:27.692" style="s2">We&#39;re here to wish you a happy birthday</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.632" end="00:46:30.252" style="s2">Nora</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.272" end="00:46:31.572" style="s2">where&#39;s the gift you got for Grandpa?</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.592" end="00:46:33.411" style="s2">I want nothing from her</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.672" end="00:46:34.531" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott.</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.011" end="00:46:36.692" style="s2">I brought you the one thing you want most</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.252" end="00:46:38.652" style="s2">Are you sure you don&#39;t want to take a look?</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.072" end="00:46:39.891" style="s2">Her voice...</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.192" end="00:46:42.471" style="s2">why does it sound so much like Sinclair&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.712" end="00:46:44.011" style="s2">The one thing you desire most?</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.411" end="00:46:45.192" style="s2">Big talk</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.431" end="00:46:47.132" style="s2">I must be getting old and confused</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.152" end="00:46:48.531" style="s2">Sinclair is right here</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.831" end="00:46:49.292" style="s2">Fine</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.572" end="00:46:51.592" style="s2">I&#39;d like to see just what kind of gift you&#39;ve brought me</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.072" end="00:46:56.792" style="s2">Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.851" end="00:46:59.891" style="s2">my gift for you is the lost masterpiece by the painter Corbin</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.011" end="00:47:01.232" style="s2">&#39;The Sunstone Valley</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.931" end="00:47:07.652" style="s2">A Thousand Li of Rivers and Mountains&#39;? Is that the original</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.931" end="00:47:09.232" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that the painting that made the brilliant</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.252" end="00:47:10.652" style="s2">painter Chu Lan famous?</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.831" end="00:47:12.051" style="s2">So many collectors wanted it</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.070" end="00:47:13.272" style="s2">but no one could ever get it</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.292" end="00:47:14.732" style="s2">It&#39;s a shame it&#39;s been lost for so long</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.851" end="00:47:15.310" style="s2">The thing is</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.331" end="00:47:16.971" style="s2">this A Thousand Li of Rivers and Mountains</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.991" end="00:47:18.570" style="s2">How did it end up in her hands?</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.752" end="00:47:20.531" style="s2">It&#39;s really A Thousand Li of Rivers and Mountains</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.632" end="00:47:21.570" style="s2">Where did you get this?</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.011" end="00:47:22.610" style="s2">It&#39;s a secret</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.951" end="00:47:24.051" style="s2">I&#39;ve always wanted to add this</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.070" end="00:47:26.152" style="s2">&#39;A Thousand Li of Rivers and Mountains&#39; to my collection</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.371" end="00:47:27.732" style="s2">What a thoughtful gift from the young lady</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.192" end="00:47:29.752" style="s2">Dad, I&#39;m so happy you like it</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.411" end="00:47:31.292" style="s2">It&#39;s just a pity</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.310" end="00:47:34.252" style="s2">this A Thousand Li of Rivers and Mountains in her hands is a fake</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.491" end="00:47:37.212" style="s2">Did she really try to fool him with a fake?</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.051" end="00:47:40.712" style="s2">Nora Sawyer, what is going on?</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.070" end="00:47:41.991" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.132" end="00:47:43.232" style="s2">you haven&#39;t even looked at it</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.331" end="00:47:44.272" style="s2">How can you say that?</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.652" end="00:47:45.192" style="s2">Because</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.551" end="00:47:46.411" style="s2">I knew Chu Lan</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.051" end="00:47:47.672" style="s2">Back then</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.971" end="00:47:48.971" style="s2">to commemorate his mother</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.070" end="00:47:51.931" style="s2">he personally burned this &#39;A Thousand Li of Rivers and Mountains&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.272" end="00:47:52.851" style="s2">Later</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.871" end="00:47:54.752" style="s2">I kept begging him to make another one</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.871" end="00:47:56.011" style="s2">but he refused no matter what</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.792" end="00:47:58.451" style="s2">So it&#39;s a fake</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.110" end="00:47:59.652" style="s2">This is great</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.991" end="00:48:02.891" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott will definitely despise her even more now</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.610" end="00:48:04.232" style="s2">Strange</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.632" end="00:48:05.810" style="s2">I&#39;m talking about the past</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.971" end="00:48:07.772" style="s2">why is Sinclair reacting like this?</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.070" end="00:48:10.331" style="s2">Chu Lan is obviously Sinclair&#39;s pen name</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.491" end="00:48:12.331" style="s2">Could it be that she doesn&#39;t remember?</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.351" end="00:48:14.090" style="s2">So you&#39;re trying to fool Grandpa with a fake?</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.351" end="00:48:14.732" style="s2">Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.752" end="00:48:16.252" style="s2">is this the amazing wife you married?</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.431" end="00:48:19.411" style="s2">You&#39;ve really disgraced the Prescott family!</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.951" end="00:48:21.590" style="s2">I believe you</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.570" end="00:48:23.031" style="s2">Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.132" end="00:48:24.511" style="s2">even if you know Chu Lan herself....</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.951" end="00:48:25.851" style="s2">it doesn&#39;t mean this painting....</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.871" end="00:48:26.531" style="s2">must be a fake?</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.672" end="00:48:28.491" style="s2">Maybe Chu Lan made another one that you don&#39;t know about</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.991" end="00:48:29.971" style="s2">You should at least take a look</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.491" end="00:48:31.232" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.511" end="00:48:32.212" style="s2">please take a look</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.351" end="00:48:46.170" style="s2">Really?</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.772" end="00:48:47.871" style="s2">So amazing!</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.011" end="00:48:49.310" style="s2">This painting is incredible</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.391" end="00:48:50.772" style="s2">Absolutely incredible</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.170" end="00:48:52.712" style="s2">Can you tell me now where this painting came from?</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.110" end="00:48:53.792" style="s2">I copied it</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.810" end="00:48:54.391" style="s2">How is it?</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.411" end="00:48:55.051" style="s2">Impressive, right?</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.851" end="00:48:56.491" style="s2">This woman....</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.511" end="00:48:57.192" style="s2">what a bitch</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.411" end="00:48:58.590" style="s2">How can she be so lucky?</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.752" end="00:48:59.630" style="s2">It&#39;s just a painting</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.650" end="00:49:00.752" style="s2">I&#39;m still Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.772" end="00:49:02.871" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott will definitely still favor me</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.931" end="00:49:03.712" style="s2">Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.292" end="00:49:05.070" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.090" end="00:49:05.971" style="s2">what can I do for you?</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.411" end="00:49:07.590" style="s2">Come take a look at this painting</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.650" end="00:49:08.391" style="s2">What do you think!</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.650" end="00:49:09.411" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.431" end="00:49:10.272" style="s2">if you say it&#39;s good</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.292" end="00:49:11.551" style="s2">then it must be wonderful</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.851" end="00:49:13.391" style="s2">She has no idea who Chu Lan is</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.411" end="00:49:14.110" style="s2">Why is that?</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.130" end="00:49:14.871" style="s2">Could it be...</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.011" end="00:49:16.589" style="s2">this girl isn&#39;t Sinclair at all?</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.772" end="00:49:17.531" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.551" end="00:49:18.831" style="s2">is there something on my face?</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.891" end="00:49:20.110" style="s2">There must be something fishy going on</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.130" end="00:49:21.511" style="s2">I need to find a chance to investigate</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.650" end="00:49:22.110" style="s2">Oh, no</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.070" end="00:49:23.692" style="s2">Young lady</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.712" end="00:49:24.911" style="s2">where did you get this painting?</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.252" end="00:49:26.110" style="s2">Um, Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.130" end="00:49:27.511" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid I can&#39;t really say</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.570" end="00:49:28.431" style="s2">Oh, alright</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.451" end="00:49:29.511" style="s2">That&#39;s not important</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.570" end="00:49:30.712" style="s2">I like this painting very much</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.732" end="00:49:31.451" style="s2">Thank you</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.891" end="00:49:32.712" style="s2">You&#39;re too kind</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.491" end="00:49:34.391" style="s2">I&#39;m just glad you like it</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.031" end="00:49:36.212" style="s2">How strange</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.232" end="00:49:39.031" style="s2">I actually see a shadow of Sinclair in this girl</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.831" end="00:49:40.212" style="s2">Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.232" end="00:49:41.810" style="s2">this wife of yours is not bad</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.831" end="00:49:43.051" style="s2">No wonder you wanted to marry her</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.070" end="00:49:44.610" style="s2">I almost thought you&#39;d lost your mind</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.911" end="00:49:46.110" style="s2">Grandpa, you have good taste</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.511" end="00:49:47.650" style="s2">Grandpa, didn&#39;t you just say...</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.670" end="00:49:49.692" style="s2">that you were going to give me and Sinclair a big gift?</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.772" end="00:49:51.491" style="s2">Yes, Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.511" end="00:49:52.331" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.451" end="00:49:54.891" style="s2">I will assist Owen well and won&#39;t disappoint you</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.110" end="00:50:01.090" style="s2">I intend to give my shares as a wedding gift to you two</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.070" end="00:50:05.851" style="s2">Is the old man really giving his shares to Owen?</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.551" end="00:50:08.011" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t that make Owen the largest...</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.031" end="00:50:09.310" style="s2">shareholder of the Prescott Group?</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.590" end="00:50:10.011" style="s2">Yeah</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.110" end="00:50:12.292" style="s2">I thought the eldest son&#39;s position as heir was set in stone</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.670" end="00:50:15.051" style="s2">So all the eldest son&#39;s efforts these past two years...</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.070" end="00:50:16.650" style="s2">was it all for someone else&#39;s benefit?</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.110" end="00:50:18.292" style="s2">Dad, you heard them, right?</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.570" end="00:50:19.431" style="s2">For the past two years</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.451" end="00:50:21.772" style="s2">everyone has seen everything Elliot&#39;s done for the Prescott Group</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.011" end="00:50:22.331" style="s2">How could you...</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.391" end="00:50:23.310" style="s2">What&#39;s the problem, Aunt?</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.570" end="00:50:25.190" style="s2">I&#39;d do a better job than him anyway</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.670" end="00:50:26.772" style="s2">Grandpa, don&#39;t you worry</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.891" end="00:50:27.971" style="s2">I won&#39;t let you down</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.150" end="00:50:28.851" style="s2">Elliot, what are we going to do?</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.871" end="00:50:29.471" style="s2">This shouldn&#39;t be happening</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.570" end="00:50:31.110" style="s2">If Elliot loses his position as heir</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.130" end="00:50:32.730" style="s2">Mrs. Prescott will never accept this</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.851" end="00:50:34.851" style="s2">Then doesn&#39;t that mean my mission has failed?</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.431" end="00:50:36.210" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.110" end="00:50:38.331" style="s2">Even if I lose everything I have now</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.351" end="00:50:39.650" style="s2">I can still make a comeback</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.230" end="00:50:41.011" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.710" end="00:50:42.772" style="s2">Sinclair, Owen,</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.792" end="00:50:44.610" style="s2">how does he even compare to our Elliot?</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.951" end="00:50:45.670" style="s2">I&#39;m begging you</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.690" end="00:50:46.792" style="s2">give him another chance</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.051" end="00:50:48.210" style="s2">Aunt, what do you mean by that?</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.391" end="00:50:49.150" style="s2">Mrs. Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.310" end="00:50:50.851" style="s2">if you want me to give Elliot another chance</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.871" end="00:50:51.690" style="s2">that&#39;s possible</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.150" end="00:50:54.051" style="s2">Unless he gets on his knees and begs me</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.431" end="00:50:54.750" style="s2">You...</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.772" end="00:50:55.851" style="s2">Mistaken, Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.991" end="00:50:57.011" style="s2">The engagement&#39;s off</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.250" end="00:50:58.170" style="s2">And I don&#39;t regret it</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.190" end="00:50:58.810" style="s2">You!</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.851" end="00:50:59.630" style="s2">Fine</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.871" end="00:51:01.529" style="s2">Then don&#39;t blame me for what&#39;s next</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.871" end="00:51:02.411" style="s2">Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.431" end="00:51:04.170" style="s2">I&#39;m officially marrying Owen Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.190" end="00:51:04.710" style="s2">Now</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.730" end="00:51:06.210" style="s2">announce who gets the shares</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.351" end="00:51:08.210" style="s2">Sinclair will never be a Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.670" end="00:51:10.971" style="s2">I am splitting my 40% of shares into two...</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.630" end="00:51:15.031" style="s2">thirty-five percent...</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.951" end="00:51:18.690" style="s2">Among them</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.090" end="00:51:21.831" style="s2">thirty-five percent of the shares are left to Elliot Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.250" end="00:51:23.831" style="s2">From now on</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.851" end="00:51:26.070" style="s2">he is the rightful heir of our Prescott Group</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.730" end="00:51:28.931" style="s2">The remaining five percent</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.031" end="00:51:30.011" style="s2">are left to Owen</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.110" end="00:51:30.831" style="s2">No, no, no</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.190" end="00:51:31.431" style="s2">Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.451" end="00:51:32.371" style="s2">did you make a mistake?</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.491" end="00:51:34.130" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you say you&#39;d give me all the shares?</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.391" end="00:51:36.210" style="s2">I said I would give the shares under my name</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.230" end="00:51:37.670" style="s2">as a wedding gift for you two</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.770" end="00:51:39.270" style="s2">But I never said all of them were</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.630" end="00:51:42.090" style="s2">Besides, you&#39;re still a long way from</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.110" end="00:51:43.991" style="s2">being as capable as your brother Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.871" end="00:51:45.531" style="s2">No, but Grandpa!</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.551" end="00:51:46.750" style="s2">I&#39;m going to marry Sinclair!</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.810" end="00:51:47.750" style="s2">Yes, Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.891" end="00:51:49.551" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you say you&#39;d be at ease with me here?</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.670" end="00:51:50.570" style="s2">You are indeed Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.590" end="00:51:51.650" style="s2">and of course I&#39;m reassured</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.670" end="00:51:52.871" style="s2">But your last name is Crane</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.431" end="00:51:53.991" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.331" end="00:51:55.750" style="s2">Are you questioning my decision?</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.770" end="00:51:56.590" style="s2">We wouldn&#39;t dare</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.150" end="00:51:58.831" style="s2">I&#39;m tired</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.931" end="00:52:00.070" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave you all to it</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.190" end="00:52:01.650" style="s2">Elliot, come with me for a moment</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.911" end="00:52:02.690" style="s2">Yes</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.011" end="00:52:03.690" style="s2">Grab something to eat</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.871" end="00:52:04.750" style="s2">I&#39;ll find you in a bit</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.650" end="00:52:07.710" style="s2">Come on, let&#39;s get out of here</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.730" end="00:52:08.491" style="s2">What a scene</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.690" end="00:52:09.991" style="s2">Thirty-five percent!</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.570" end="00:52:12.810" style="s2">Nora, I&#39;m not dreaming, am I?</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.130" end="00:52:14.871" style="s2">Auntie, you&#39;re not dreaming</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.391" end="00:52:17.911" style="s2">Elliot is now the largest shareholder of the Prescott Group</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.971" end="00:52:19.110" style="s2">So you have nothing to worry about</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.130" end="00:52:20.511" style="s2">Oh, that&#39;s wonderful!</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.570" end="00:52:21.190" style="s2">Nora</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.290" end="00:52:23.070" style="s2">You really are Elliot&#39;s lucky star</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.210" end="00:52:24.431" style="s2">Tell me, what do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.551" end="00:52:25.110" style="s2">Anything</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.230" end="00:52:27.250" style="s2">If it&#39;s in my power, it&#39;s yours</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.570" end="00:52:28.270" style="s2">Auntie</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.391" end="00:52:30.951" style="s2">I just hope you won&#39;t interfere with Elliot&#39;s marriage in the future</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.230" end="00:52:32.230" style="s2">Now that he&#39;s secure</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.371" end="00:52:33.471" style="s2">I&#39;ll stay out of your way</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.810" end="00:52:34.590" style="s2">That&#39;s good</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.971" end="00:52:36.810" style="s2">So, mission accomplished, right?</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.270" end="00:52:39.670" style="s2">Dad</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.150" end="00:52:41.210" style="s2">What should we do now?</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.630" end="00:52:42.451" style="s2">Elliot Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.610" end="00:52:44.130" style="s2">He refuses to marry me no matter what</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.391" end="00:52:46.011" style="s2">And Owen Prescott is useless</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.210" end="00:52:48.031" style="s2">If we don&#39;t find a way to get the Crane Group shares</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.290" end="00:52:50.090" style="s2">The board will start to suspect my identity</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.310" end="00:52:51.371" style="s2">This shouldn&#39;t be happening</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.610" end="00:52:53.270" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott&#39;s affection for Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.290" end="00:52:54.810" style="s2">He would never give her so few shares</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.831" end="00:52:57.170" style="s2">Grandpa Prescott was originally going to give us all the shares</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.331" end="00:52:58.511" style="s2">It was all because of Nora Sawyer</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.531" end="00:52:59.690" style="s2">That he changed his mind</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.810" end="00:53:00.590" style="s2">Her again</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.690" end="00:53:01.451" style="s2">Damn it</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.471" end="00:53:02.971" style="s2">Could the real Sinclair have sent her?</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.070" end="00:53:04.210" style="s2">I don&#39;t care who she is</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.310" end="00:53:05.531" style="s2">She can&#39;t leave here alive</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.690" end="00:53:06.090" style="s2">Right</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.210" end="00:53:06.810" style="s2">We can&#39;t let her</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.031" end="00:53:07.891" style="s2">I&#39;ll handle it now</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.371" end="00:53:10.931" style="s2">Eleanor, just using the restroom</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.070" end="00:53:12.270" style="s2">Alright, go ahead</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.730" end="00:53:18.491" style="s2">That painting</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.511" end="00:53:21.570" style="s2">&#39;A Thousand Li of Rivers and Mountains,&#39; where did you get it?</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.411" end="00:53:22.810" style="s2">Well</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.831" end="00:53:23.730" style="s2">I want the truth!</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.750" end="00:53:24.551" style="s2">Even if you stole it</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.570" end="00:53:25.650" style="s2">I won&#39;t blame you</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.230" end="00:53:28.051" style="s2">That painting was copied by Nora Sawyer</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.070" end="00:53:28.730" style="s2">It&#39;s a copy</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.750" end="00:53:29.690" style="s2">Impossible</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.770" end="00:53:31.250" style="s2">That painting is by Chu Lan</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.270" end="00:53:32.770" style="s2">I&#39;m never wrong about her work</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.670" end="00:53:35.371" style="s2">That painting is Nora Sawyer&#39;s work</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.391" end="00:53:36.491" style="s2">I know it might be hard to believe</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.511" end="00:53:37.971" style="s2">but she&#39;s really that talented</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.150" end="00:53:39.371" style="s2">Have you heard of &#39;Whale Fall&#39;?</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.931" end="00:53:41.710" style="s2">They say that piece was composed by Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.011" end="00:53:44.851" style="s2">but Sinclair can&#39;t even play it herself anymore and Nora can</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.170" end="00:53:45.730" style="s2">Whale Fall</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.991" end="00:53:47.511" style="s2">A Thousand Miles of Rivers and Mountains</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.531" end="00:53:48.931" style="s2">those are both Sinclair&#39;s works!</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.090" end="00:53:49.570" style="s2">Could it be?</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.670" end="00:53:50.650" style="s2">Is she Sinclair?</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.730" end="00:53:50.951" style="s2">Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.971" end="00:53:51.971" style="s2">what are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.150" end="00:53:53.531" style="s2">Forget &#39;Whale Fall&#39; for a second</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.670" end="00:53:55.971" style="s2">&#39;A Thousand Miles of Rivers and Mountains&#39; is by the artist Chu Lan</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.991" end="00:53:57.310" style="s2">What does that have to do with Sinclair?</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.250" end="00:53:59.011" style="s2">You don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.190" end="00:54:00.770" style="s2">Chu Lan is Sinclair&#39;s pen name</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.790" end="00:54:03.351" style="s2">And I suspect now Nora Sawyer is the real Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.371" end="00:54:04.690" style="s2">The one we know is an impostor</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.650" end="00:54:08.610" style="s2">Grandpa, are you sure you&#39;re not overthinking this?</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.730" end="00:54:10.130" style="s2">This Nora Sawyer and Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.150" end="00:54:11.511" style="s2">they have absolutely nothing in common</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.810" end="00:54:12.210" style="s2">Besides</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.270" end="00:54:13.730" style="s2">Nora Sawyer has her own family</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.851" end="00:54:15.471" style="s2">She&#39;s a complete stranger to the Cranes</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.730" end="00:54:17.250" style="s2">How could she possibly be Sinclair?</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.371" end="00:54:18.170" style="s2">It&#39;s possible</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.292" end="00:54:19.531" style="s2">that she has amnesia</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.650" end="00:54:21.411" style="s2">and doesn&#39;t remember who she really is</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.650" end="00:54:23.331" style="s2">As for her face</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.451" end="00:54:25.130" style="s2">that can be changed with plastic surgery</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.250" end="00:54:25.431" style="s2">Of course</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.491" end="00:54:26.650" style="s2">this is all just a theory</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.770" end="00:54:27.891" style="s2">But I&#39;m sure of one thing</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.011" end="00:54:29.570" style="s2">that Sinclair is a fraud!</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.351" end="00:54:30.931" style="s2">Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.051" end="00:54:32.411" style="s2">you knew Sinclair as an adult</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.531" end="00:54:33.250" style="s2">What was she like?</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.690" end="00:54:36.570" style="s2">Brilliant, kind and so talented. Brilliant, kind and so</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.690" end="00:54:37.250" style="s2">If she weren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.270" end="00:54:39.290" style="s2">why else would I admire her so much?</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.851" end="00:54:40.931" style="s2">So from what you&#39;ve said</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.292" end="00:54:43.331" style="s2">the current Sinclair must be an impostor</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.730" end="00:54:45.570" style="s2">The Cranes moved here three years ago</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.810" end="00:54:47.411" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid she was replaced then</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.130" end="00:54:49.871" style="s2">Oh, in over three years</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.891" end="00:54:51.770" style="s2">I never heard a single word from Sinclair</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.851" end="00:54:54.670" style="s2">I just assumed she was busy with her company</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.792" end="00:54:56.170" style="s2">I didn&#39;t think anything of it</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.270" end="00:54:57.831" style="s2">Besides</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.851" end="00:54:59.810" style="s2">she&#39;s the sole heir to the Song Group</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.971" end="00:55:01.210" style="s2">her mother left all her shares to her</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.230" end="00:55:01.750" style="s2">Wait</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.770" end="00:55:05.750" style="s2">Could it be that Gordon Crane</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.770" end="00:55:07.531" style="s2">in order to seize the Song Group</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.730" end="00:55:10.331" style="s2">killed Sinclair and then found someone to impersonate her?</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.349" end="00:55:12.031" style="s2">I remember</p>
<p begin="00:55:12.371" end="00:55:14.770" style="s2">Leo Chen, Crane&#39;s son-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.250" end="00:55:15.831" style="s2">Oh, God!</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.891" end="00:55:18.250" style="s2">If that&#39;s true, Sinclair must have suffered so much!</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.371" end="00:55:20.371" style="s2">And me, I&#39;m so old and useless</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.491" end="00:55:22.531" style="s2">I&#39;m so old, how did I not see it?</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.770" end="00:55:24.292" style="s2">Grandpa, I&#39;ll handle it</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.471" end="00:55:25.090" style="s2">Then go</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.210" end="00:55:26.250" style="s2">Go now, quickly</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.371" end="00:55:26.891" style="s2">Okay</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.011" end="00:55:27.570" style="s2">Wait</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.730" end="00:55:30.150" style="s2">And this Nora Sawyer, if</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.170" end="00:55:32.750" style="s2">she isn&#39;t Sinclair, you have to find out what happened to her</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.011" end="00:55:33.610" style="s2">I know</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.971" end="00:55:34.690" style="s2">Leave it to me</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.011" end="00:55:38.810" style="s2">Stay alive</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.531" end="00:55:42.451" style="s2">Oh, you take such good care of yourself</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.292" end="00:55:45.752" style="s2">Mom, where&#39;s Nora?</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.931" end="00:55:47.712" style="s2">Elliot</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.732" end="00:55:49.391" style="s2">Have you forgotten what your grandfather told you?</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.531" end="00:55:50.110" style="s2">Oh</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.130" end="00:55:51.511" style="s2">You&#39;re asking about Nora</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.772" end="00:55:53.031" style="s2">What&#39;s taking her so long?</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.971" end="00:55:54.831" style="s2">Where did she go?</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.391" end="00:55:56.130" style="s2">She went to the restroom</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.150" end="00:55:56.672" style="s2">But it&#39;s been...</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.692" end="00:55:57.590" style="s2">over ten minutes now</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.810" end="00:55:59.692" style="s2">I&#39;ll go find her</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.431" end="00:56:01.272" style="s2">That silly boy...</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.292" end="00:56:03.070" style="s2">can&#39;t he go one minute without her?</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.252" end="00:56:04.031" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.051" end="00:56:04.732" style="s2">Who sent you?</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.011" end="00:56:06.031" style="s2">What are we doing?</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.172" end="00:56:06.951" style="s2">Sending you on your way</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.971" end="00:56:07.672" style="s2">of course!</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.773" end="00:56:13.753" style="s2">Nora, Mom isn&#39;t going to make it</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.614" end="00:56:16.833" style="s2">You have to be careful of your father</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.253" end="00:56:17.992" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid he...</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.012" end="00:56:18.674" style="s2">Ah...</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.692" end="00:56:19.833" style="s2">Mom!</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.692" end="00:56:22.713" style="s2">Nora, you&#39;re still young</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.813" end="00:56:26.273" style="s2">It&#39;s better if I manage the Crane Group</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.293" end="00:56:27.751" style="s2">My mother&#39;s body is barely cold</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.773" end="00:56:29.873" style="s2">and you&#39;re already bringing your illegitimate daughter home</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.893" end="00:56:31.713" style="s2">Now you want to take over the Crane Group?</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.733" end="00:56:32.833" style="s2">What are you really after?!</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.094" end="00:56:34.192" style="s2">You brought that woman back</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.213" end="00:56:36.134" style="s2">and now you have the nerve to ask me for the Crane Group?</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.453" end="00:56:37.154" style="s2">Please let me out!</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.313" end="00:56:37.472" style="s2">Ah!</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.313" end="00:56:39.373" style="s2">in your dreams</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.432" end="00:56:44.093" style="s2">Mom, how&#39;s Nora?</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.852" end="00:56:45.633" style="s2">She&#39;s okay</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.932" end="00:56:47.432" style="s2">Just a mild concussion</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.932" end="00:56:49.213" style="s2">She&#39;ll wake up soon</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.232" end="00:56:50.352" style="s2">Do we know who did this?</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.412" end="00:56:53.472" style="s2">Still looking into it</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.932" end="00:56:55.912" style="s2">But I&#39;m almost sure it was Anne and her daughter</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.932" end="00:56:59.113" style="s2">That can&#39;t be right</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.573" end="00:57:00.993" style="s2">When Nora ruined the wedding...</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.013" end="00:57:02.033" style="s2">they didn&#39;t do anything</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.432" end="00:57:03.213" style="s2">Why now?</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.252" end="00:57:04.912" style="s2">Because they&#39;re starting to suspect</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.932" end="00:57:05.713" style="s2">who Nora is</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.732" end="00:57:06.713" style="s2">It&#39;s her identity</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.732" end="00:57:08.312" style="s2">They want to kill her to silence her</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.693" end="00:57:09.472" style="s2">Identity?</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.213" end="00:57:11.073" style="s2">What identity?</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.093" end="00:57:12.113" style="s2">Grandpa told me...</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.133" end="00:57:14.312" style="s2">the Crane family&#39;s heiress is an imposter</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.332" end="00:57:14.972" style="s2">What?!</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.772" end="00:57:18.033" style="s2">Which means Nora might be the real Crane heiress</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.093" end="00:57:20.193" style="s2">Are you kidding me?</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.493" end="00:57:22.432" style="s2">Your grandfather&#39;s illness has him confused</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.452" end="00:57:23.713" style="s2">but have you lost your mind</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.732" end="00:57:23.872" style="s2">too?</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.892" end="00:57:25.952" style="s2">You can&#39;t possibly believe something so absurd</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.972" end="00:57:27.832" style="s2">I&#39;ve already had my assistant investigating</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.852" end="00:57:29.352" style="s2">The truth will come out soon enough</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.332" end="00:57:32.113" style="s2">Nora?</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.352" end="00:57:33.993" style="s2">You&#39;re awake</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.452" end="00:57:35.432" style="s2">How are you feeling?</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.653" end="00:57:39.432" style="s2">I&#39;m fine</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.732" end="00:57:40.533" style="s2">Oh, sweetie</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.553" end="00:57:42.832" style="s2">You&#39;ve got a concussion and you&#39;re telling me you&#39;re fine?</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.133" end="00:57:44.312" style="s2">Thanks to this hit to the head</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.332" end="00:57:45.792" style="s2">I&#39;ve regained my memories</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.812" end="00:57:46.352" style="s2">Otherwise</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.372" end="00:57:47.432" style="s2">who knows when I would&#39;ve...</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.452" end="00:57:49.252" style="s2">gotten the chance to make Gordon Crane</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.272" end="00:57:51.033" style="s2">and Elaine Crane pay for what they did</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.133" end="00:57:53.232" style="s2">and take back everything that belongs to me</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.653" end="00:57:55.113" style="s2">I can&#39;t believe that after everything</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.332" end="00:57:56.553" style="s2">I still married him</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.013" end="00:57:58.952" style="s2">Good thing this marriage was all just an act</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.573" end="00:58:00.713" style="s2">It&#39;s time to end it</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.573" end="00:58:02.133" style="s2">Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.153" end="00:58:02.952" style="s2">Prescott</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.772" end="00:58:05.392" style="s2">Your mother has promised me not to</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.412" end="00:58:07.113" style="s2">interfere with your marriage anymore</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.573" end="00:58:10.553" style="s2">My mission is complete</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.993" end="00:58:18.772" style="s2">Why do you call him Mr. Pei?</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.894" end="00:58:19.993" style="s2">And what mission?</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.493" end="00:58:22.272" style="s2">Oh!</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.854" end="00:58:24.472" style="s2">You two really are lying to me</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.053" end="00:58:26.193" style="s2">Nora, you must have hit your head</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.213" end="00:58:27.354" style="s2">You&#39;re just confused</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.414" end="00:58:29.033" style="s2">That&#39;s why you&#39;re having these strange ideas</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.053" end="00:58:30.673" style="s2">The doctor said you need to get some rest</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.173" end="00:58:32.153" style="s2">I&#39;m serious</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.472" end="00:58:35.252" style="s2">Nora!</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.193" end="00:58:37.972" style="s2">She&#39;s fine</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.053" end="00:58:39.272" style="s2">She&#39;s just exhausted</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.334" end="00:58:40.153" style="s2">Let her rest</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.454" end="00:58:43.133" style="s2">Just tell me the truth</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.153" end="00:58:44.633" style="s2">What is really going on here?</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.334" end="00:58:47.193" style="s2">Mom, let&#39;s go outside to talk</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.193" end="00:58:52.972" style="s2">Speak</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.693" end="00:58:56.394" style="s2">Nora is an actress I hired</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.374" end="00:59:00.113" style="s2">I hired her to crash the wedding and act like we were a couple...</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.252" end="00:59:01.232" style="s2">and ultimately</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.252" end="00:59:02.513" style="s2">get into a fake marriage</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.934" end="00:59:05.993" style="s2">I knew it!</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.314" end="00:59:06.874" style="s2">You brat</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.894" end="00:59:08.472" style="s2">how could you do something like this?</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.533" end="00:59:09.633" style="s2">You forced my hand</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.934" end="00:59:10.752" style="s2">But that&#39;s not the point</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.772" end="00:59:12.713" style="s2">The point is...</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.294" end="00:59:14.314" style="s2">I&#39;ve fallen for her</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.334" end="00:59:15.513" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to divorce her</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.854" end="00:59:17.593" style="s2">I figured that out a long time ago</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.814" end="00:59:18.633" style="s2">But Nora...</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.653" end="00:59:20.513" style="s2">she doesn&#39;t seem to feel the same way about you</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.573" end="00:59:21.794" style="s2">She wants to divorce you</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.732" end="00:59:23.874" style="s2">That&#39;s why I need your help</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.334" end="00:59:25.354" style="s2">I can&#39;t help you with that</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.894" end="00:59:26.752" style="s2">Yes, you can</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.533" end="00:59:28.314" style="s2">You can</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.454" end="00:59:29.633" style="s2">You&#39;ll pretend to be angry</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.653" end="00:59:31.113" style="s2">and then order us to get a divorce</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.894" end="00:59:32.794" style="s2">And finally</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.854" end="00:59:34.354" style="s2">force me to go on blind dates</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.454" end="00:59:34.972" style="s2">That way</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.993" end="00:59:36.513" style="s2">I&#39;ll have a reason not to divorce her</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.732" end="00:59:37.834" style="s2">You want me to play the bad cop</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.854" end="00:59:38.314" style="s2">huh?</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.113" end="00:59:42.513" style="s2">Mom, Nora is so smart and capable</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.754" end="00:59:44.693" style="s2">Do you really want to lose a daughter-in-law like her?</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.774" end="00:59:45.454" style="s2">Besides</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.472" end="00:59:47.414" style="s2">she might even be the real Elaine Crane</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.794" end="00:59:50.934" style="s2">Then what do you want me to do?</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.274" end="00:59:51.814" style="s2">Anyway</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.834" end="00:59:52.914" style="s2">I&#39;m not going to be the bad guy</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.934" end="00:59:53.454" style="s2">Oh, you&#39;ve been...</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.472" end="00:59:54.954" style="s2">the bad guy for so long</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.472" end="00:59:56.613" style="s2">just do it one more time</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.472" end="00:59:59.214" style="s2">I&#39;m never marrying anyone but Nora</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.693" end="01:00:00.133" style="s2">You!</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.153" end="01:00:00.854" style="s2">You brat!</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.874" end="01:00:02.133" style="s2">Are you threatening me again?</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.573" end="01:00:03.354" style="s2">Forget it</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.472" end="01:00:05.013" style="s2">I&#39;ll help you just this one more time</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.073" end="01:00:05.934" style="s2">Then this time</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.314" end="01:00:07.734" style="s2">you&#39;d better not let me down</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.693" end="01:00:09.472" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.394" end="01:00:16.533" style="s2">You brat, how dare you lie to me!</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.073" end="01:00:18.053" style="s2">Divorce her right now!</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.073" end="01:00:19.972" style="s2">And then you&#39;ll start going on blind dates</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.993" end="01:00:21.972" style="s2">there are plenty of wealthy young ladies in this</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.113" end="01:00:23.613" style="s2">I&#39;ve already arranged them for you</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.914" end="01:00:25.854" style="s2">Mom, why must you force me?</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.874" end="01:00:26.693" style="s2">Because I&#39;m your mother</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.714" end="01:00:28.093" style="s2">and everything I do is for your own good</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.113" end="01:00:29.454" style="s2">Tomorrow is the Zhao family...</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.033" end="01:00:32.454" style="s2">Mrs Davis, the day after tomorrow is Mrs Quinn</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.472" end="01:00:34.173" style="s2">and the day after that, Mrs Cole</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.434" end="01:00:35.972" style="s2">You must choose one of the three</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.234" end="01:00:37.774" style="s2">Mrs</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.794" end="01:00:38.573" style="s2">Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.714" end="01:00:40.013" style="s2">Nora, you&#39;re awake</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.133" end="01:00:41.914" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.553" end="01:00:46.434" style="s2">You promised me you&#39;d give Elliot the freedom</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.454" end="01:00:47.533" style="s2">to choose his own marriage</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.073" end="01:00:50.533" style="s2">So what if I changed my mind, Mrs Prester?</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.553" end="01:00:52.693" style="s2">Elliot has already secured his position as the heir</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.714" end="01:00:54.053" style="s2">Why are you still doing this?</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.113" end="01:00:54.894" style="s2">Well...</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.954" end="01:00:56.214" style="s2">he shouldn&#39;t have lied to me!...</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.234" end="01:00:58.774" style="s2">Anyway, if he dares to disobey me...</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.874" end="01:01:00.774" style="s2">I&#39;ll drop dead on the spot!</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.894" end="01:01:01.673" style="s2">Hmph</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.073" end="01:01:07.734" style="s2">Oh, my lifelong reputation...</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.754" end="01:01:08.493" style="s2">Oh</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.472" end="01:01:17.533" style="s2">You saw it yourself</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.894" end="01:01:18.673" style="s2">If we get a divorce</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.693" end="01:01:19.874" style="s2">my mom won&#39;t let me go</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.093" end="01:01:22.874" style="s2">But...</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.553" end="01:01:24.334" style="s2">But what?</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.854" end="01:01:26.472" style="s2">Our agreement was for one year</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.734" end="01:01:27.513" style="s2">One year</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.693" end="01:01:28.493" style="s2">The year isn&#39;t up yet</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.513" end="01:01:29.673" style="s2">so we have to keep this up</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.254" end="01:01:35.033" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell my mom that even though it was a fake marriage at first</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.053" end="01:01:36.033" style="s2">we&#39;ve fallen in love</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.493" end="01:01:38.274" style="s2">This...</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.493" end="01:01:39.754" style="s2">how is that supposed to work?</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.693" end="01:01:42.193" style="s2">Why wouldn&#39;t it work?</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.214" end="01:01:43.472" style="s2">This is what we&#39;ve always done</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.854" end="01:01:45.714" style="s2">Is it that hard to just keep up the act?</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.374" end="01:01:49.274" style="s2">But I have more important things to do now</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.314" end="01:01:51.093" style="s2">More important things...</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.894" end="01:01:52.673" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.934" end="01:01:53.794" style="s2">Whatever you need to do</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.814" end="01:01:54.633" style="s2">I&#39;ll help you</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.254" end="01:01:56.553" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to tell me</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.613" end="01:01:57.874" style="s2">Just do what you need to do</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.294" end="01:01:59.234" style="s2">I&#39;ll back you up</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.734" end="01:02:01.472" style="s2">But...</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.493" end="01:02:01.914" style="s2">But what?</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.934" end="01:02:03.834" style="s2">I thought you were the professional here</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.854" end="01:02:05.633" style="s2">Is this your standard of professionalism?</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.874" end="01:02:07.653" style="s2">Fine</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.972" end="01:02:08.794" style="s2">I promise</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.294" end="01:02:11.954" style="s2">Whatever</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.972" end="01:02:14.751" style="s2">I&#39;ll just stay for now and take it one step at a time</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.334" end="01:02:16.113" style="s2">That&#39;s good</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.653" end="01:02:22.073" style="s2">My mom could come in at any moment</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.093" end="01:02:23.274" style="s2">so we have to start now</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.133" end="01:02:24.993" style="s2">How do we act?</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.111" end="01:02:30.411" style="s2">you little rascal</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.750" end="01:02:32.170" style="s2">you really couldn&#39;t wait</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.230" end="01:02:34.730" style="s2">hey</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.891" end="01:02:35.670" style="s2">You two!</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.891" end="01:02:36.891" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.578" end="01:02:40.757" style="s2">Mom, we couldn&#39;t help ourselves</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.657" end="01:02:44.637" style="s2">You said this was a fake marriage</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.858" end="01:02:46.398" style="s2">It was, at first</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.958" end="01:02:47.737" style="s2">But now...</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.418" end="01:02:52.598" style="s2">we&#39;ve fallen in love</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.217" end="01:02:54.038" style="s2">Sorry, Mom</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.217" end="01:02:55.277" style="s2">We&#39;re not breaking up</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.297" end="01:02:56.317" style="s2">I don&#39;t believe it</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.358" end="01:02:57.137" style="s2">You don&#39;t?</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.177" end="01:02:58.038" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll prove it</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.058" end="01:02:58.958" style="s2">I&#39;ll show you</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.190" end="01:03:06.970" style="s2">She&#39;s gone</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.869" end="01:03:09.970" style="s2">Looks like she bought it</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.789" end="01:03:12.289" style="s2">Now that your mom believes us</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.389" end="01:03:13.329" style="s2">you can stop</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.789" end="01:03:14.570" style="s2">Stop what?</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.670" end="01:03:15.729" style="s2">You mean kissing you?</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.269" end="01:03:17.729" style="s2">Don&#39;t forget, at the wedding...</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.789" end="01:03:18.809" style="s2">but you kissed me</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.070" end="01:03:20.650" style="s2">And you stole my first kiss</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.590" end="01:03:22.610" style="s2">That was different!</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.949" end="01:03:23.970" style="s2">I was just playing my part</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.990" end="01:03:24.729" style="s2">that&#39;s all</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.990" end="01:03:27.769" style="s2">But you...</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.590" end="01:03:30.369" style="s2">you seem to be taking advantage of me</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.190" end="01:03:33.090" style="s2">What about me?</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.269" end="01:03:35.210" style="s2">Uh, nothing</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.329" end="01:03:35.929" style="s2">Um</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.949" end="01:03:37.249" style="s2">I think I&#39;m pretty much recovered</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.269" end="01:03:38.449" style="s2">Can I be discharged</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.269" end="01:03:42.130" style="s2">We&#39;ll leave as soon as the doctor clears you</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.429" end="01:03:43.210" style="s2">By the way...</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.150" end="01:03:47.570" style="s2">Do you still remember what the person who hurt you looked like?</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.389" end="01:03:50.249" style="s2">I don&#39;t remember</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.949" end="01:03:52.809" style="s2">It&#39;s okay</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.030" end="01:03:54.849" style="s2">I&#39;ve already sent people to investigate</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.749" end="01:03:56.610" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.829" end="01:03:58.729" style="s2">I won&#39;t let whoever hurt you get away with it</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.749" end="01:03:59.190" style="s2">Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.210" end="01:03:59.530" style="s2">Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.550" end="01:04:00.729" style="s2">you don&#39;t have to do this</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.070" end="01:04:02.369" style="s2">This is a fake marriage</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.070" end="01:04:04.729" style="s2">But our marriage certificate is real</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.070" end="01:04:06.170" style="s2">Legally speaking...</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.470" end="01:04:07.650" style="s2">you are my wife</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.829" end="01:04:10.970" style="s2">Your business is my business</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.908" end="01:04:16.710" style="s2">Sir, I&#39;ve confirmed that Gordon Crane did have an illegitimate daughter, Irene Cheng</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.730" end="01:04:17.788" style="s2">but records show she was</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.810" end="01:04:19.350" style="s2">suddenly declared dead 3 years ago</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.730" end="01:04:21.590" style="s2">oh, and this is a photo of her from that time</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.630" end="01:04:25.609" style="s2">she&#39;s a dead ringer for the woman we have now</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.989" end="01:04:28.408" style="s2">so she must be the one impersonating Sonia Thornton</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.470" end="01:04:29.569" style="s2">it&#39;s highly likely, sir</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.029" end="01:04:30.609" style="s2">unfortunately</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.630" end="01:04:32.850" style="s2">I can&#39;t find anything on what happened three years ago</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.908" end="01:04:34.368" style="s2">all evidence has been wiped clean</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.069" end="01:04:36.730" style="s2">but from Nora&#39;s side</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.069" end="01:04:37.850" style="s2">I did find a clue</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.328" end="01:04:39.828" style="s2">speak</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.029" end="01:04:44.408" style="s2">the Sterling family does have a daughter named Nora</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.510" end="01:04:46.010" style="s2">it said she went missing as a child</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.550" end="01:04:48.010" style="s2">three years ago, the Stirlings announced</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.029" end="01:04:50.130" style="s2">she&#39;d returned and that would be Nora</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.109" end="01:04:52.948" style="s2">Three years ago again</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.390" end="01:04:53.689" style="s2">yes</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.230" end="01:04:58.810" style="s2">I heard Nora was disfigured in a fire. Her parents,</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.029" end="01:05:01.328" style="s2">the Stirlings, apparently spent all their savings</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.350" end="01:05:03.189" style="s2">on her treatment and reconstructive surgery</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.149" end="01:05:04.770" style="s2">disfigured</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.670" end="01:05:06.930" style="s2">no wonder she looks so different</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.948" end="01:05:10.529" style="s2">so Nora must be Sonia Thornton</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.550" end="01:05:12.970" style="s2">Gordon and Elaine Crane</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.270" end="01:05:14.890" style="s2">they tried to kill her in that fire</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.788" end="01:05:18.050" style="s2">she survived and was saved</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.510" end="01:05:23.368" style="s2">it seems so, but for now</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.390" end="01:05:24.569" style="s2">it&#39;s all just speculation</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.069" end="01:05:26.090" style="s2">it&#39;s just a theory</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.390" end="01:05:27.130" style="s2">without proof</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.149" end="01:05:29.328" style="s2">she can&#39;t reclaim her place as the Thornton heir</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.109" end="01:05:32.130" style="s2">we&#39;ll find a chance</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.828" end="01:05:33.930" style="s2">watch Gordon and Elaine</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.149" end="01:05:36.050" style="s2">they&#39;re onto Nora and they won&#39;t give up</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.470" end="01:05:37.248" style="s2">yes sir</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.850" end="01:05:46.050" style="s2">so you are the real Sonia Thorne</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.470" end="01:05:48.090" style="s2">just like the Sonia Thorne in my memory</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.510" end="01:05:49.288" style="s2">smart and lovely</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.788" end="01:05:51.930" style="s2">if only I had kept in touch with you all these years</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.310" end="01:05:53.770" style="s2">then perhaps your father wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.788" end="01:05:55.189" style="s2">have dared to be so cruel to you</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.189" end="01:05:58.970" style="s2">doctor, how&#39;s Nara?</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.409" end="01:06:01.430" style="s2">she&#39;s fine. she&#39;s ready to be discharged</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.010" end="01:06:02.470" style="s2">great</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.670" end="01:06:03.329" style="s2">I&#39;ll just</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.350" end="01:06:03.369" style="s2">I&#39;ll just</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.130" end="01:06:06.949" style="s2">oh, whoa</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.050" end="01:06:08.710" style="s2">you don&#39;t have to do that. I can walk</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.449" end="01:06:10.430" style="s2">you&#39;re still too weak</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.689" end="01:06:11.550" style="s2">you shouldn&#39;t be walking</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.930" end="01:06:12.789" style="s2">I&#39;ve got you</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.010" end="01:06:14.989" style="s2">doctor, am I right?</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.930" end="01:06:17.109" style="s2">uh, yes</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.649" end="01:06:19.029" style="s2">see, doctor&#39;s orders</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.489" end="01:06:23.430" style="s2">what did you say?</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.010" end="01:06:26.869" style="s2">Nora was discharged unharmed</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.329" end="01:06:30.149" style="s2">yes, and Mr. Prescott carried her out himself</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.569" end="01:06:33.270" style="s2">damn it, how did that bitch get so lucky?</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.890" end="01:06:39.949" style="s2">Elaine, what&#39;s wrong now, Dad?</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.890" end="01:06:42.789" style="s2">that bitch Nora isn&#39;t dead</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.970" end="01:06:45.550" style="s2">and I&#39;m more certain than ever</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.569" end="01:06:47.069" style="s2">she is Song Ting Xue</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.369" end="01:06:51.149" style="s2">otherwise, why would she just show up out of</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.170" end="01:06:52.550" style="s2">the blue to work against me</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.329" end="01:06:56.270" style="s2">we have to find a way to get rid of her now</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.689" end="01:06:57.710" style="s2">no, no</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.770" end="01:07:01.710" style="s2">Elliot Prescott is already watching us</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.890" end="01:07:03.748" style="s2">we don&#39;t have a chance to make a move now</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.170" end="01:07:05.350" style="s2">then what should we do?</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.529" end="01:07:09.949" style="s2">don&#39;t worry, we&#39;ll prove you&#39;re you</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.090" end="01:07:11.310" style="s2">we take the Song Group</p>
<p begin="01:07:11.569" end="01:07:13.510" style="s2">then Song Ting Wen will be powerless</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.770" end="01:07:14.550" style="s2">dead or alive</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.409" end="01:07:18.069" style="s2">but I can&#39;t prove my identity right now</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.090" end="01:07:19.789" style="s2">if I could, this whole thing would be over</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.730" end="01:07:23.989" style="s2">what if I told you I could get</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.010" end="01:07:25.649" style="s2">my hands on Song Tingyi&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.130" end="01:07:28.270" style="s2">but isn&#39;t she already dead?</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.930" end="01:07:30.050" style="s2">that I don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.090" end="01:07:32.510" style="s2">when Song Tingyi was born</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.529" end="01:07:32.770" style="s2">her mother saved her umbilical cord blood</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.970" end="01:07:36.770" style="s2">the only thing is, I don&#39;t know where it is</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.789" end="01:07:37.670" style="s2">where they hid it</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.130" end="01:07:39.270" style="s2">for the past three years</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.289" end="01:07:40.670" style="s2">I&#39;ve had people investigating</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.130" end="01:07:44.109" style="s2">now I finally have a lead now I finally have a</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.730" end="01:07:48.550" style="s2">that&#39;s great</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.970" end="01:07:50.069" style="s2">at the shareholder meeting</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.090" end="01:07:51.310" style="s2">I&#39;ll prove my identity</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.010" end="01:07:54.710" style="s2">this way the shares will be all mine</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.130" end="01:07:57.029" style="s2">I&#39;ve had enough of these nerve-racking days</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.850" end="01:08:00.390" style="s2">don&#39;t worry I&#39;ll go make the arrangements now</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.529" end="01:08:04.189" style="s2">this time nothing can go wrong</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.749" end="01:08:08.170" style="s2">quick put me down</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.649" end="01:08:09.989" style="s2">no</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.789" end="01:08:12.949" style="s2">I want everyone to know how much I care about you</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.649" end="01:08:23.730" style="s2">are you hungry thirsty</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.749" end="01:08:24.590" style="s2">I&#39;m fine</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.010" end="01:08:26.069" style="s2">I&#39;ll just get some sleep</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.090" end="01:08:27.230" style="s2">you can go to work now</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.130" end="01:08:29.909" style="s2">OK</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.210" end="01:08:37.069" style="s2">auntie you&#39;re originally from Craft Hollow aren&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.210" end="01:08:40.430" style="s2">this man has he gotten addicted to acting or something</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.449" end="01:08:44.390" style="s2">got to check the status of the Shawn Group</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.050" end="01:08:54.550" style="s2">still no DNA and Elaine Creed doesn&#39;t have my shares</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.329" end="01:08:57.390" style="s2">good thing Mom&#39;s team is still holding it together</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.090" end="01:08:59.069" style="s2">this means I still have time</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.569" end="01:09:02.230" style="s2">but just to be safe</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.449" end="01:09:03.909" style="s2">I need to make some preparations</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.689" end="01:09:11.029" style="s2">Mr Prescott you asked me to monitor the movements</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.050" end="01:09:12.350" style="s2">of Gordon Crane and his daughter</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.529" end="01:09:13.749" style="s2">I just received some news</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.090" end="01:09:15.630" style="s2">they are going to attend the song group&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.649" end="01:09:16.989" style="s2">shareholder meeting in three days</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.210" end="01:09:19.749" style="s2">I recall that in the three years</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.770" end="01:09:20.710" style="s2">they&#39;ve been in this city</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.930" end="01:09:22.590" style="s2">they&#39;ve rarely gone back to Southport</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.609" end="01:09:23.909" style="s2">let alone to the song group</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.010" end="01:09:26.069" style="s2">what are they up to</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.930" end="01:09:28.130" style="s2">we haven&#39;t found out yet</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.170" end="01:09:30.949" style="s2">go and prepare</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.329" end="01:09:32.789" style="s2">I&#39;ll go myself in a few days</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.449" end="01:09:34.510" style="s2">yes Mr Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.730" end="01:09:40.749" style="s2">Mr Prescott about this information we&#39;ve found</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.970" end="01:09:42.270" style="s2">should we tell Nora as well</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.289" end="01:09:45.909" style="s2">no she has amnesia</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.090" end="01:09:48.109" style="s2">the shock might be too much for her right now</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.569" end="01:09:51.550" style="s2">tell her after I get song group back</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.850" end="01:09:54.710" style="s2">you&#39;re right sir</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.909" end="01:10:00.470" style="s2">I had the kitchen make this special restorative soup for you</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.489" end="01:10:01.189" style="s2">have a taste</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.210" end="01:10:02.069" style="s2">see what you think</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.249" end="01:10:10.590" style="s2">it&#39;s delicious. that&#39;s good</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.130" end="01:10:11.909" style="s2">you&#39;re too thin</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.010" end="01:10:13.029" style="s2">you need to eat more</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.609" end="01:10:14.630" style="s2">let me get you some food</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.130" end="01:10:15.510" style="s2">Elliot</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.529" end="01:10:16.550" style="s2">just eat your own food</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.369" end="01:10:18.310" style="s2">mom for me</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.329" end="01:10:19.749" style="s2">seeing Serena eat well makes me</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.770" end="01:10:20.909" style="s2">happier than eating myself</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.770" end="01:10:24.590" style="s2">Serena, what else do you want at 2 p.m.? What else do at 2 p.m.? What else do</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.609" end="01:10:25.310" style="s2">i&#39;ll get it for you</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.329" end="01:10:28.069" style="s2">uh, that&#39;s enough</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.369" end="01:10:30.189" style="s2">this man&#39;s acting is a bit over the top</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.649" end="01:10:32.109" style="s2">Mom, please move out soon</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.130" end="01:10:33.350" style="s2">so i can have a chance to get</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.369" end="01:10:34.590" style="s2">closer to that picture too</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.170" end="01:10:36.909" style="s2">that brat, mom</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.010" end="01:10:37.949" style="s2">just think of it as for your</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.970" end="01:10:38.869" style="s2">son&#39;s lifelong happiness</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.329" end="01:10:41.189" style="s2">you brat, are you ever going to stop</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.289" end="01:10:46.710" style="s2">you&#39;re so attentive to her</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.730" end="01:10:49.029" style="s2">but i don&#39;t see her showing any concern for you</p>
<p begin="01:10:49.489" end="01:10:50.869" style="s2">this whole deeply in love</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.890" end="01:10:52.909" style="s2">routine is just an act for me, isn&#39;t it</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.489" end="01:10:54.670" style="s2">she&#39;s just distracted</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.130" end="01:10:55.949" style="s2">it&#39;s her injury</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.130" end="01:11:00.430" style="s2">she always feeds me, right</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.449" end="01:11:03.590" style="s2">uh, right</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.890" end="01:11:12.749" style="s2">good heavens, she gave you liver</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.050" end="01:11:14.630" style="s2">Elliot, don&#39;t you hate liver</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.130" end="01:11:17.989" style="s2">oh, was it</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.010" end="01:11:19.189" style="s2">I-I-I didn&#39;t notice</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.090" end="01:11:21.230" style="s2">i like liver now</p>
<p begin="01:11:22.329" end="01:11:24.230" style="s2">see, she knows i love liver</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.409" end="01:11:25.949" style="s2">that&#39;s why you saved it for me, right Nora</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.189" end="01:11:27.710" style="s2">uh</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.829" end="01:11:30.109" style="s2">my goodness, this boy</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.449" end="01:11:31.989" style="s2">how can he be so shameless</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.930" end="01:11:34.710" style="s2">you two take your time, i&#39;m full</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.810" end="01:11:41.869" style="s2">i&#39;m sorry i didn&#39;t mean to do that</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.069" end="01:11:42.590" style="s2">it&#39;s OK</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.090" end="01:11:43.949" style="s2">as long as it&#39;s from you</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.970" end="01:11:44.949" style="s2">i&#39;d even eat poison</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.749" end="01:11:48.409" style="s2">why is my heart beating so fast</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.050" end="01:11:50.829" style="s2">calm down, he&#39;s just acting</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.529" end="01:11:54.069" style="s2">besides, you&#39;re bent on revenge</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.210" end="01:11:56.189" style="s2">you have no right to fall in love right now</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.289" end="01:11:59.069" style="s2">what&#39;s wrong</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.010" end="01:12:00.789" style="s2">ah, it&#39;s nothing</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.810" end="01:12:03.270" style="s2">I, I haven&#39;t been back to see my</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.289" end="01:12:04.630" style="s2">parents since my dad&#39;s surgery</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.329" end="01:12:06.590" style="s2">I was hoping to go back and stay</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.609" end="01:12:07.670" style="s2">with them for a couple of days.</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.689" end="01:12:09.590" style="s2">Would that be OK? Of course.</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.130" end="01:12:10.869" style="s2">That&#39;s a shame.</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.890" end="01:12:12.510" style="s2">I have a business trip for the next couple days.</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.569" end="01:12:13.510" style="s2">Otherwise, I&#39;d go with you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.609" end="01:12:14.270" style="s2">Oh, you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.289" end="01:12:15.550" style="s2">That&#39;s really not necessary.</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.210" end="01:12:18.310" style="s2">I&#39;m full. I should be heading out.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.930" end="01:12:26.189" style="s2">At picture 3 is watching.</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.369" end="01:12:31.149" style="s2">So.</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.449" end="01:12:35.149" style="s2">Come back soon,</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.170" end="01:12:36.109" style="s2">or I&#39;ll miss you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.170" end="01:12:38.189" style="s2">Will you miss me?</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.730" end="01:12:41.510" style="s2">I will.</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.850" end="01:12:46.789" style="s2">He&#39;s like a new man since he fell for her.</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.090" end="01:12:48.189" style="s2">I love to see it.</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.810" end="01:12:51.230" style="s2">Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.249" end="01:12:53.029" style="s2">and Miss Chen are at Advance Group, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.170" end="01:12:54.010" style="s2">Should we go now?</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.449" end="01:12:55.829" style="s2">I don&#39;t care what they&#39;re planning</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.170" end="01:12:57.069" style="s2">with me there,</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.249" end="01:12:58.510" style="s2">they won&#39;t dare pull anything.</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.170" end="01:12:59.949" style="s2">Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.449" end="01:13:11.189" style="s2">Is that Nora?</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.770" end="01:13:22.829" style="s2">Three years. I&#39;m finally back.</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.949" end="01:13:28.810" style="s2">Hello, Mr. Bell. Hello, Miss</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.470" end="01:13:31.170" style="s2">Gordon. Crane has brought the imposter.</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.630" end="01:13:34.050" style="s2">They&#39;re planning to publicly verify the genetic marker.</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.270" end="01:13:35.489" style="s2">It seems they came prepared.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.390" end="01:13:38.249" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. They won&#39;t succeed.</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.670" end="01:13:43.289" style="s2">Is that Nora?</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.569" end="01:13:43.970" style="s2">Hmm.</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.510" end="01:13:46.970" style="s2">I&#39;m curious, Mr. Bell.</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.270" end="01:13:48.850" style="s2">Why did you believe me instantly?</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.510" end="01:13:51.609" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you afraid I might be the real imposter?</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.550" end="01:13:57.689" style="s2">Miss, your mother personally trained me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.789" end="01:13:59.090" style="s2">I watched you grow up.</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.390" end="01:14:00.689" style="s2">The moment I heard your voice,</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.789" end="01:14:02.569" style="s2">I knew that you&#39;re the real one.</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.989" end="01:14:03.930" style="s2">So it&#39;s really her.</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.029" end="01:14:05.249" style="s2">But why did she lie to me?</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.270" end="01:14:05.789" style="s2">Mrs. Press has already recovered her memory.</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.510" end="01:14:10.569" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid so.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.390" end="01:14:14.090" style="s2">Actually, I suspected that imposter a long time ago.</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.350" end="01:14:16.489" style="s2">Mister Bell, you don&#39;t need to blame yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.948" end="01:14:18.970" style="s2">I&#39;m arriving now.</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.989" end="01:14:20.170" style="s2">I&#39;m going to need your help.</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.430" end="01:14:21.210" style="s2">Of course.</p>
<p begin="01:14:21.390" end="01:14:22.489" style="s2">You can count on me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.909" end="01:14:26.730" style="s2">Mister Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.749" end="01:14:27.970" style="s2">Are we still going up?</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.550" end="01:14:30.529" style="s2">No. Since she remembers,</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.590" end="01:14:31.730" style="s2">Let her have her revenge.</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.310" end="01:14:33.609" style="s2">We&#39;ll step in if she needs us.</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.350" end="01:14:42.130" style="s2">Mr. Vance</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.789" end="01:14:45.010" style="s2">You stated that the young miss is here today to</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.029" end="01:14:47.770" style="s2">publicly verify her genetic information and claim her</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.789" end="01:14:49.930" style="s2">shares, but it&#39;s been three years.</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.270" end="01:14:51.850" style="s2">Why has she only appeared now?</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.829" end="01:14:54.529" style="s2">Only now? Yes, young miss.</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.550" end="01:14:56.170" style="s2">We&#39;ve been waiting for you for 3 years.</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.909" end="01:15:00.529" style="s2">Everyone, please be patient.</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.189" end="01:15:02.730" style="s2">As the future head of the Vance Group,</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.749" end="01:15:05.369" style="s2">Elaine can&#39;t be expected to be completely clueless,</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.390" end="01:15:05.909" style="s2">can she?</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.310" end="01:15:07.369" style="s2">The past three years,</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.550" end="01:15:09.369" style="s2">she&#39;s been abroad preparing.</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.149" end="01:15:12.609" style="s2">Hmm, and now...</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.489" end="01:15:21.850" style="s2">That&#39;s right, and I assure you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.989" end="01:15:24.489" style="s2">I will lead the Vance Group to new heights.</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.829" end="01:15:30.930" style="s2">Very well, Miss Crane.</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.630" end="01:15:34.210" style="s2">Please, you will see three test strips.</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.630" end="01:15:36.449" style="s2">Place a drop of your blood on one of them.</p>
<p begin="01:15:36.829" end="01:15:38.449" style="s2">Once a positive match is verified,</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.470" end="01:15:40.210" style="s2">the safe will unlock automatically.</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.350" end="01:15:42.970" style="s2">If there are three failed attempts,</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.270" end="01:15:44.730" style="s2">the safe will self-destruct.</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.430" end="01:15:47.649" style="s2">I know. Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.670" end="01:15:49.890" style="s2">The safe will open right away. Hmm.</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.607" end="01:16:02.828" style="s2">The verification failed.</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.168" end="01:16:03.988" style="s2">How could it fail?</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.048" end="01:16:05.027" style="s2">You&#39;re an imposter.</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.368" end="01:16:08.107" style="s2">Say it. Who the hell are you?</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.448" end="01:16:09.347" style="s2">This is impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.727" end="01:16:11.668" style="s2">This is obviously Sophie Vance&#39;s blood.</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.527" end="01:16:13.427" style="s2">Is this thing broken?</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.607" end="01:16:17.788" style="s2">Hmm, Chairman Vance commissioned this safe.</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.807" end="01:16:19.067" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t make mistakes.</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.727" end="01:16:23.868" style="s2">No wonder. I knew something was off about you.</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.128" end="01:16:25.008" style="s2">So it&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.027" end="01:16:26.147" style="s2">You&#39;re an imposter.</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.687" end="01:16:30.067" style="s2">Tell me, where have you hidden the real Iris Bell?</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.727" end="01:16:35.307" style="s2">That&#39;s ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.328" end="01:16:37.267" style="s2">Oh, I see.</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.527" end="01:16:38.788" style="s2">You must have tampered with the safe.</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.807" end="01:16:39.628" style="s2">That&#39;s why Sophie&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.647" end="01:16:40.708" style="s2">identity verification failed.</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.887" end="01:16:42.588" style="s2">You snake, you&#39;re just terrified she&#39;ll come</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.607" end="01:16:43.788" style="s2">back and take your power away.</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.807" end="01:16:45.227" style="s2">You? That&#39;s slander.</p>
<p begin="01:16:49.887" end="01:16:50.467" style="s2">Gordon Crane.</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.488" end="01:16:52.027" style="s2">You&#39;re quite good at turning the tables.</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.647" end="01:16:53.788" style="s2">Mr. Bell has always been</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.807" end="01:16:54.868" style="s2">loyal to me and my mother.</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.288" end="01:16:56.628" style="s2">You&#39;re the ungrateful traitor.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.647" end="01:16:59.588" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.147" end="01:17:02.088" style="s2">And you think you have a right to speak here?</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.548" end="01:17:05.448" style="s2">Security, get her out of here!</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.828" end="01:17:07.488" style="s2">I should be the one asking you that.</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.948" end="01:17:09.248" style="s2">This is the Vance Group.</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.508" end="01:17:10.647" style="s2">So why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.147" end="01:17:12.088" style="s2">Elaine Crane.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.227" end="01:17:15.208" style="s2">Elaine Crane and Sebastian, who are they?</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.227" end="01:17:16.527" style="s2">They have the same last name.</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.548" end="01:17:22.288" style="s2">Oh, I get it. She&#39;s his illegitimate daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.748" end="01:17:25.048" style="s2">You&#39;ve spent three years as a fake heiress.</p>
<p begin="01:17:25.668" end="01:17:26.647" style="s2">That&#39;s nonsense.</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.347" end="01:17:28.448" style="s2">I only have one daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.548" end="01:17:29.408" style="s2">Nora Sinclair.</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.788" end="01:17:30.767" style="s2">Come on, I&#39;m her father.</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.868" end="01:17:32.567" style="s2">You think I wouldn&#39;t recognize my own daughter?</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.427" end="01:17:35.448" style="s2">That&#39;s right. I&#39;m the real Norris Sinclair.</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.908" end="01:17:36.767" style="s2">You&#39;re not Ava.</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.267" end="01:17:38.448" style="s2">You&#39;re not Norris Sinclair.</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.708" end="01:17:39.807" style="s2">That&#39;s why you haven&#39;t verified</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.828" end="01:17:41.128" style="s2">your identity in three years</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.467" end="01:17:42.488" style="s2">until you thought you&#39;d gotten your</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.508" end="01:17:44.008" style="s2">hands on my umbilical cord blood.</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.107" end="01:17:45.767" style="s2">Too bad for you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.788" end="01:17:46.887" style="s2">I was one step ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.147" end="01:17:49.448" style="s2">I had it swapped, you everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.147" end="01:17:52.807" style="s2">I am the real Nora Sinclair.</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.948" end="01:17:54.927" style="s2">Three years ago,</p>
<p begin="01:17:56.908" end="01:17:58.847" style="s2">my father tried to burn me alive and</p>
<p begin="01:17:58.868" end="01:18:00.607" style="s2">had Elaine Crane take my place.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.708" end="01:18:03.527" style="s2">Luckily, I survived.</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.668" end="01:18:07.168" style="s2">Miss Nora, you&#39;re finally back.</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.347" end="01:18:08.607" style="s2">I&#39;ve met Nora Sinclair.</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.748" end="01:18:09.927" style="s2">You look nothing like her.</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.868" end="01:18:12.927" style="s2">That fire three years ago disfigured me.</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.067" end="01:18:14.168" style="s2">I had to have surgery.</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.187" end="01:18:15.828" style="s2">So I look different.</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.748" end="01:18:20.408" style="s2">That fire gave me amnesia.</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.748" end="01:18:22.488" style="s2">I&#39;ve only just recovered my memories.</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.187" end="01:18:25.887" style="s2">Otherwise, I would have stopped them long ago.</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.548" end="01:18:29.368" style="s2">But that&#39;s all it is: your story.</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.027" end="01:18:31.488" style="s2">And we&#39;re supposed to just believe</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.508" end="01:18:33.448" style="s2">you&#39;re the real Nora Sinclair?</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.067" end="01:18:35.008" style="s2">That&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.187" end="01:18:38.368" style="s2">Yeah, this whole thing is just too ridiculous</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.748" end="01:18:42.448" style="s2">Simple. The safe&#39;s right here</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.187" end="01:18:46.408" style="s2">Whoever opens this is the real Eris</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.788" end="01:18:47.887" style="s2">DNA doesn&#39;t lie</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.807" end="01:18:50.628" style="s2">That&#39;s right</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.227" end="01:18:53.368" style="s2">I&#39;m here today to open the safe and take</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.387" end="01:18:55.008" style="s2">back the shares that belong to me</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.748" end="01:18:57.128" style="s2">Stop</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.307" end="01:18:58.088" style="s2">What are you doing</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.027" end="01:19:01.927" style="s2">That machine only has two attempts left</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.107" end="01:19:03.048" style="s2">If you&#39;re an imposter</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.067" end="01:19:04.647" style="s2">you&#39;re gonna waste one of those attempts</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.788" end="01:19:06.288" style="s2">A complete waste of an attempt</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.387" end="01:19:07.887" style="s2">And you, the board of directors</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.908" end="01:19:09.368" style="s2">are you just gonna let some outsider</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.387" end="01:19:10.687" style="s2">come in here and stir up trouble</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.668" end="01:19:12.927" style="s2">We still have two attempts</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.227" end="01:19:14.288" style="s2">so we use one</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.467" end="01:19:16.527" style="s2">And besides, who&#39;s to say it&#39;ll be a waste</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.027" end="01:19:17.967" style="s2">What do you all say</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.868" end="01:19:24.647" style="s2">Stop</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.849" end="01:19:32.028" style="s2">If I can&#39;t have it, no one can</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.488" end="01:19:36.549" style="s2">Mom, you designed this safe just for me</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.969" end="01:19:38.628" style="s2">and I couldn&#39;t even protect it</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.089" end="01:19:41.269" style="s2">You destroyed the safe</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.568" end="01:19:43.149" style="s2">You&#39;re the real impostors</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.128" end="01:19:45.309" style="s2">What are we gonna do now</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.248" end="01:19:48.068" style="s2">Worst case, we stick to the plan</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.248" end="01:19:50.668" style="s2">A third party supervisor handles the shares</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.167" end="01:19:53.068" style="s2">Either way, business goes on</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.128" end="01:19:58.189" style="s2">We don&#39;t have a leader</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.649" end="01:20:00.068" style="s2">How can Vans Group grow</p>
<p begin="01:20:00.248" end="01:20:01.368" style="s2">How can we compete</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.708" end="01:20:02.028" style="s2">Huh</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.948" end="01:20:12.049" style="s2">Ha ha, this is simple. Nora Sinclair is right here</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.408" end="01:20:13.908" style="s2">Just acknowledge her identity</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.929" end="01:20:15.828" style="s2">and all of these problems will just disappear</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.568" end="01:20:18.948" style="s2">Besides, isn&#39;t a father&#39;s word more</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.969" end="01:20:20.509" style="s2">reliable than this piece of junk</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.809" end="01:20:25.389" style="s2">Exactly, this thing couldn&#39;t even verify my blood</p>
<p begin="01:20:26.009" end="01:20:27.269" style="s2">That just proves it&#39;s broken</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.649" end="01:20:29.349" style="s2">So what if I smash it right now</p>
<p begin="01:20:31.089" end="01:20:32.189" style="s2">How dare you</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.009" end="01:20:35.589" style="s2">You thought I couldn&#39;t get my shares</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.168" end="01:20:39.748" style="s2">My mother saw right through you</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.288" end="01:20:41.628" style="s2">She left me a fail-safe and</p>
<p begin="01:20:41.649" end="01:20:42.948" style="s2">she warned me about you</p>
<p begin="01:20:43.649" end="01:20:45.309" style="s2">But even then, I underestimated</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.328" end="01:20:46.668" style="s2">just how vicious you are</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.809" end="01:21:01.429" style="s2">Everyone, this gives me fifty percent</p>
<p begin="01:21:01.448" end="01:21:02.788" style="s2">of the Song Group shares</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.288" end="01:21:04.068" style="s2">effective immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.729" end="01:21:06.748" style="s2">I am the new head of the Song Group.</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.689" end="01:21:10.068" style="s2">I, Charles Bell, stand with you, Nora.</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.089" end="01:21:11.149" style="s2">And what about all of you?</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.929" end="01:21:15.549" style="s2">Nora, can it really be you?</p>
<p begin="01:21:15.729" end="01:21:17.589" style="s2">My daughter, Nora.</p>
<p begin="01:21:18.208" end="01:21:20.828" style="s2">Well, the secret&#39;s out now, everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:21:21.969" end="01:21:22.948" style="s2">Three years ago,</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.689" end="01:21:26.868" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t let Nora be with some scumbag,</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.889" end="01:21:27.668" style="s2">so she just</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.448" end="01:21:30.549" style="s2">abandoned everything and ran off with him.</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.009" end="01:21:33.549" style="s2">Oh, Nora.</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.568" end="01:21:34.549" style="s2">How could you do this?</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.649" end="01:21:35.469" style="s2">Do you think you&#39;re even</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.488" end="01:21:37.109" style="s2">worthy of your late mother, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.448" end="01:21:38.868" style="s2">Is this how you honor all the</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.889" end="01:21:40.469" style="s2">years she poured into raising you?</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.009" end="01:21:42.908" style="s2">How can you say that and not feel any guilt?</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.448" end="01:21:45.389" style="s2">You just disappeared.</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.408" end="01:21:46.429" style="s2">I had no choice but to let</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.448" end="01:21:47.969" style="s2">your sister take your place. Did I? What?</p>
<p begin="01:21:49.128" end="01:21:50.309" style="s2">If I hadn&#39;t done that,</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.328" end="01:21:52.349" style="s2">the Song Group stock would have crippled.</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.368" end="01:21:55.708" style="s2">Yes, I was pretending.</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.448" end="01:21:57.948" style="s2">I had to clean up her mess.</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.868" end="01:22:04.368" style="s2">Stop lying, Gordon Crane.</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.408" end="01:22:06.028" style="s2">You&#39;re the one who tried to burn her alive.</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.208" end="01:22:09.028" style="s2">Enough. Believe what you want,</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.849" end="01:22:11.389" style="s2">but I must remind everyone that</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.408" end="01:22:13.309" style="s2">Nora is far too impulsive</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.689" end="01:22:15.269" style="s2">for the sake of the company&#39;s future.</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.408" end="01:22:17.469" style="s2">She is clearly not the best candidate.</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.849" end="01:22:19.269" style="s2">Please think this through.</p>
<p begin="01:22:20.448" end="01:22:21.269" style="s2">This is getting messy.</p>
<p begin="01:22:22.009" end="01:22:22.948" style="s2">What&#39;s the play here?</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.649" end="01:22:25.589" style="s2">Gordon Crane, after all this,</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.609" end="01:22:26.828" style="s2">you&#39;re still not giving up?</p>
<p begin="01:22:28.248" end="01:22:30.509" style="s2">Nora, I know you hate me,</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.089" end="01:22:32.589" style="s2">but I&#39;m doing this to protect</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.649" end="01:22:33.828" style="s2">everything your mother built.</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.448" end="01:22:35.908" style="s2">You understand that, don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:22:36.049" end="01:22:39.109" style="s2">You&#39;re not actually buying his lies, are you?</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.609" end="01:22:42.269" style="s2">Nora would never just run off with some guy.</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.929" end="01:22:45.269" style="s2">Mister Bell, it&#39;s not that we don&#39;t believe Nora,</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.328" end="01:22:47.189" style="s2">but with the company&#39;s future on the line,</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.609" end="01:22:49.149" style="s2">we have to be absolutely sure.</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.528" end="01:22:51.589" style="s2">Exactly. She was impersonated for three years.</p>
<p begin="01:22:51.929" end="01:22:53.109" style="s2">Something that absurd happens?</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.128" end="01:22:54.589" style="s2">We have every right to be cautious.</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.809" end="01:22:55.589" style="s2">consider it carefully</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.049" end="01:22:56.769" style="s2">I don&#39;t think that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:22:57.128" end="01:22:57.908" style="s2">necessary</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.769" end="01:23:08.089" style="s2">I am Elliot Prescott CEO of the Prescott Group</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.408" end="01:23:11.828" style="s2">I am here to support Nora</p>
<p begin="01:23:12.408" end="01:23:14.549" style="s2">and should she be named heir to the Vance Group</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.969" end="01:23:16.748" style="s2">my company will enter into a full</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.769" end="01:23:18.189" style="s2">strategic partnership with them</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.469" end="01:23:23.549" style="s2">Mister Prescott is that true is it true</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.609" end="01:23:25.589" style="s2">of course I believe everyone here trust me</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.408" end="01:23:28.269" style="s2">Elliot Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.049" end="01:23:29.769" style="s2">trust him of course</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.788" end="01:23:33.229" style="s2">he&#39;s our young lady&#39;s fiance</p>
<p begin="01:23:33.809" end="01:23:34.788" style="s2">fiance oh</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.809" end="01:23:35.568" style="s2">this is great</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.589" end="01:23:36.229" style="s2">really great</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.408" end="01:23:36.988" style="s2">fiance</p>
<p begin="01:23:37.448" end="01:23:38.549" style="s2">Mister Bell that&#39;s out of date</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.089" end="01:23:39.948" style="s2">since 9 this morning</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.969" end="01:23:40.748" style="s2">I&#39;m her husband</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.408" end="01:23:43.149" style="s2">ha ha ha this is great</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.089" end="01:23:45.469" style="s2">we support the young lady</p>
<p begin="01:23:45.729" end="01:23:46.509" style="s2">young lady</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.408" end="01:23:48.349" style="s2">thank you everyone</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.769" end="01:23:52.328" style="s2">don&#39;t worry I won&#39;t let you down as for you</p>
<p begin="01:23:53.127" end="01:23:53.908" style="s2">hehehehe</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.528" end="01:23:56.667" style="s2">Nora since everyone&#39;s backing you</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.729" end="01:23:58.309" style="s2">just do a great job heh</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.649" end="01:24:00.868" style="s2">for years your sister and I ran this for you</p>
<p begin="01:24:00.889" end="01:24:01.828" style="s2">we worked hard</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.208" end="01:24:03.667" style="s2">let&#39;s just drop this OK</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.208" end="01:24:04.988" style="s2">OK we&#39;ll just</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.009" end="01:24:06.509" style="s2">we&#39;ll be leaving now leaving</p>
<p begin="01:24:07.649" end="01:24:08.549" style="s2">Gordon Crane</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.889" end="01:24:11.109" style="s2">you and your sister set a fire to murder me</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.368" end="01:24:12.667" style="s2">you&#39;re not getting away with it</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.248" end="01:24:14.389" style="s2">oh Nora</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.609" end="01:24:16.109" style="s2">this is all just a misunderstanding</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.528" end="01:24:17.269" style="s2">I&#39;m your father</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.288" end="01:24:18.309" style="s2">for crying out loud</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.609" end="01:24:20.028" style="s2">how could I ever hurt you</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.208" end="01:24:23.908" style="s2">don&#39;t you have any shame saying that</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.328" end="01:24:27.229" style="s2">take them to the station</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.127" end="01:24:28.908" style="s2">what do you think you&#39;re doing</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.929" end="01:24:29.627" style="s2">you have no right</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.649" end="01:24:30.868" style="s2">why are you saying we did this</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.969" end="01:24:31.908" style="s2">let go of me</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.127" end="01:24:33.309" style="s2">and who said there&#39;s no evidence</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.649" end="01:24:35.269" style="s2">at Grandpa Prescott&#39;s birthday party</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.328" end="01:24:36.828" style="s2">Nora was attacked in the restroom</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.929" end="01:24:38.729" style="s2">I have a recording of their full confession</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.049" end="01:24:39.828" style="s2">they&#39;ve confessed</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.127" end="01:24:41.189" style="s2">they said it was you two</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.208" end="01:24:41.748" style="s2">father and daughter</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.769" end="01:24:42.788" style="s2">who were behind it all</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.929" end="01:24:45.229" style="s2">that&#39;s right and hiring a hitman</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.448" end="01:24:47.549" style="s2">that&#39;s enough to put you away for more than a decade</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.152" end="01:24:56.631" style="s2">congratulations, Miss Nora</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.791" end="01:24:58.612" style="s2">Mister Bell, I should be the one thanking you</p>
<p begin="01:24:58.992" end="01:24:59.971" style="s2">I didn&#39;t do anything</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.631" end="01:25:02.011" style="s2">the reason you could get the shares</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.032" end="01:25:03.572" style="s2">is all thanks to Mister Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.871" end="01:25:06.671" style="s2">Mister Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:25:06.912" end="01:25:08.211" style="s2">so you&#39;re married</p>
<p begin="01:25:08.831" end="01:25:09.612" style="s2">when&#39;s the wedding</p>
<p begin="01:25:13.791" end="01:25:15.772" style="s2">a wedding would be the perfect celebration</p>
<p begin="01:25:15.831" end="01:25:16.612" style="s2">right, everyone</p>
<p begin="01:25:16.992" end="01:25:18.492" style="s2">yes, yes, yes, yes</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.551" end="01:25:20.452" style="s2">that&#39;s a good idea</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.711" end="01:25:22.612" style="s2">that can wait</p>
<p begin="01:25:22.831" end="01:25:23.892" style="s2">let&#39;s talk in the office</p>
<p begin="01:25:26.711" end="01:25:28.772" style="s2">wonderful, yes, of course</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.352" end="01:25:34.211" style="s2">Mister Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:25:34.711" end="01:25:36.772" style="s2">when did you guess that I was Nora Sinclair</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.711" end="01:25:38.931" style="s2">at Grandpa&#39;s birthday party</p>
<p begin="01:25:39.751" end="01:25:40.692" style="s2">he told me the current Lawrence</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.711" end="01:25:42.051" style="s2">Sinclair could be an imposter</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.192" end="01:25:45.371" style="s2">and that you were very likely Lawrence Sinclair</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.952" end="01:25:50.612" style="s2">I see. Grandpa and I were close</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.952" end="01:25:52.852" style="s2">he knew my pen name was Mrs. Sawyer</p>
<p begin="01:25:53.072" end="01:25:54.772" style="s2">the crash must have brought it all back</p>
<p begin="01:25:56.352" end="01:25:57.532" style="s2">Mr. Prescott, you...</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.032" end="01:25:58.791" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.192" end="01:26:02.612" style="s2">I&#39;ve blamed myself every day since I found out</p>
<p begin="01:26:05.711" end="01:26:07.171" style="s2">if only I&#39;d kept in touch</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.352" end="01:26:11.331" style="s2">then maybe your father wouldn&#39;t have hurt you</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.192" end="01:26:15.732" style="s2">this has nothing to do with you</p>
<p begin="01:26:17.331" end="01:26:18.232" style="s2">how could it not</p>
<p begin="01:26:18.331" end="01:26:19.152" style="s2">you&#39;re my fiancé</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.131" end="01:26:22.631" style="s2">but what a coincidence</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.971" end="01:26:23.711" style="s2">after all this</p>
<p begin="01:26:23.732" end="01:26:24.992" style="s2">you still have to marry me</p>
<p begin="01:26:26.892" end="01:26:29.192" style="s2">I was just about to talk to you about this, Mr. Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.852" end="01:26:30.631" style="s2">given my situation</p>
<p begin="01:26:30.732" end="01:26:31.831" style="s2">we can&#39;t keep pretending</p>
<p begin="01:26:35.812" end="01:26:37.392" style="s2">I think our arrangement should end here</p>
<p begin="01:26:37.892" end="01:26:39.232" style="s2">You? What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:26:39.331" end="01:26:41.072" style="s2">I want a divorce now</p>
<p begin="01:26:41.291" end="01:26:42.511" style="s2">If we get divorced now</p>
<p begin="01:26:42.532" end="01:26:43.471" style="s2">you won&#39;t have to worry about</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.492" end="01:26:44.912" style="s2">your aunt trying to set you up</p>
<p begin="01:26:45.011" end="01:26:46.072" style="s2">she&#39;s a reasonable person</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.331" end="01:26:47.431" style="s2">just be straight with her</p>
<p begin="01:26:47.492" end="01:26:49.511" style="s2">I&#39;m sure she&#39;ll understand and respect your wishes</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.852" end="01:26:51.431" style="s2">No, I don&#39;t agree</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.612" end="01:26:52.631" style="s2">we have a contract</p>
<p begin="01:26:52.971" end="01:26:53.751" style="s2">we&#39;re married</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.091" end="01:26:55.312" style="s2">why would we get a divorce</p>
<p begin="01:26:55.812" end="01:26:57.751" style="s2">the person who married you was Nora Sawyer</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.251" end="01:27:00.312" style="s2">besides, this marriage was never real to begin with</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.011" end="01:27:02.072" style="s2">even if we don&#39;t do it now</p>
<p begin="01:27:02.091" end="01:27:03.392" style="s2">we have to in a year anyway</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.532" end="01:27:04.352" style="s2">no matter what I say</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.371" end="01:27:05.631" style="s2">all she wants is a divorce</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.812" end="01:27:07.352" style="s2">does she feel nothing for me at all</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.452" end="01:27:08.992" style="s2">not even the slightest hesitation</p>
<p begin="01:27:09.612" end="01:27:10.952" style="s2">but the group board has already</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.971" end="01:27:12.192" style="s2">acknowledged our relationship</p>
<p begin="01:27:13.011" end="01:27:14.152" style="s2">if we get a divorce</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.171" end="01:27:15.711" style="s2">how are you going to explain that to them</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.331" end="01:27:18.232" style="s2">I will earn their approval with my abilities</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.211" end="01:27:21.671" style="s2">but that&#39;s going to take time</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.011" end="01:27:24.871" style="s2">until you have complete control of the group</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.171" end="01:27:26.511" style="s2">let&#39;s keep things as they are</p>
<p begin="01:27:26.931" end="01:27:28.831" style="s2">but what&#39;s in it for you</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.852" end="01:27:31.312" style="s2">you&#39;re Norah Sinclair now</p>
<p begin="01:27:32.291" end="01:27:33.631" style="s2">my mom would be overjoyed to have</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.652" end="01:27:34.871" style="s2">a daughter-in-law like you</p>
<p begin="01:27:35.131" end="01:27:36.211" style="s2">isn&#39;t that reason enough</p>
<p begin="01:27:38.371" end="01:27:40.751" style="s2">so he&#39;s only doing this for Mrs. Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.732" end="01:27:47.791" style="s2">fine, we both get what we need</p>
<p begin="01:27:47.931" end="01:27:49.392" style="s2">let&#39;s just keep things as they are</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.812" end="01:27:52.272" style="s2">I can&#39;t go back home for now</p>
<p begin="01:27:53.211" end="01:27:54.232" style="s2">I&#39;ll play my part</p>
<p begin="01:27:54.532" end="01:27:55.352" style="s2">just call me</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.051" end="01:27:58.312" style="s2">so it&#39;s a deal</p>
<p begin="01:27:58.471" end="01:28:01.011" style="s2">but could you stop calling me Mr. Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:28:01.431" end="01:28:02.452" style="s2">just call me by my name</p>
<p begin="01:28:02.471" end="01:28:03.532" style="s2">hmm</p>
<p begin="01:28:04.751" end="01:28:06.452" style="s2">go on, say it</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.912" end="01:28:08.692" style="s2">Elliot</p>
<p begin="01:28:09.751" end="01:28:12.091" style="s2">Miss Nora, I have the files you asked for</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.791" end="01:28:16.692" style="s2">I&#39;ve got to head back for a</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.711" end="01:28:17.652" style="s2">couple of days for work</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.671" end="01:28:18.971" style="s2">I&#39;ll come see you when I get back</p>
<p begin="01:28:19.952" end="01:28:21.131" style="s2">You&#39;re leaving.</p>
<p begin="01:28:21.871" end="01:28:22.612" style="s2">Hmm.</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.631" end="01:28:23.492" style="s2">If you need anything,</p>
<p begin="01:28:23.831" end="01:28:24.692" style="s2">remember to call me.</p>
<p begin="01:28:26.032" end="01:28:27.492" style="s2">Mister Prescott, take care.</p>
<p begin="01:28:27.591" end="01:28:28.371" style="s2">Hmm.</p>
<p begin="01:28:31.272" end="01:28:34.331" style="s2">Miss Nora, you and Mr. Prescott are great together.</p>
<p begin="01:28:35.112" end="01:28:37.532" style="s2">I guess he only kissed me for Mr. Bell to see.</p>
<p begin="01:28:40.511" end="01:28:41.492" style="s2">Thank you, Mr. Bell.</p>
<p begin="01:28:41.751" end="01:28:43.131" style="s2">Of course, anytime.</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.912" end="01:28:45.291" style="s2">I&#39;ll be sure to go over these carefully.</p>
<p begin="01:28:53.112" end="01:28:54.452" style="s2">Why hasn&#39;t he been back yet?</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.032" end="01:28:55.892" style="s2">Dad, don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.912" end="01:28:56.772" style="s2">He&#39;ll be back soon.</p>
<p begin="01:28:59.871" end="01:29:00.772" style="s2">Oh, Elliot.</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.791" end="01:29:01.930" style="s2">You&#39;re finally back.</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.192" end="01:29:04.131" style="s2">I saw on the news.</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.392" end="01:29:05.732" style="s2">Nora has taken back fifty percent</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.751" end="01:29:07.131" style="s2">of the shares in the Song Group.</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.232" end="01:29:08.051" style="s2">And now she&#39;s going to be</p>
<p begin="01:29:08.072" end="01:29:09.452" style="s2">the chairwoman and CEO.</p>
<p begin="01:29:10.312" end="01:29:12.572" style="s2">So this Nora is...</p>
<p begin="01:29:13.152" end="01:29:14.492" style="s2">It&#39;s, it&#39;s Nora, right?</p>
<p begin="01:29:17.032" end="01:29:19.011" style="s2">Since you went down to South Ridge yourself,</p>
<p begin="01:29:19.471" end="01:29:20.692" style="s2">I knew you wouldn&#39;t let that</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.711" end="01:29:22.171" style="s2">imposter get away with it.</p>
<p begin="01:29:22.551" end="01:29:24.612" style="s2">Of course, it&#39;s Nora.</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.152" end="01:29:27.171" style="s2">Gordon Crane and his daughter</p>
<p begin="01:29:27.192" end="01:29:28.312" style="s2">have been sent to jail.</p>
<p begin="01:29:28.952" end="01:29:29.612" style="s2">Great.</p>
<p begin="01:29:29.871" end="01:29:30.812" style="s2">Hahaha!</p>
<p begin="01:29:31.912" end="01:29:34.812" style="s2">Nora, her suffering has finally come to an end.</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.032" end="01:29:35.772" style="s2">She&#39;s gotten back</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.791" end="01:29:37.171" style="s2">everything that belongs to her.</p>
<p begin="01:29:37.711" end="01:29:40.091" style="s2">So does that mean that after this whole ordeal,</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.152" end="01:29:41.492" style="s2">Nora is still my daughter-in-law?</p>
<p begin="01:29:41.511" end="01:29:43.011" style="s2">Oh, it&#39;s truly meant to be.</p>
<p begin="01:29:43.352" end="01:29:46.692" style="s2">Mom, don&#39;t celebrate just yet, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.392" end="01:29:51.131" style="s2">Since she became Nora Sinclair again,</p>
<p begin="01:29:51.152" end="01:29:52.171" style="s2">she wants a divorce.</p>
<p begin="01:29:52.631" end="01:29:53.371" style="s2">I&#39;ve delayed it,</p>
<p begin="01:29:53.392" end="01:29:54.931" style="s2">but only for now.</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.711" end="01:29:59.291" style="s2">Tell me, what else do you need me to help with?</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.352" end="01:30:05.131" style="s2">Mom, this time I need Grandpa&#39;s help. Need me? Hmm.</p>
<p begin="01:30:05.431" end="01:30:07.251" style="s2">Help you persuade Nora Sinclair?</p>
<p begin="01:30:07.551" end="01:30:08.812" style="s2">Don&#39;t even think about it.</p>
<p begin="01:30:09.312" end="01:30:10.652" style="s2">If Nora doesn&#39;t want you anymore</p>
<p begin="01:30:10.671" end="01:30:12.072" style="s2">and insists on divorcing you,</p>
<p begin="01:30:12.912" end="01:30:14.251" style="s2">I stand with Nora.</p>
<p begin="01:30:16.591" end="01:30:18.091" style="s2">Grandpa, I need you to come watch over the...</p>
<p begin="01:30:20.952" end="01:30:23.732" style="s2">As for me, I&#39;ll be based in Stirling.</p>
<p begin="01:30:25.572" end="01:30:28.852" style="s2">The biggest problem at Song Group is that we&#39;ve become too conservative.</p>
<p begin="01:30:29.112" end="01:30:30.492" style="s2">We&#39;re falling behind the market.</p>
<p begin="01:30:30.912" end="01:30:32.732" style="s2">That&#39;s why reform is essential.</p>
<p begin="01:30:34.671" end="01:30:35.692" style="s2">I support it.</p>
<p begin="01:30:38.430" end="01:30:39.852" style="s2">Bell, what are you blindly supporting?</p>
<p begin="01:30:40.192" end="01:30:41.970" style="s2">Are you suggesting we don&#39;t need to reform?</p>
<p begin="01:30:42.232" end="01:30:45.291" style="s2">It&#39;s just our technology is already so far behind.</p>
<p begin="01:30:45.470" end="01:30:46.930" style="s2">Even if we pour more money into it,</p>
<p begin="01:30:46.952" end="01:30:48.171" style="s2">we won&#39;t be able to catch up.</p>
<p begin="01:30:48.630" end="01:30:49.852" style="s2">Exactly, that&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:30:50.032" end="01:30:51.772" style="s2">A rash reform might cause us to lose</p>
<p begin="01:30:51.791" end="01:30:53.312" style="s2">the market share we already have.</p>
<p begin="01:30:53.430" end="01:30:54.612" style="s2">But if we don&#39;t reform,</p>
<p begin="01:30:55.072" end="01:30:56.291" style="s2">we&#39;re just waiting to die.</p>
<p begin="01:30:57.072" end="01:30:59.090" style="s2">Reform at least offers a sliver of hope.</p>
<p begin="01:30:59.510" end="01:31:01.090" style="s2">As for the technological hurdles,</p>
<p begin="01:31:01.112" end="01:31:02.050" style="s2">just give me some time.</p>
<p begin="01:31:02.072" end="01:31:03.452" style="s2">I know I can overcome them.</p>
<p begin="01:31:03.630" end="01:31:04.412" style="s2">That makes sense.</p>
<p begin="01:31:06.751" end="01:31:08.492" style="s2">The problem is we don&#39;t have time.</p>
<p begin="01:31:08.871" end="01:31:10.331" style="s2">What if Prescott Group shares its</p>
<p begin="01:31:10.352" end="01:31:12.532" style="s2">technology with Song Group? What? Wow.</p>
<p begin="01:31:14.751" end="01:31:15.812" style="s2">Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.831" end="01:31:19.251" style="s2">Because I missed you, of course, Mr. Prescott.</p>
<p begin="01:31:19.392" end="01:31:21.371" style="s2">Are you serious about the technological support?</p>
<p begin="01:31:21.430" end="01:31:23.532" style="s2">Your Prescott Group&#39;s advanced technology?</p>
<p begin="01:31:23.912" end="01:31:24.692" style="s2">That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:31:24.831" end="01:31:26.852" style="s2">This was always part of our strategic cooperation.</p>
<p begin="01:31:27.550" end="01:31:29.331" style="s2">Let&#39;s go to your office to discuss the details.</p>
<p begin="01:31:30.272" end="01:31:31.331" style="s2">Alright, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:31:32.392" end="01:31:33.171" style="s2">Meeting adjourned.</p>
<p begin="01:31:34.232" end="01:31:35.652" style="s2">Good, this works out well.</p>
<p begin="01:31:37.112" end="01:31:37.812" style="s2">Elliot.</p>
<p begin="01:31:37.831" end="01:31:40.090" style="s2">Doing this doesn&#39;t benefit the Prescott Group at all.</p>
<p begin="01:31:40.671" end="01:31:43.130" style="s2">I will not sign the strategic partnership agreement.</p>
<p begin="01:31:43.952" end="01:31:45.572" style="s2">I&#39;m doing this because I believe in you.</p>
<p begin="01:31:45.711" end="01:31:47.430" style="s2">And I&#39;m optimistic about Song Group.</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.992" end="01:31:49.050" style="s2">Consider it an investment.</p>
<p begin="01:31:50.510" end="01:31:51.970" style="s2">What if the investment fails?</p>
<p begin="01:31:52.992" end="01:31:54.772" style="s2">Impossible. I trust you.</p>
<p begin="01:32:03.451" end="01:32:04.951" style="s2">Little Sister Serena.</p>
<p begin="01:32:05.711" end="01:32:07.211" style="s2">That&#39;s what he used to call me.</p>
<p begin="01:32:09.031" end="01:32:10.010" style="s2">Little Sister Serena.</p>
<p begin="01:32:10.031" end="01:32:10.812" style="s2">You&#39;re so amazing.</p>
<p begin="01:32:10.831" end="01:32:12.291" style="s2">Will you marry me when we grow up?</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.352" end="01:32:14.531" style="s2">No way. I&#39;m not gonna marry you.</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.791" end="01:32:15.732" style="s2">I won&#39;t give up.</p>
<p begin="01:32:18.470" end="01:32:19.651" style="s2">Little Sister Serena.</p>
<p begin="01:32:19.911" end="01:32:20.892" style="s2">I got these for you.</p>
<p begin="01:32:20.911" end="01:32:22.451" style="s2">will you marry me when we grow up</p>
<p begin="01:32:24.031" end="01:32:25.852" style="s2">no I don&#39;t want to marry you</p>
<p begin="01:32:27.831" end="01:32:28.852" style="s2">little sister Serena</p>
<p begin="01:32:28.871" end="01:32:29.892" style="s2">I brought this for you</p>
<p begin="01:32:30.272" end="01:32:31.571" style="s2">little sister Serena</p>
<p begin="01:32:31.711" end="01:32:32.892" style="s2">would you like some cake</p>
<p begin="01:32:34.392" end="01:32:35.531" style="s2">little sister Serena</p>
<p begin="01:32:35.550" end="01:32:37.251" style="s2">these books are for you. no</p>
<p begin="01:32:44.791" end="01:32:46.090" style="s2">little sister Serena</p>
<p begin="01:32:46.711" end="01:32:48.130" style="s2">Maria said you like pretty things</p>
<p begin="01:32:48.430" end="01:32:50.451" style="s2">these bubbles are the prettiest things I could find</p>
<p begin="01:32:50.630" end="01:32:51.451" style="s2">they&#39;re for you</p>
<p begin="01:32:52.392" end="01:32:53.211" style="s2">OK I&#39;ll take them</p>
<p begin="01:32:53.232" end="01:32:54.692" style="s2">but this doesn&#39;t mean I&#39;m gonna marry you</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.711" end="01:32:55.812" style="s2">that&#39;s OK just take them</p>
<p begin="01:32:55.831" end="01:32:56.951" style="s2">I just want to make you happy</p>
<p begin="01:32:56.991" end="01:32:58.571" style="s2">I&#39;m just happy if you take them</p>
<p begin="01:32:59.111" end="01:33:01.251" style="s2">I&#39;m giving you a gift to make you happy that&#39;s all</p>
<p begin="01:33:01.272" end="01:33:04.571" style="s2">it&#39;s not a trade all right</p>
<p begin="01:33:09.031" end="01:33:10.651" style="s2">if when we grow up</p>
<p begin="01:33:10.751" end="01:33:12.130" style="s2">you&#39;re really capable</p>
<p begin="01:33:12.711" end="01:33:13.852" style="s2">then I&#39;ll marry you</p>
<p begin="01:33:14.590" end="01:33:17.090" style="s2">yes don&#39;t worry little sister Serena</p>
<p begin="01:33:17.111" end="01:33:19.651" style="s2">I&#39;m going to become very very very capable</p>
<p begin="01:33:22.312" end="01:33:23.651" style="s2">thinking about when we were kids</p>
<p begin="01:33:25.232" end="01:33:26.010" style="s2">I remember</p>
<p begin="01:33:28.470" end="01:33:31.130" style="s2">I remember what you said back when we were kids</p>
<p begin="01:33:31.871" end="01:33:32.371" style="s2">you said</p>
<p begin="01:33:32.392" end="01:33:34.411" style="s2">if I became a very capable person you would marry me</p>
<p begin="01:33:34.430" end="01:33:35.732" style="s2">I&#39;ve been working for that ever since</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.451" end="01:33:38.151" style="s2">really</p>
<p begin="01:33:38.451" end="01:33:39.251" style="s2">of course</p>
<p begin="01:33:40.272" end="01:33:43.050" style="s2">that&#39;s why I never dared to reach out. I couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:33:43.711" end="01:33:45.852" style="s2">I had to wait until I could see you again and</p>
<p begin="01:33:45.871" end="01:33:47.831" style="s2">know I had finally met your standard</p>
<p begin="01:33:48.211" end="01:33:48.791" style="s2">and now</p>
<p begin="01:33:49.531" end="01:33:49.911" style="s2">I am</p>
<p begin="01:33:51.050" end="01:33:52.930" style="s2">I&#39;ve become that very capable person</p>
<p begin="01:33:55.350" end="01:33:57.850" style="s2">the Prescott group is in the most capable hands</p>
<p begin="01:33:59.810" end="01:34:00.911" style="s2">I did what you asked</p>
<p begin="01:34:01.571" end="01:34:02.991" style="s2">can you keep your promise now</p>
<p begin="01:34:03.850" end="01:34:05.991" style="s2">can we not get divorced</p>
<p begin="01:34:06.371" end="01:34:08.151" style="s2">can we be together forever</p>
<p begin="01:34:09.531" end="01:34:10.550" style="s2">why would he say that</p>
<p begin="01:34:10.730" end="01:34:12.390" style="s2">after all these years of no contact</p>
<p begin="01:34:12.690" end="01:34:13.791" style="s2">he must feel guilty</p>
<p begin="01:34:14.211" end="01:34:15.531" style="s2">yeah that has to be it</p>
<p begin="01:34:16.850" end="01:34:18.590" style="s2">you don&#39;t have to force yourself to honor some</p>
<p begin="01:34:18.611" end="01:34:20.951" style="s2">old promise just because you feel like you owe</p>
<p begin="01:34:20.970" end="01:34:23.911" style="s2">me. that was just a childish game</p>
<p begin="01:34:24.211" end="01:34:24.991" style="s2">I don&#39;t mind</p>
<p begin="01:34:25.930" end="01:34:27.090" style="s2">Nora, I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="01:34:28.991" end="01:34:30.050" style="s2">Come in</p>
<p begin="01:34:31.451" end="01:34:32.390" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, Mr. Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.411" end="01:34:33.430" style="s2">I&#39;ve prepared the strategic</p>
<p begin="01:34:33.451" end="01:34:34.911" style="s2">cooperation agreement you asked for</p>
<p begin="01:34:35.211" end="01:34:36.310" style="s2">You&#39;ve got great timing</p>
<p begin="01:34:38.171" end="01:34:39.991" style="s2">Uh, actually, a couple of clauses</p>
<p begin="01:34:40.010" end="01:34:41.031" style="s2">here aren&#39;t quite clean</p>
<p begin="01:34:41.050" end="01:34:42.590" style="s2">Let me just take this back and revise it</p>
<p begin="01:34:42.611" end="01:34:43.550" style="s2">That won&#39;t be necessary</p>
<p begin="01:34:43.690" end="01:34:44.671" style="s2">Let me see it, Toby</p>
<p begin="01:34:47.411" end="01:34:48.550" style="s2">I have no objections</p>
<p begin="01:34:52.090" end="01:34:53.111" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Elliot</p>
<p begin="01:34:53.251" end="01:34:54.651" style="s2">You won&#39;t regret this investment</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.970" end="01:34:57.270" style="s2">She&#39;s not ready to accept me yet, but it&#39;s OK</p>
<p begin="01:34:57.411" end="01:34:58.190" style="s2">When we were kids</p>
<p begin="01:34:58.211" end="01:34:59.671" style="s2">I pestered her until she agreed</p>
<p begin="01:35:00.090" end="01:35:01.310" style="s2">I can do it again now</p>
<p begin="01:35:04.770" end="01:35:05.550" style="s2">I believe you</p>
<p begin="01:35:06.651" end="01:35:07.911" style="s2">Leaving Hai Cheng soon, right</p>
<p begin="01:35:08.010" end="01:35:09.430" style="s2">Prescott Group doesn&#39;t have business here</p>
<p begin="01:35:09.451" end="01:35:11.151" style="s2">does it? You didn&#39;t have to come all this way</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.251" end="01:35:12.430" style="s2">Oh, I forgot to tell you</p>
<p begin="01:35:12.491" end="01:35:13.470" style="s2">I&#39;ve just found some promising</p>
<p begin="01:35:13.491" end="01:35:14.630" style="s2">new ventures in Nan Cheng</p>
<p begin="01:35:14.651" end="01:35:15.671" style="s2">I&#39;ll be leading them myself</p>
<p begin="01:35:15.730" end="01:35:17.751" style="s2">I&#39;ll be here for a while supervising</p>
<p begin="01:35:17.810" end="01:35:19.671" style="s2">So we&#39;ll be seeing a lot more of each other</p>
<p begin="01:35:21.050" end="01:35:23.392" style="s2">I&#39;m going to be very busy, so I&#39;m afraid I won&#39;t have the time</p>
<p begin="01:35:23.531" end="01:35:25.550" style="s2">So what&#39;s this emerging industry you mentioned</p>
<p begin="01:35:26.010" end="01:35:27.430" style="s2">Maybe I can ask around for you</p>
<p begin="01:35:27.852" end="01:35:28.711" style="s2">Emerging industry</p>
<p begin="01:35:29.090" end="01:35:30.911" style="s2">Please, it&#39;s all just an excuse for the</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.930" end="01:35:32.312" style="s2">boss to get close to Nora</p>
<p begin="01:35:32.451" end="01:35:34.072" style="s2">She&#39;s so clueless about romance</p>
<p begin="01:35:34.251" end="01:35:36.031" style="s2">The boss has his work cut out for him</p>
<p begin="01:35:36.171" end="01:35:36.831" style="s2">No, that&#39;s OK</p>
<p begin="01:35:36.852" end="01:35:37.630" style="s2">I can handle it</p>
<p begin="01:35:37.652" end="01:35:38.392" style="s2">You get back to work</p>
<p begin="01:35:38.411" end="01:35:40.031" style="s2">I&#39;ll be on my way, OK</p>
<p begin="01:35:40.652" end="01:35:42.671" style="s2">Sir, Nora is all business right now</p>
<p begin="01:35:42.692" end="01:35:43.470" style="s2">What&#39;s the plan</p>
<p begin="01:35:44.171" end="01:35:45.751" style="s2">She was the same way back then</p>
<p begin="01:35:46.010" end="01:35:47.112" style="s2">Always had her head in a book</p>
<p begin="01:35:47.130" end="01:35:48.550" style="s2">Or was chasing some crush</p>
<p begin="01:35:48.652" end="01:35:50.312" style="s2">But she still chose me in the end</p>
<p begin="01:35:50.371" end="01:35:52.392" style="s2">And agreed to marry me, huh</p>
<p begin="01:35:55.572" end="01:35:57.352" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, these flowers are from Mr. Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:35:57.692" end="01:35:58.911" style="s2">Mr. Prescott said you&#39;ve been working</p>
<p begin="01:35:58.930" end="01:36:00.470" style="s2">hard and to take a moment to relax</p>
<p begin="01:36:05.652" end="01:36:08.392" style="s2">so sweet</p>
<p begin="01:36:08.652" end="01:36:09.791" style="s2">all right let&#39;s continue</p>
<p begin="01:36:10.211" end="01:36:11.232" style="s2">that&#39;s all for today</p>
<p begin="01:36:11.291" end="01:36:12.072" style="s2">meeting adjourned</p>
<p begin="01:36:13.652" end="01:36:14.352" style="s2">ma&#39;am, for you</p>
<p begin="01:36:14.371" end="01:36:15.392" style="s2">from Mr. Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:36:15.652" end="01:36:16.871" style="s2">he thought you would love it</p>
<p begin="01:36:17.251" end="01:36:19.510" style="s2">wow, that&#39;s gorgeous, so pretty</p>
<p begin="01:36:19.531" end="01:36:20.470" style="s2">this is amazing</p>
<p begin="01:36:23.130" end="01:36:24.152" style="s2">he&#39;s so thoughtful</p>
<p begin="01:36:24.652" end="01:36:25.951" style="s2">this was supposed to be business</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.010" end="01:36:27.711" style="s2">but he&#39;s the only one helping me</p>
<p begin="01:36:27.970" end="01:36:29.711" style="s2">it&#39;s all because of him that my</p>
<p begin="01:36:29.732" end="01:36:31.152" style="s2">work is going so smoothly</p>
<p begin="01:36:33.531" end="01:36:36.031" style="s2">whoa, this has to be from Mr. Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:36:36.151" end="01:36:37.812" style="s2">miss, this was sent over by Mr. Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:36:37.871" end="01:36:38.812" style="s2">he said it&#39;s the legendary</p>
<p begin="01:36:38.831" end="01:36:39.730" style="s2">Vasulius Stradivarius</p>
<p begin="01:36:39.751" end="01:36:40.611" style="s2">he came across it by chance</p>
<p begin="01:36:40.630" end="01:36:41.371" style="s2">and he&#39;d rather you have it</p>
<p begin="01:36:41.392" end="01:36:42.291" style="s2">than let it collect dust</p>
<p begin="01:36:42.831" end="01:36:44.491" style="s2">the Vasulius Stradivarius</p>
<p begin="01:36:44.590" end="01:36:46.331" style="s2">that&#39;s one of the most famous violins ever</p>
<p begin="01:36:46.510" end="01:36:48.050" style="s2">Mr. Prescott must truly love you</p>
<p begin="01:36:48.111" end="01:36:49.371" style="s2">he just said he found it by chance</p>
<p begin="01:36:49.590" end="01:36:50.812" style="s2">this violin two days ago</p>
<p begin="01:36:50.831" end="01:36:52.331" style="s2">it was up for auction and was bought by a</p>
<p begin="01:36:52.352" end="01:36:53.831" style="s2">mysterious buyer for thirty million dollars</p>
<p begin="01:36:54.071" end="01:36:55.852" style="s2">bought it? Got it by chance?</p>
<p begin="01:36:55.871" end="01:36:56.770" style="s2">do you believe that</p>
<p begin="01:36:58.111" end="01:36:59.130" style="s2">it&#39;s that expensive</p>
<p begin="01:36:59.510" end="01:37:00.371" style="s2">it was one thing when he sent</p>
<p begin="01:37:00.392" end="01:37:01.331" style="s2">me flowers and moonstones</p>
<p begin="01:37:01.352" end="01:37:02.690" style="s2">but a two hundred million dollar Salvatore</p>
<p begin="01:37:02.711" end="01:37:03.651" style="s2">what on earth is he thinking</p>
<p begin="01:37:03.871" end="01:37:05.571" style="s2">miss, you two are husband and wife</p>
<p begin="01:37:05.751" end="01:37:07.531" style="s2">no matter how expensive a gift he gives you</p>
<p begin="01:37:07.550" end="01:37:08.491" style="s2">is perfectly normal</p>
<p begin="01:37:09.711" end="01:37:12.171" style="s2">Mr. Bell, let me be honest with you. Hmm, actually...</p>
<p begin="01:37:12.190" end="01:37:13.730" style="s2">Mr. Hazel and I have a contract marriage</p>
<p begin="01:37:13.991" end="01:37:14.892" style="s2">he married me just to deal</p>
<p begin="01:37:14.911" end="01:37:15.930" style="s2">with his mother&#39;s pressure</p>
<p begin="01:37:16.111" end="01:37:17.371" style="s2">he doesn&#39;t actually like me. He doesn&#39;t actually like. He doesn&#39;t actually like. He doesn&#39;t actually like. He doesn&#39;t actually like. He doesn&#39;t actually like.</p>
<p begin="01:37:17.430" end="01:37:18.892" style="s2">we&#39;ll divorce in a year at most. What?</p>
<p begin="01:37:20.590" end="01:37:21.371" style="s2">don&#39;t you worry</p>
<p begin="01:37:21.470" end="01:37:23.211" style="s2">I can establish myself in a year</p>
<p begin="01:37:23.312" end="01:37:25.411" style="s2">and then the Song Group will own this city</p>
<p begin="01:37:25.590" end="01:37:26.892" style="s2">even without the Hawkes Group</p>
<p begin="01:37:27.230" end="01:37:29.050" style="s2">Nora, it&#39;s not the company I&#39;m worried about</p>
<p begin="01:37:29.071" end="01:37:29.852" style="s2">it&#39;s you</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.470" end="01:37:31.211" style="s2">what about me</p>
<p begin="01:37:31.230" end="01:37:31.611" style="s2">come on</p>
<p begin="01:37:31.630" end="01:37:33.371" style="s2">everyone knows how Mr. Hays feels about you</p>
<p begin="01:37:33.392" end="01:37:34.690" style="s2">but you insist he doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:37:34.711" end="01:37:36.852" style="s2">he&#39;s clearly head over heels for you, goodness</p>
<p begin="01:37:37.151" end="01:37:37.930" style="s2">that&#39;s impossible</p>
<p begin="01:37:38.470" end="01:37:38.751" style="s2">he&#39;s never</p>
<p begin="01:37:39.491" end="01:37:39.892" style="s2">he never</p>
<p begin="01:37:42.550" end="01:37:43.812" style="s2">could it be that he really</p>
<p begin="01:37:45.692" end="01:37:49.090" style="s2">Nora, so you&#39;ve decided Mr. Prescott&#39;s a good man</p>
<p begin="01:37:49.112" end="01:37:50.911" style="s2">how can you just let him go</p>
<p begin="01:37:50.930" end="01:37:52.251" style="s2">Mr. Bell, I know</p>
<p begin="01:37:52.352" end="01:37:54.532" style="s2">hmm, I need to think about it</p>
<p begin="01:37:55.232" end="01:37:56.411" style="s2">all right, take your time</p>
<p begin="01:37:56.430" end="01:37:57.251" style="s2">I&#39;ll head out</p>
<p begin="01:37:59.751" end="01:38:02.010" style="s2">are you sure the piano was delivered? Of course</p>
<p begin="01:38:02.112" end="01:38:04.291" style="s2">I delivered the piano to Miss Hayes&#39; office myself</p>
<p begin="01:38:05.470" end="01:38:07.251" style="s2">so she should have seen the piano by now</p>
<p begin="01:38:07.352" end="01:38:08.532" style="s2">I wonder how she&#39;ll react</p>
<p begin="01:38:08.991" end="01:38:10.371" style="s2">maybe I should just go ask her myself</p>
<p begin="01:38:10.510" end="01:38:12.812" style="s2">don&#39;t, sir. You sent her such a precious piano</p>
<p begin="01:38:12.831" end="01:38:14.010" style="s2">if she&#39;s moved by the gesture</p>
<p begin="01:38:14.032" end="01:38:15.211" style="s2">she&#39;ll call you herself</p>
<p begin="01:38:15.232" end="01:38:16.892" style="s2">Mr. Prescott, Miss Hayes asked you to wait here</p>
<p begin="01:38:16.911" end="01:38:17.769" style="s2">she&#39;ll be down shortly</p>
<p begin="01:38:18.470" end="01:38:19.612" style="s2">it&#39;s her handwriting. Tell her I will</p>
<p begin="01:38:20.352" end="01:38:22.550" style="s2">be there on time, yes sir</p>
<p begin="01:38:23.852" end="01:38:24.251" style="s2">sir</p>
<p begin="01:38:24.630" end="01:38:26.970" style="s2">it looks like Miss Hayes is finally warming up to you</p>
<p begin="01:38:27.272" end="01:38:29.251" style="s2">see, persistence pays off</p>
<p begin="01:38:29.392" end="01:38:30.130" style="s2">all right, let&#39;s go</p>
<p begin="01:38:30.152" end="01:38:30.930" style="s2">right away, sir</p>
<p begin="01:38:32.112" end="01:38:33.331" style="s2">that bitch, Nora</p>
<p begin="01:38:33.711" end="01:38:35.491" style="s2">using you just to get a seat on the board</p>
<p begin="01:38:35.871" end="01:38:37.171" style="s2">that was the only reason I</p>
<p begin="01:38:37.192" end="01:38:38.732" style="s2">schemed so hard to marry you</p>
<p begin="01:38:39.032" end="01:38:41.251" style="s2">and to think you won&#39;t even give me a second glance</p>
<p begin="01:38:42.312" end="01:38:43.892" style="s2">Miss Elaine, it&#39;s done. I saw</p>
<p begin="01:38:44.032" end="01:38:44.930" style="s2">you can go now</p>
<p begin="01:38:45.430" end="01:38:47.411" style="s2">remember, don&#39;t tell anyone about what happened today</p>
<p begin="01:38:47.510" end="01:38:49.611" style="s2">yes, ma&#39;am. My father took the fall for me</p>
<p begin="01:38:49.630" end="01:38:50.970" style="s2">that&#39;s the only reason I&#39;m free</p>
<p begin="01:38:51.031" end="01:38:51.930" style="s2">but you, Nora</p>
<p begin="01:38:51.951" end="01:38:53.090" style="s2">don&#39;t get so smug</p>
<p begin="01:38:53.152" end="01:38:54.652" style="s2">I&#39;ll make sure you end up with nothing</p>
<p begin="01:38:56.612" end="01:38:58.050" style="s2">Ma&#39;am! Ma&#39;am!</p>
<p begin="01:38:59.232" end="01:39:00.291" style="s2">Mr. Bell, what happened</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.392" end="01:39:01.211" style="s2">I just got word</p>
<p begin="01:39:01.550" end="01:39:03.732" style="s2">Elaine Crane was released without charge</p>
<p begin="01:39:03.751" end="01:39:05.171" style="s2">Mr. Crane insisted he acted alone.</p>
<p begin="01:39:05.192" end="01:39:06.612" style="s2">That Elaine knew nothing about it.</p>
<p begin="01:39:07.630" end="01:39:08.211" style="s2">Hmm.</p>
<p begin="01:39:08.232" end="01:39:10.371" style="s2">I didn&#39;t realize he doted on Aileen that much.</p>
<p begin="01:39:10.630" end="01:39:11.970" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, what are you gonna do?</p>
<p begin="01:39:12.309" end="01:39:13.970" style="s2">First, have someone watch her.</p>
<p begin="01:39:14.312" end="01:39:14.970" style="s2">Knowing Aileen,</p>
<p begin="01:39:14.992" end="01:39:15.970" style="s2">she won&#39;t let this go.</p>
<p begin="01:39:16.392" end="01:39:17.272" style="s2">Understood, I&#39;m on it.</p>
<p begin="01:39:17.352" end="01:39:18.812" style="s2">Miss, I have a message: Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:39:18.831" end="01:39:20.090" style="s2">Prescott has received the note and</p>
<p begin="01:39:20.112" end="01:39:21.331" style="s2">asks you to please be there.</p>
<p begin="01:39:21.831" end="01:39:24.010" style="s2">Miss, when did you send a note to Mr. Prescott?</p>
<p begin="01:39:24.152" end="01:39:25.812" style="s2">I&#39;ve never sent him a note, Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:39:25.831" end="01:39:26.572" style="s2">Bell. Was it you?</p>
<p begin="01:39:26.590" end="01:39:27.371" style="s2">Of course not, Miss.</p>
<p begin="01:39:27.392" end="01:39:29.010" style="s2">I would never act on my own in your affairs.</p>
<p begin="01:39:29.192" end="01:39:29.970" style="s2">Then who was it?</p>
<p begin="01:39:29.992" end="01:39:31.412" style="s2">Wait, could it be Elaine Crane?</p>
<p begin="01:39:31.430" end="01:39:32.371" style="s2">She copied my handwriting</p>
<p begin="01:39:32.392" end="01:39:33.251" style="s2">perfectly to impersonate me.</p>
<p begin="01:39:33.272" end="01:39:33.970" style="s2">It has to be her.</p>
<p begin="01:39:33.992" end="01:39:35.331" style="s2">Could it be she wants to harm Mr. Prescott?</p>
<p begin="01:39:36.510" end="01:39:37.992" style="s2">I&#39;ll call Elliot.</p>
<p begin="01:39:38.010" end="01:39:39.532" style="s2">Nora specially invited me to dinner.</p>
<p begin="01:39:39.791" end="01:39:41.331" style="s2">I can&#39;t let anyone disturb us.</p>
<p begin="01:39:44.352" end="01:39:45.412" style="s2">He actually turned it off.</p>
<p begin="01:39:46.312" end="01:39:48.211" style="s2">Lucy, go ask Alex where they are now.</p>
<p begin="01:39:48.232" end="01:39:49.010" style="s2">Yes, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="01:39:49.992" end="01:39:50.772" style="s2">Mister Prescott.</p>
<p begin="01:39:50.791" end="01:39:52.171" style="s2">This is the sea urchin juice.</p>
<p begin="01:39:52.192" end="01:39:54.090" style="s2">Miss Song had it prepared especially for you.</p>
<p begin="01:39:54.152" end="01:39:54.852" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:39:57.032" end="01:39:59.331" style="s2">Nora actually knows I love sea buckthorn juice.</p>
<p begin="01:39:59.912" end="01:40:01.251" style="s2">This has to mean she feels the same way.</p>
<p begin="01:40:02.392" end="01:40:04.452" style="s2">Nora, how could it be you?</p>
<p begin="01:40:06.051" end="01:40:07.072" style="s2">Why can&#39;t it be me?</p>
<p begin="01:40:07.471" end="01:40:08.371" style="s2">Elliot, besides me,</p>
<p begin="01:40:08.392" end="01:40:10.171" style="s2">who else knows you love drinking kombucha?</p>
<p begin="01:40:10.352" end="01:40:11.892" style="s2">That bitch, Nora Dreamon.</p>
<p begin="01:40:11.912" end="01:40:12.572" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t care about you.</p>
<p begin="01:40:12.591" end="01:40:13.091" style="s2">Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:40:13.112" end="01:40:14.930" style="s2">I won&#39;t. These past 3 years,</p>
<p begin="01:40:14.952" end="01:40:16.171" style="s2">haven&#39;t I been good enough to you?</p>
<p begin="01:40:16.192" end="01:40:16.772" style="s2">Why won&#39;t you just...</p>
<p begin="01:40:16.791" end="01:40:17.532" style="s2">won&#39;t you marry me?</p>
<p begin="01:40:17.551" end="01:40:19.051" style="s2">How am I any worse than that bitch?</p>
<p begin="01:40:19.312" end="01:40:20.452" style="s2">So you&#39;re the one who wrote that note.</p>
<p begin="01:40:20.471" end="01:40:21.051" style="s2">I&#39;m not surprised,</p>
<p begin="01:40:21.072" end="01:40:22.211" style="s2">since you can imitate her handwriting.</p>
<p begin="01:40:22.232" end="01:40:23.251" style="s2">not surprised at all</p>
<p begin="01:40:23.392" end="01:40:24.652" style="s2">even if you can imitate the handwriting</p>
<p begin="01:40:24.671" end="01:40:25.892" style="s2">you can never imitate her soul</p>
<p begin="01:40:26.751" end="01:40:27.532" style="s2">it doesn&#39;t matter</p>
<p begin="01:40:27.631" end="01:40:27.992" style="s2">you&#39;re still falling into my hands</p>
<p begin="01:40:30.711" end="01:40:32.091" style="s2">you dare to drug me</p>
<p begin="01:40:35.551" end="01:40:37.091" style="s2">ma&#39;am, after I dropped the president off here</p>
<p begin="01:40:37.112" end="01:40:37.852" style="s2">he sent me away</p>
<p begin="01:40:37.871" end="01:40:39.211" style="s2">I never expected that the date he was looking</p>
<p begin="01:40:39.232" end="01:40:40.971" style="s2">forward to so much would turn out to be a conspiracy</p>
<p begin="01:40:41.072" end="01:40:41.852" style="s2">he&#39;ll be fine</p>
<p begin="01:40:42.032" end="01:40:42.930" style="s2">ma&#39;am, ma&#39;am</p>
<p begin="01:40:44.511" end="01:40:47.091" style="s2">that&#39;s right, the drug was in this glass of kombucha</p>
<p begin="01:40:47.551" end="01:40:48.051" style="s2">tomorrow morning</p>
<p begin="01:40:48.072" end="01:40:49.692" style="s2">the media will take pictures of us</p>
<p begin="01:40:49.992" end="01:40:53.051" style="s2">Nora will see us together with her own eyes by then</p>
<p begin="01:41:01.444" end="01:41:05.224" style="s2">let him go. Impossible! How did you? Ah!</p>
<p begin="01:41:06.745" end="01:41:07.765" style="s2">Elliot, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:41:08.224" end="01:41:09.644" style="s2">Nora, you&#39;re here</p>
<p begin="01:41:09.784" end="01:41:11.005" style="s2">stay with me. Of course</p>
<p begin="01:41:13.523" end="01:41:14.704" style="s2">I&#39;ll make sure you and Kaden</p>
<p begin="01:41:14.723" end="01:41:16.063" style="s2">never bounce back from this</p>
<p begin="01:41:17.723" end="01:41:18.863" style="s2">I just used your name to</p>
<p begin="01:41:18.884" end="01:41:20.304" style="s2">lure Elliot Prescott here</p>
<p begin="01:41:20.363" end="01:41:21.903" style="s2">you think you can convict me for that</p>
<p begin="01:41:22.443" end="01:41:23.304" style="s2">as for my dad</p>
<p begin="01:41:23.763" end="01:41:26.544" style="s2">he&#39;ll be out in two years at most. Is that so?</p>
<p begin="01:41:26.964" end="01:41:28.624" style="s2">but I&#39;ve already found out that my mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:41:28.643" end="01:41:30.664" style="s2">death was a conspiracy between you and Caden</p>
<p begin="01:41:30.884" end="01:41:31.903" style="s2">you bought the poison</p>
<p begin="01:41:31.964" end="01:41:33.063" style="s2">Caden administered it</p>
<p begin="01:41:33.084" end="01:41:34.664" style="s2">that&#39;s why my mother was sick for so long</p>
<p begin="01:41:34.763" end="01:41:35.744" style="s2">and died without justice</p>
<p begin="01:41:36.763" end="01:41:38.664" style="s2">evidence? I&#39;ve got almost everything</p>
<p begin="01:41:38.924" end="01:41:39.863" style="s2">no, impossible</p>
<p begin="01:41:40.403" end="01:41:41.784" style="s2">that time, I remember</p>
<p begin="01:41:42.084" end="01:41:42.784" style="s2">my dad and I</p>
<p begin="01:41:42.804" end="01:41:44.584" style="s2">we got rid of all the evidence completely</p>
<p begin="01:41:44.683" end="01:41:45.704" style="s2">you&#39;ll never find it. You&#39;ll never find it</p>
<p begin="01:41:47.084" end="01:41:48.063" style="s2">so it was you</p>
<p begin="01:41:48.323" end="01:41:49.784" style="s2">you actually killed my mother</p>
<p begin="01:41:51.384" end="01:41:52.685" style="s2">i&#39;ve recorded every word</p>
<p begin="01:41:53.584" end="01:41:54.285" style="s2">what she just said</p>
<p begin="01:41:54.304" end="01:41:55.563" style="s2">i&#39;ve already recorded it</p>
<p begin="01:41:55.905" end="01:41:57.204" style="s2">take this evidence and her</p>
<p begin="01:41:57.225" end="01:41:58.124" style="s2">to the police station</p>
<p begin="01:41:58.584" end="01:41:59.365" style="s2">yes ma&#39;am</p>
<p begin="01:42:00.905" end="01:42:03.124" style="s2">ma&#39;am, what about the president? don&#39;t worry</p>
<p begin="01:42:03.384" end="01:42:04.124" style="s2">i&#39;m here</p>
<p begin="01:42:05.725" end="01:42:06.445" style="s2">move</p>
<p begin="01:42:07.744" end="01:42:09.244" style="s2">Elliot i&#39;m taking you to the hospital</p>
<p begin="01:42:09.544" end="01:42:11.765" style="s2">Nora i won&#39;t forget any of this</p>
<p begin="01:42:13.605" end="01:42:15.025" style="s2">i can&#39;t take this anymore</p>
<p begin="01:42:15.424" end="01:42:16.044" style="s2">but</p>
<p begin="01:42:16.065" end="01:42:17.924" style="s2">piano, you felt it, right</p>
<p begin="01:42:18.265" end="01:42:19.725" style="s2">you have to know how i feel</p>
<p begin="01:42:20.424" end="01:42:22.285" style="s2">so will you</p>
<p begin="01:42:23.344" end="01:42:24.765" style="s2">that&#39;s not what this is about</p>
<p begin="01:42:25.185" end="01:42:27.004" style="s2">i&#39;m worried this medicine has side effects</p>
<p begin="01:42:27.025" end="01:42:28.964" style="s2">we have to go to the hospital. it&#39;s safer</p>
<p begin="01:42:29.065" end="01:42:29.844" style="s2">it&#39;s too late</p>
<p begin="01:42:29.945" end="01:42:30.725" style="s2">if you&#39;re willing</p>
<p begin="01:42:30.985" end="01:42:31.844" style="s2">then just go</p>
<p begin="01:42:32.065" end="01:42:32.424" style="s2">go</p>
<p begin="01:42:32.445" end="01:42:33.325" style="s2">get out</p>
<p begin="01:42:38.136" end="01:42:39.035" style="s2">you know the first night you</p>
<p begin="01:42:39.056" end="01:42:40.035" style="s2">came to the Prescott house</p>
<p begin="01:42:40.056" end="01:42:41.256" style="s2">i barely slept at all</p>
<p begin="01:42:41.796" end="01:42:42.115" style="s2">why</p>
<p begin="01:42:42.775" end="01:42:43.915" style="s2">because you were by my side</p>
<p begin="01:42:44.775" end="01:42:45.676" style="s2">but back then</p>
<p begin="01:42:45.815" end="01:42:47.195" style="s2">you told me you didn&#39;t feel that way</p>
<p begin="01:42:47.216" end="01:42:48.875" style="s2">you even said i was imagining things</p>
<p begin="01:42:49.936" end="01:42:50.796" style="s2">you silly girl</p>
<p begin="01:42:50.815" end="01:42:52.995" style="s2">that was just because</p>
<p begin="01:42:53.016" end="01:42:54.436" style="s2">you said you had no ulterior emotions</p>
<p begin="01:42:54.495" end="01:42:55.676" style="s2">i was trying to save face</p>
<p begin="01:42:55.775" end="01:42:56.756" style="s2">that&#39;s why i said it</p>
<p begin="01:42:57.375" end="01:43:00.596" style="s2">anyway, will you be with me forever</p>
<p begin="01:43:02.896" end="01:43:03.716" style="s2">Elliot i</p>
<p begin="01:43:05.315" end="01:43:06.495" style="s2">why are you hesitating</p>
<p begin="01:43:07.155" end="01:43:07.896" style="s2">last night we</p>
<p begin="01:43:07.915" end="01:43:08.735" style="s2">about last night</p>
<p begin="01:43:08.796" end="01:43:09.856" style="s2">don&#39;t worry about it</p>
<p begin="01:43:10.035" end="01:43:11.296" style="s2">i did it to help you thats all</p>
<p begin="01:43:11.315" end="01:43:12.256" style="s2">you don&#39;t owe me anything</p>
<p begin="01:43:12.756" end="01:43:15.535" style="s2">so you have no intention of being with me</p>
<p begin="01:43:17.275" end="01:43:19.176" style="s2">did you come to Hai Cheng this time for me</p>
<p begin="01:43:19.516" end="01:43:20.375" style="s2">what do you think</p>
<p begin="01:43:21.436" end="01:43:22.815" style="s2">you&#39;re the head of the Prescott group</p>
<p begin="01:43:22.836" end="01:43:24.695" style="s2">you can&#39;t be away from the company for long</p>
<p begin="01:43:24.995" end="01:43:27.615" style="s2">i have my own responsibilities too but</p>
<p begin="01:43:27.636" end="01:43:29.615" style="s2">so you need to go back to Hai Cheng</p>
<p begin="01:43:30.396" end="01:43:30.936" style="s2">i have a meeting</p>
<p begin="01:43:30.955" end="01:43:31.936" style="s2">i have to go now</p>
<p begin="01:43:34.915" end="01:43:36.096" style="s2">this heartless woman</p>
<p begin="01:43:38.716" end="01:43:40.375" style="s2">David i need you to do something for me</p>
<p begin="01:43:41.315" end="01:43:42.756" style="s2">Mrs voss the report is ready</p>
<p begin="01:43:45.636" end="01:43:46.995" style="s2">excuse me ma&#39;am</p>
<p begin="01:43:47.016" end="01:43:47.256" style="s2">huh</p>
<p begin="01:43:47.516" end="01:43:48.856" style="s2">oh what is it</p>
<p begin="01:43:49.075" end="01:43:50.535" style="s2">there&#39;s a couple here to see you</p>
<p begin="01:43:50.596" end="01:43:51.896" style="s2">they said their name is oyer and</p>
<p begin="01:43:51.915" end="01:43:53.256" style="s2">that they are your adoptive parents</p>
<p begin="01:43:54.556" end="01:43:56.176" style="s2">my adoptive parent really</p>
<p begin="01:43:56.315" end="01:43:57.375" style="s2">quick let them in</p>
<p begin="01:43:57.396" end="01:43:57.575" style="s2">yes</p>
<p begin="01:43:59.756" end="01:44:00.535" style="s2">dad mom</p>
<p begin="01:44:00.596" end="01:44:01.575" style="s2">i&#39;m so sorry</p>
<p begin="01:44:01.676" end="01:44:03.096" style="s2">i&#39;ve been so busy lately</p>
<p begin="01:44:03.275" end="01:44:04.815" style="s2">i haven&#39;t had time to visit you</p>
<p begin="01:44:04.995" end="01:44:06.896" style="s2">dad how&#39;s your recovery from the surgery</p>
<p begin="01:44:07.115" end="01:44:08.856" style="s2">great. i&#39;m recovering very well</p>
<p begin="01:44:08.915" end="01:44:09.815" style="s2">the doctor said i can live</p>
<p begin="01:44:09.836" end="01:44:10.815" style="s2">for another twenty years</p>
<p begin="01:44:11.436" end="01:44:13.775" style="s2">we&#39;ve already seen it on the news</p>
<p begin="01:44:13.875" end="01:44:15.455" style="s2">so you&#39;re the shang family heir</p>
<p begin="01:44:16.315" end="01:44:17.336" style="s2">we really don&#39;t deserve to have</p>
<p begin="01:44:17.356" end="01:44:18.535" style="s2">you call us mom and dad</p>
<p begin="01:44:18.756" end="01:44:19.495" style="s2">that&#39;s right</p>
<p begin="01:44:19.516" end="01:44:20.375" style="s2">mom what are you saying</p>
<p begin="01:44:20.875" end="01:44:21.936" style="s2">it was you and dad who gave me</p>
<p begin="01:44:21.955" end="01:44:22.875" style="s2">a second chance at life</p>
<p begin="01:44:22.915" end="01:44:24.096" style="s2">my birth mom is gone</p>
<p begin="01:44:24.436" end="01:44:25.615" style="s2">and my dad&#39;s a monster</p>
<p begin="01:44:26.075" end="01:44:26.936" style="s2">i&#39;m so happy</p>
<p begin="01:44:27.235" end="01:44:28.016" style="s2">you&#39;re my parents</p>
<p begin="01:44:28.556" end="01:44:29.336" style="s2">oh honey</p>
<p begin="01:44:29.836" end="01:44:31.375" style="s2">as long as you&#39;ll still have us</p>
<p begin="01:44:31.875" end="01:44:32.936" style="s2">we&#39;ll always be here</p>
<p begin="01:44:34.535" end="01:44:35.356" style="s2">that&#39;s our girl</p>
<p begin="01:44:35.875" end="01:44:38.176" style="s2">we&#39;ll always be your parents as long as you&#39;ll have us</p>
<p begin="01:44:38.396" end="01:44:39.176" style="s2">are you kidding</p>
<p begin="01:44:39.195" end="01:44:40.976" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t be happier to have you with me</p>
<p begin="01:44:41.875" end="01:44:43.615" style="s2">well since you still see us as your parents</p>
<p begin="01:44:43.995" end="01:44:45.455" style="s2">then I have to lecture you a little</p>
<p begin="01:44:45.636" end="01:44:47.735" style="s2">she&#39;s right, you young lady</p>
<p begin="01:44:48.195" end="01:44:49.455" style="s2">you need to have a conscience</p>
<p begin="01:44:50.275" end="01:44:51.136" style="s2">what did I do</p>
<p begin="01:44:52.235" end="01:44:53.216" style="s2">Elliot&#39;s a good kid</p>
<p begin="01:44:53.356" end="01:44:54.216" style="s2">you chose him</p>
<p begin="01:44:54.235" end="01:44:55.176" style="s2">how could you leave him just</p>
<p begin="01:44:55.195" end="01:44:56.256" style="s2">because your life has changed</p>
<p begin="01:44:56.476" end="01:44:57.896" style="s2">Elliot&#39;s a good kid</p>
<p begin="01:44:58.155" end="01:44:59.455" style="s2">you were so busy with work</p>
<p begin="01:44:59.516" end="01:45:01.375" style="s2">it was Elliot who picked me up from the hospital</p>
<p begin="01:45:01.436" end="01:45:03.296" style="s2">and visited us every day with supplements</p>
<p begin="01:45:03.396" end="01:45:04.896" style="s2">at first I thought he was your colleague</p>
<p begin="01:45:04.915" end="01:45:06.535" style="s2">just like that young man Toby Quina</p>
<p begin="01:45:06.555" end="01:45:07.856" style="s2">I knew something wasn&#39;t right</p>
<p begin="01:45:08.155" end="01:45:08.976" style="s2">it took some pressing</p>
<p begin="01:45:08.995" end="01:45:10.136" style="s2">but he finally told me you two</p>
<p begin="01:45:10.155" end="01:45:11.136" style="s2">had been dating for a while</p>
<p begin="01:45:11.155" end="01:45:13.056" style="s2">and that you&#39;d asked him to take good care of us</p>
<p begin="01:45:13.396" end="01:45:15.216" style="s2">that kid is handsome, classy</p>
<p begin="01:45:15.235" end="01:45:16.176" style="s2">and doesn&#39;t even have a trace</p>
<p begin="01:45:16.195" end="01:45:17.575" style="s2">of a rich boy&#39;s bad habits</p>
<p begin="01:45:17.915" end="01:45:19.655" style="s2">he even personally changed my wound dressing</p>
<p begin="01:45:19.756" end="01:45:21.655" style="s2">so Elliot&#39;s been doing all this for me</p>
<p begin="01:45:21.716" end="01:45:22.695" style="s2">and I had no idea</p>
<p begin="01:45:22.836" end="01:45:23.296" style="s2">that&#39;s right</p>
<p begin="01:45:23.315" end="01:45:24.056" style="s2">and for what</p>
<p begin="01:45:24.075" end="01:45:25.495" style="s2">the moment you become Anora Sinclair</p>
<p begin="01:45:25.516" end="01:45:26.535" style="s2">you just throw him aside</p>
<p begin="01:45:26.636" end="01:45:27.735" style="s2">and just abandoned him</p>
<p begin="01:45:27.875" end="01:45:29.256" style="s2">Nora, we can&#39;t be ungrateful</p>
<p begin="01:45:29.596" end="01:45:30.856" style="s2">who said I abandoned him</p>
<p begin="01:45:30.955" end="01:45:31.535" style="s2">this morning</p>
<p begin="01:45:31.556" end="01:45:33.016" style="s2">Elliot himself called me crying</p>
<p begin="01:45:33.035" end="01:45:34.256" style="s2">that you don&#39;t want him anymore</p>
<p begin="01:45:34.676" end="01:45:35.775" style="s2">he also said that now</p>
<p begin="01:45:36.075" end="01:45:37.615" style="s2">he won&#39;t be able to look after us anymore</p>
<p begin="01:45:37.676" end="01:45:38.575" style="s2">look at what you&#39;ve done</p>
<p begin="01:45:38.636" end="01:45:40.296" style="s2">he even told us not to blame you</p>
<p begin="01:45:40.476" end="01:45:42.096" style="s2">Nora, if you still see us as your parents</p>
<p begin="01:45:42.115" end="01:45:44.096" style="s2">how could you treat Elliot like this, huh</p>
<p begin="01:45:44.115" end="01:45:45.655" style="s2">Elliot, you two-faced jerk</p>
<p begin="01:45:47.375" end="01:45:49.216" style="s2">Dad, Mom, it&#39;s not what you think</p>
<p begin="01:45:49.516" end="01:45:51.016" style="s2">but do you believe me</p>
<p begin="01:45:51.035" end="01:45:52.056" style="s2">or do you believe him</p>
<p begin="01:45:52.315" end="01:45:54.655" style="s2">Of course, we believe you. That&#39;s good.</p>
<p begin="01:45:55.035" end="01:45:56.615" style="s2">Since you two are already in South City,</p>
<p begin="01:45:56.636" end="01:45:57.375" style="s2">Why don&#39;t you stay and have</p>
<p begin="01:45:57.396" end="01:45:58.535" style="s2">some fun for a couple of days?</p>
<p begin="01:45:59.075" end="01:46:00.495" style="s2">Elliot, Mr. and Mrs. Sawyer, I&#39;ll take you to your hotel.</p>
<p begin="01:46:00.516" end="01:46:01.695" style="s2">Sawyer, I&#39;ll take you to your hotel.</p>
<p begin="01:46:01.796" end="01:46:02.296" style="s2">All right, then.</p>
<p begin="01:46:02.315" end="01:46:02.655" style="s2">Let me tell you,</p>
<p begin="01:46:02.676" end="01:46:03.375" style="s2">If you don&#39;t have any</p>
<p begin="01:46:03.396" end="01:46:04.615" style="s2">fundamental conflicts with Elliot,</p>
<p begin="01:46:04.636" end="01:46:06.235" style="s2">don&#39;t you dare throw a tantrum at him, okay?</p>
<p begin="01:46:06.356" end="01:46:07.615" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, Mom and Dad.</p>
<p begin="01:46:08.035" end="01:46:08.936" style="s2">All right, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:46:12.075" end="01:46:13.735" style="s2">Hello, Grandpa Prescott. It&#39;s Nora.</p>
<p begin="01:46:13.756" end="01:46:15.216" style="s2">I&#39;m calling to ask for a favor.</p>
<p begin="01:46:15.676" end="01:46:16.936" style="s2">What&#39;s taking her so long?</p>
<p begin="01:46:17.035" end="01:46:18.296" style="s2">I wonder how their talk went.</p>
<p begin="01:46:18.915" end="01:46:20.455" style="s2">Sir, are you sure this will work?</p>
<p begin="01:46:21.436" end="01:46:22.256" style="s2">I&#39;m not sure.</p>
<p begin="01:46:22.556" end="01:46:24.575" style="s2">But the Sawyer parents saved Nora&#39;s life.</p>
<p begin="01:46:24.716" end="01:46:27.296" style="s2">She shouldn&#39;t go against their wishes, right? I get it.</p>
<p begin="01:46:27.315" end="01:46:28.655" style="s2">So you&#39;re out of ideas, sir?</p>
<p begin="01:46:29.396" end="01:46:29.936" style="s2">If you ask me,</p>
<p begin="01:46:29.955" end="01:46:31.655" style="s2">you should just give up. Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:46:32.195" end="01:46:33.096" style="s2">What do you know?</p>
<p begin="01:46:33.436" end="01:46:34.455" style="s2">I can feel it.</p>
<p begin="01:46:34.796" end="01:46:36.356" style="s2">Nora must still have feelings for me.</p>
<p begin="01:46:38.676" end="01:46:40.216" style="s2">Grandpa, is something wrong with the company?</p>
<p begin="01:46:40.436" end="01:46:42.216" style="s2">No, it&#39;s because Nora called me.</p>
<p begin="01:46:42.235" end="01:46:44.176" style="s2">She said you&#39;re giving her a hard time in South City.</p>
<p begin="01:46:44.235" end="01:46:45.695" style="s2">You get yourself back here right now.</p>
<p begin="01:46:45.716" end="01:46:47.256" style="s2">And don&#39;t you dare bother her again.</p>
<p begin="01:46:47.915" end="01:46:48.655" style="s2">She really said that?</p>
<p begin="01:46:48.676" end="01:46:49.655" style="s2">Besides, even if she hadn&#39;t called,</p>
<p begin="01:46:49.676" end="01:46:50.375" style="s2">I was about to.</p>
<p begin="01:46:50.396" end="01:46:51.655" style="s2">I&#39;m not getting any younger, Elliot.</p>
<p begin="01:46:51.676" end="01:46:52.294" style="s2">If you don&#39;t come back,</p>
<p begin="01:46:52.315" end="01:46:53.575" style="s2">am I to assume you&#39;re just walking</p>
<p begin="01:46:53.596" end="01:46:54.575" style="s2">away from the family business?</p>
<p begin="01:46:55.035" end="01:46:56.415" style="s2">Fine, I&#39;ll come back.</p>
<p begin="01:46:58.476" end="01:46:59.615" style="s2">If you don&#39;t go back,</p>
<p begin="01:46:59.856" end="01:47:01.915" style="s2">I&#39;m worried Owen&#39;s son will make trouble again.</p>
<p begin="01:47:04.615" end="01:47:05.955" style="s2">Now that it&#39;s come to this,</p>
<p begin="01:47:06.096" end="01:47:07.636" style="s2">can I really keep bothering her?</p>
<p begin="01:47:08.056" end="01:47:09.756" style="s2">To the airport. Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:47:11.896" end="01:47:14.275" style="s2">Miss, I heard Mr. Prescott is back in Bayview.</p>
<p begin="01:47:14.415" end="01:47:15.756" style="s2">Weren&#39;t you too fine last night?</p>
<p begin="01:47:15.896" end="01:47:16.676" style="s2">What happened?</p>
<p begin="01:47:17.016" end="01:47:20.195" style="s2">Maybe it&#39;s because I rejected him. Why?</p>
<p begin="01:47:20.655" end="01:47:21.596" style="s2">Don&#39;t you like him?</p>
<p begin="01:47:21.695" end="01:47:23.115" style="s2">no but I have to do this</p>
<p begin="01:47:23.296" end="01:47:25.756" style="s2">because I need to know if he will go after the Sawyer</p>
<p begin="01:47:25.775" end="01:47:28.476" style="s2">Corporation to force my hand or to vent his anger</p>
<p begin="01:47:28.936" end="01:47:30.035" style="s2">he wouldn&#39;t go that far</p>
<p begin="01:47:30.775" end="01:47:32.315" style="s2">Mister Bell did you know</p>
<p begin="01:47:32.655" end="01:47:34.716" style="s2">my mother was killed by Gordon Crane</p>
<p begin="01:47:34.735" end="01:47:36.556" style="s2">and his daughter Elaine Crane</p>
<p begin="01:47:36.575" end="01:47:36.875" style="s2">what</p>
<p begin="01:47:37.136" end="01:47:38.075" style="s2">I need a lawyer</p>
<p begin="01:47:38.136" end="01:47:39.356" style="s2">I want the death penalty</p>
<p begin="01:47:39.535" end="01:47:40.875" style="s2">we&#39;ll fight for the death penalty</p>
<p begin="01:47:40.936" end="01:47:41.836" style="s2">before my mother died</p>
<p begin="01:47:42.096" end="01:47:43.195" style="s2">I think she suspected</p>
<p begin="01:47:43.415" end="01:47:44.596" style="s2">she warned me so many times to</p>
<p begin="01:47:44.615" end="01:47:45.836" style="s2">be careful of Gordon Crane</p>
<p begin="01:47:45.856" end="01:47:47.556" style="s2">but I always thought he&#39;s my father</p>
<p begin="01:47:47.655" end="01:47:49.096" style="s2">he, he wouldn&#39;t go that far</p>
<p begin="01:47:49.815" end="01:47:50.995" style="s2">this so this time</p>
<p begin="01:47:51.016" end="01:47:52.195" style="s2">I must be more cautious</p>
<p begin="01:47:53.016" end="01:47:55.075" style="s2">if Elliot Prescott pulls all technical support</p>
<p begin="01:47:55.096" end="01:47:56.915" style="s2">from the Sawyer Corporation because of this</p>
<p begin="01:47:56.936" end="01:47:57.756" style="s2">we&#39;re just starting out</p>
<p begin="01:47:57.775" end="01:47:59.115" style="s2">it&#39;s not too late to change course</p>
<p begin="01:47:59.415" end="01:48:00.836" style="s2">what if we&#39;re so in love now</p>
<p begin="01:48:00.856" end="01:48:02.636" style="s2">but in a couple of years he changes his mind</p>
<p begin="01:48:02.655" end="01:48:04.195" style="s2">then our Sawyer Corporation will</p>
<p begin="01:48:04.216" end="01:48:06.436" style="s2">be doomed beyond recovery. I see</p>
<p begin="01:48:06.936" end="01:48:09.476" style="s2">you want to use this opportunity to test Mr. Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:48:10.575" end="01:48:11.155" style="s2">Mm hmm</p>
<p begin="01:48:11.176" end="01:48:13.596" style="s2">you&#39;re right I know this is incredibly unfair to Elliot</p>
<p begin="01:48:13.615" end="01:48:15.476" style="s2">but the company comes first. I have to</p>
<p begin="01:48:15.615" end="01:48:16.875" style="s2">it was my mother&#39;s legacy</p>
<p begin="01:48:17.216" end="01:48:18.596" style="s2">miss, for your mother</p>
<p begin="01:48:18.815" end="01:48:20.476" style="s2">your happiness was what mattered most</p>
<p begin="01:48:20.575" end="01:48:22.476" style="s2">so I can&#39;t disappoint her not again</p>
<p begin="01:48:24.176" end="01:48:25.756" style="s2">Elliot please</p>
<p begin="01:48:26.216" end="01:48:27.155" style="s2">don&#39;t let me down</p>
<p begin="01:48:30.275" end="01:48:31.375" style="s2">what is this garbage</p>
<p begin="01:48:31.415" end="01:48:32.396" style="s2">get out and do it again</p>
<p begin="01:48:32.415" end="01:48:33.195" style="s2">yes sir</p>
<p begin="01:48:35.216" end="01:48:36.155" style="s2">what is it sir</p>
<p begin="01:48:36.176" end="01:48:37.756" style="s2">the tech department was asking about last</p>
<p begin="01:48:37.775" end="01:48:38.875" style="s2">month&#39;s deployment to the song group</p>
<p begin="01:48:38.896" end="01:48:39.955" style="s2">the technical consultants</p>
<p begin="01:48:40.056" end="01:48:41.275" style="s2">should we pull them back</p>
<p begin="01:48:41.535" end="01:48:42.315" style="s2">sir if you ask me</p>
<p begin="01:48:42.336" end="01:48:43.115" style="s2">we should pull them</p>
<p begin="01:48:43.136" end="01:48:44.115" style="s2">Norah is so ungrateful</p>
<p begin="01:48:44.136" end="01:48:45.636" style="s2">why do you insist on playing the good guy</p>
<p begin="01:48:45.815" end="01:48:46.396" style="s2">pull our team</p>
<p begin="01:48:46.415" end="01:48:47.415" style="s2">let&#39;s see how she reacts</p>
<p begin="01:48:48.296" end="01:48:49.455" style="s2">shut up</p>
<p begin="01:48:50.815" end="01:48:51.716" style="s2">am I that petty</p>
<p begin="01:48:52.256" end="01:48:53.035" style="s2">this is business</p>
<p begin="01:48:53.296" end="01:48:54.155" style="s2">the deal stands</p>
<p begin="01:48:54.815" end="01:48:56.676" style="s2">get more people from tech over to the Song Group</p>
<p begin="01:48:56.695" end="01:48:57.875" style="s2">I want that system built</p>
<p begin="01:48:58.336" end="01:48:59.596" style="s2">sir why are you doing this</p>
<p begin="01:49:00.056" end="01:49:01.596" style="s2">Sir you&#39;ve barely eaten in two weeks</p>
<p begin="01:49:02.256" end="01:49:03.556" style="s2">liking her is my problem</p>
<p begin="01:49:03.735" end="01:49:04.875" style="s2">she doesn&#39;t owe me a thing</p>
<p begin="01:49:05.415" end="01:49:06.235" style="s2">get out</p>
<p begin="01:49:07.375" end="01:49:08.275" style="s2">I&#39;ll see myself out</p>
<p begin="01:49:10.216" end="01:49:11.356" style="s2">are you saying that the technical</p>
<p begin="01:49:11.375" end="01:49:12.915" style="s2">consultants from the Brooks Group are leaving</p>
<p begin="01:49:13.256" end="01:49:15.396" style="s2">yes I offered them top tier compensation</p>
<p begin="01:49:15.455" end="01:49:16.716" style="s2">but I just can&#39;t keep them</p>
<p begin="01:49:16.775" end="01:49:17.756" style="s2">if they insist on leaving</p>
<p begin="01:49:17.775" end="01:49:19.315" style="s2">it&#39;s most likely the Brooks Group&#39;s intention</p>
<p begin="01:49:19.455" end="01:49:20.476" style="s2">if it&#39;s the group&#39;s intention</p>
<p begin="01:49:20.495" end="01:49:22.035" style="s2">then it&#39;s Elliot Prescott&#39;s intention</p>
<p begin="01:49:22.575" end="01:49:23.676" style="s2">miss it&#39;s OK</p>
<p begin="01:49:23.815" end="01:49:25.115" style="s2">I was already prepared for it</p>
<p begin="01:49:25.176" end="01:49:26.796" style="s2">miss those technical consultants said they just</p>
<p begin="01:49:26.815" end="01:49:27.636" style="s2">received a notice from Brooks Group</p>
<p begin="01:49:27.655" end="01:49:28.636" style="s2">the collaboration will continue</p>
<p begin="01:49:28.655" end="01:49:29.596" style="s2">and in a couple of days</p>
<p begin="01:49:29.615" end="01:49:31.476" style="s2">Brooks Group will send over a few more top experts</p>
<p begin="01:49:31.896" end="01:49:33.955" style="s2">that&#39;s great Mr Bell yes</p>
<p begin="01:49:33.976" end="01:49:35.436" style="s2">the company&#39;s in your hands for now</p>
<p begin="01:49:35.455" end="01:49:36.495" style="s2">I&#39;m going to bathe you</p>
<p begin="01:49:36.976" end="01:49:37.275" style="s2">OK</p>
<p begin="01:49:41.556" end="01:49:43.875" style="s2">what is it now more tacky rings to show off</p>
<p begin="01:49:44.856" end="01:49:46.035" style="s2">someone sounds jealous</p>
<p begin="01:49:46.256" end="01:49:47.516" style="s2">my Owen Prescott impressed</p>
<p begin="01:49:47.535" end="01:49:48.596" style="s2">the Blue Mountain Group</p>
<p begin="01:49:48.695" end="01:49:49.955" style="s2">he&#39;s marrying their Iris</p>
<p begin="01:49:50.256" end="01:49:52.756" style="s2">these all gifts from my future sour grapes</p>
<p begin="01:49:53.176" end="01:49:54.875" style="s2">fakes again I heard</p>
<p begin="01:49:55.415" end="01:49:56.836" style="s2">your small-town daughter-in-law</p>
<p begin="01:49:57.136" end="01:49:58.235" style="s2">hasn&#39;t been home in a while what</p>
<p begin="01:49:59.176" end="01:50:00.195" style="s2">did she run away</p>
<p begin="01:50:00.495" end="01:50:01.596" style="s2">it&#39;s none of your business</p>
<p begin="01:50:03.016" end="01:50:04.035" style="s2">I already know. I already know. I already know</p>
<p begin="01:50:04.256" end="01:50:05.356" style="s2">it&#39;s all over the news</p>
<p begin="01:50:05.735" end="01:50:07.315" style="s2">your small-town daughter-in-law</p>
<p begin="01:50:07.575" end="01:50:09.396" style="s2">she&#39;s the real St. Sinclair heiress</p>
<p begin="01:50:09.775" end="01:50:11.676" style="s2">she thinks she&#39;s too good for Elliot now</p>
<p begin="01:50:11.735" end="01:50:12.915" style="s2">now that she&#39;s a St. Sinclair</p>
<p begin="01:50:12.936" end="01:50:14.115" style="s2">she&#39;s cut you all off</p>
<p begin="01:50:14.556" end="01:50:15.075" style="s2">so what</p>
<p begin="01:50:15.336" end="01:50:17.275" style="s2">the head of the Prescott group is my son</p>
<p begin="01:50:20.615" end="01:50:22.275" style="s2">if not for that birthday banquet</p>
<p begin="01:50:22.296" end="01:50:24.075" style="s2">where the patriarch thought Nora was</p>
<p begin="01:50:24.096" end="01:50:25.556" style="s2">the woman from that painting</p>
<p begin="01:50:26.695" end="01:50:27.636" style="s2">you think he&#39;d have given</p>
<p begin="01:50:27.655" end="01:50:29.115" style="s2">Elliot the shares otherwise</p>
<p begin="01:50:29.735" end="01:50:31.155" style="s2">now that Nora&#39;s run off</p>
<p begin="01:50:31.216" end="01:50:33.155" style="s2">do you think the patriarch will change his mind</p>
<p begin="01:50:33.936" end="01:50:35.115" style="s2">who said I ran off</p>
<p begin="01:50:37.035" end="01:50:38.976" style="s2">Aunt Prescott, I&#39;ve just been busy managing</p>
<p begin="01:50:38.995" end="01:50:40.296" style="s2">the Sinclair group recently</p>
<p begin="01:50:40.315" end="01:50:41.575" style="s2">that&#39;s why I couldn&#39;t come back</p>
<p begin="01:50:42.396" end="01:50:43.976" style="s2">spreading rumors that I ran away</p>
<p begin="01:50:44.676" end="01:50:46.856" style="s2">it seems the last fall wasn&#39;t tragic enough</p>
<p begin="01:50:49.476" end="01:50:50.176" style="s2">you</p>
<p begin="01:50:50.676" end="01:50:51.516" style="s2">oh right</p>
<p begin="01:50:51.575" end="01:50:52.796" style="s2">I forgot to tell you</p>
<p begin="01:50:53.176" end="01:50:55.275" style="s2">the LAN Shan group is a shell company</p>
<p begin="01:50:55.936" end="01:50:56.756" style="s2">Aunt Prescott</p>
<p begin="01:50:57.016" end="01:50:58.636" style="s2">why do you keep making the same mistake</p>
<p begin="01:50:59.216" end="01:51:01.155" style="s2">consider your son&#39;s qualifications!</p>
<p begin="01:51:01.375" end="01:51:03.596" style="s2">no high society girl would ever be interested in him</p>
<p begin="01:51:03.615" end="01:51:04.596" style="s2">ha ha, jealousy</p>
<p begin="01:51:04.655" end="01:51:05.716" style="s2">you&#39;re all just jealous</p>
<p begin="01:51:05.775" end="01:51:07.256" style="s2">I&#39;m not wasting my breath on you</p>
<p begin="01:51:07.396" end="01:51:07.596" style="s2">hmm</p>
<p begin="01:51:08.856" end="01:51:09.495" style="s2">Auntie, Mom</p>
<p begin="01:51:11.856" end="01:51:13.035" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry I&#39;m late</p>
<p begin="01:51:13.655" end="01:51:14.436" style="s2">it&#39;s all right</p>
<p begin="01:51:14.735" end="01:51:15.716" style="s2">as long as you&#39;re still willing</p>
<p begin="01:51:15.735" end="01:51:16.596" style="s2">to see me as your mother</p>
<p begin="01:51:16.615" end="01:51:17.596" style="s2">that&#39;s better than anything</p>
<p begin="01:51:19.535" end="01:51:20.636" style="s2">oh, Mr. Lawson</p>
<p begin="01:51:20.935" end="01:51:21.716" style="s2">yes, Madam</p>
<p begin="01:51:21.775" end="01:51:22.955" style="s2">go tell Elliot immediately</p>
<p begin="01:51:23.216" end="01:51:24.195" style="s2">his wife is back</p>
<p begin="01:51:24.296" end="01:51:25.075" style="s2">yes, of course</p>
<p begin="01:51:26.016" end="01:51:27.275" style="s2">come, come, have a seat</p>
<p begin="01:51:28.495" end="01:51:30.075" style="s2">mom, that&#39;s a beautiful bracelet</p>
<p begin="01:51:30.375" end="01:51:32.875" style="s2">my mother had one just like it, which she left for me</p>
<p begin="01:51:33.336" end="01:51:35.556" style="s2">this one, your mother gave it to me</p>
<p begin="01:51:35.856" end="01:51:37.436" style="s2">her mother and I were very close</p>
<p begin="01:51:38.296" end="01:51:40.075" style="s2">that&#39;s why I brought Elliot to South Bridge</p>
<p begin="01:51:41.216" end="01:51:42.235" style="s2">tell me about my mom</p>
<p begin="01:51:42.815" end="01:51:43.716" style="s2">oh, of course</p>
<p begin="01:51:45.176" end="01:51:45.955" style="s2">Nora</p>
<p begin="01:51:55.896" end="01:51:56.676" style="s2">Elliot</p>
<p begin="01:51:57.415" end="01:51:59.356" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry I was so selfish</p>
<p begin="01:52:06.216" end="01:52:07.796" style="s2">I don&#39;t care, tell me</p>
<p begin="01:52:08.056" end="01:52:08.955" style="s2">do you like me</p>
<p begin="01:52:09.256" end="01:52:10.396" style="s2">of course I do</p>
<p begin="01:52:11.056" end="01:52:11.636" style="s2">from the start</p>
<p begin="01:52:11.655" end="01:52:13.075" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t let these feelings grow</p>
<p begin="01:52:13.695" end="01:52:15.875" style="s2">then I became Nora again</p>
<p begin="01:52:16.575" end="01:52:17.556" style="s2">I was so worried</p>
<p begin="01:52:18.216" end="01:52:22.716" style="s2">I just couldn&#39;t face my feelings thank you</p>
<p begin="01:52:23.375" end="01:52:24.716" style="s2">you make me want to be brave</p>
<p begin="01:52:25.596" end="01:52:26.636" style="s2">but didn&#39;t you tell my grandfather</p>
<p begin="01:52:26.655" end="01:52:27.075" style="s2">I was</p>
<p begin="01:52:27.915" end="01:52:29.716" style="s2">a huge bother to you in Southbridge</p>
<p begin="01:52:30.976" end="01:52:33.235" style="s2">you were I was trying to work</p>
<p begin="01:52:33.256" end="01:52:34.716" style="s2">but my head was full of you</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
